# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Central engines and object storage.** A new *engine* lookup extends the existing shared-database pattern to non-RDBMS services. Consumers can use centrally provisioned Redis, Memcached, RabbitMQ, Elasticsearch, Typesense, Qdrant and Unbound instances with isolated credentials, or retain an embedded sidecar. *sys-svc-objstore* and the new *objstore* lookup provide the same abstraction for SeaweedFS and MinIO, with lazy provider inclusion and object-storage integration across fourteen application roles."
msgstr "**Mga makinang Sentral at mga bagay na nakaimbak.** Isang bagong bagay *makina* Pinapalawig ng Lookup ang umiiral na share-database pattern sa mga serbisyong non-RDBMS. Maaaring gamitin ng mga mamimili ang pangunahing paglalaan Redis, Memcached, RabbitMQ, Elasticsearch, Typesense, Qdrant at Unbound Mga pagkakataon na may nabubukod na mga kredensiyal, o panatilihin ang isang nakapaloob na sidecar. *sys-svc-objstore* at ang bago *objstore* Ang hitsura ay naglalaan ng gayunding mahirap unawaing bagay SeaweedFS at MinIO, kasama ng tamad provider isama at object-storage integrated sa labing-apat na application papel."

# translated-by: libretranslate
