msgid "**Dependencies**"
msgstr "**Maaasahan**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dependency Integration:** Works in conjunction with related roles for comprehensive backup management."
msgstr "**Paglilipat ng Dependensiya:** Mga gawain kaugnay ng kaugnay na mga papel para sa komprehensibong pamamahalang backup."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dependency Integration:** Works seamlessly with the [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) and [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) roles."
msgstr "**Paglilipat ng Dependensiya:** Mga Gawang Walang Kapintasan sa mga [sys-ctl-alm-telegram](../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md) at [sys-ctl-alm-email](../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md) papel."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Dependency Integration:** Works seamlessly with the `sys-ctl-alm-telegram <../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md>`__ and `sys-ctl-alm-email <../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md>`__ roles."
msgstr "**Paglilipat ng Dependensiya:** Mga Gawang Walang Kapintasan sa mga `sys-ctl-alm-telegram <../sys-ctl-alm-telegram/README.md>`__ at `sys-ctl-alm-email <../sys-ctl-alm-email/README.md>`__ papel."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy iteration.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) re-derives the same plan via `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (the planner is a pure function shared between init and deploy) and runs one deploy per folder. **Every round deploys its full variant-aware include set.** Round R starts from a clean host (the previous round's include is purged before round R begins, see point 5), so every dep that round R needs MUST be redeployed."
msgstr "**Ilubog ang imploy feedation.** [deploy/cli.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/deploy/cli.py) Muling gawin ang parehong plano sa pamamagitan ng `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` (Ang planner ay isang dalisay na tungkulin na pinagsasaluhan sa pagitan ng init at ng paglalagay nito) at tumakbo ng isang stand sa bawat folder. **Kabilang sa bawat bilog ang set ng buong variant-aware nito.** Nagsisimula ang Round R mula sa isang malinis na host (Ang kasama sa nakaraang round ay nililinis bago magsimula ang round R, tingnan ang puntos 5), kaya ang bawat dep kaya ang round R ay nangangailangan ng MUST ay muling i-reeployed."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy on an Encrypted Server** You SHOULD install Infinito.Nexus on an encrypted server to prevent hosting providers from accessing end-user data. For a practical guide on setting up an encrypted server, refer to the [Hetzner Arch LUKS repository](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Learn more about [disk encryption](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) on Wikipedia.)"
msgstr "**Deploy sa Isang Incrypted Server** Kailangang magluklok ka Infinito.Nexus sa isang encrypted server upang pigilan ang mga hosting providers sa pag-access ng mga end-user data. Para sa isang praktikal na giya sa pagtatatag ng isang encrypted server, tumutukoy sa [Htzner Arch LUKS Position](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/hetzner-arch-luks) 🔐. (Alamin ang higit pa tungkol sa [disk cryption](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disk_encryption) tungkol sa Wikipedia.)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy** the Let’s Encrypt challenge-and-redirect snippet from ``sys-svc-letsencrypt``."
msgstr "**Lumulutang** Ang Letigers Encrypt hamon-and-redirect snippet mula sa ``sys-svc-letsencrypt``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploy** the Let’s Encrypt challenge-and-redirect snippet from `sys-svc-letsencrypt`."
msgstr "**Lumulutang** Ang Letigers Encrypt hamon-and-redirect snippet mula sa `sys-svc-letsencrypt`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deployment and packaging foundations.** A host deployment mode joins Compose and Swarm in the deployment tooling. The former *sys-package*, *sys-aur* and *sys-aur-install* roles were replaced by a distribution-independent package registry. Volume metadata now uses one canonical schema, single-file mounts become Swarm configs, and service placement, replica counts, dependencies, addresses and health probes resolve through deployment-aware lookups."
msgstr "**Deployment at mga pundasyon ng pag - iimpake.** Ang isang host depostment mode ay sumali sa Composse at Swarm sa pag-play ng mga kasangkapan. Ang nauna *Sis-package*, *Sis-aur* at *Sis-aur-install* Ang mga papel ay pinalitan ng distribusyon-independiyenteng package register. Ang Volum metadata ngayon ay gumagamit ng isang kanonikal na schema, ang mga single-file mounts ay nagiging Swarm conclusions, at service placement, replikate counts, dependencies, addresss at health probes fixed sa pamamagitan ng pag-setment-aware seeups."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploys and enables a systemd user service** for ``ssh-agent``."
msgstr "**Deploys at nagpapangyari sa isang systemd user service** para sa ``ssh-agent``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Deploys and enables a systemd user service** for `ssh-agent`."
msgstr "**Deploys at nagpapangyari sa isang systemd user service** para sa `ssh-agent`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** ACME client for automated Let's Encrypt SSL/TLS certificate issuance and renewal via webroot or DNS-01 challenges"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Client ng ACME para sa AutomaticLet's Encrypt SSL/TLS sertipiko ng issurance at pagbabago sa pamamagitan ng webroot o DNS-01 Mga hamon"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** AI-first code editor installed on the workstation, whose endpoint override stays an operator step"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Ang isang I-first code editor na naka-install sa workstation, na ang endpoint ay nananatiling isang operator step"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Aggregate NGINX sub-filter injector adding Matomo tracking, global theming, iFrame and JS snippets by feature flag"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Aggregate NGINX sub-fitter injectionor na nagdaragdag Matomo Pagsubaybay, pangglobong paggamit ng mga ito, iFrame at JS snipets sa pamamagitan ng tampok na bandila"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Aggregate desktop environment bundling caffeine, shell extensions, and terminal into a complete GNOME setup on Linux"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Ang kapaligiran ng agggregate desktop na nag - aalis ng caffeine, mga extension ng kabibi, at terminal tungo sa isang kumpletong pag - aayos sa Linux"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Ansible helper role for idempotent persistence and lookup of per-user application tokens in a local YAML store"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Maaaring makatulong na papel para sa idempotenteng pagtitiyaga at pagtanaw sa per-user application tokens sa isang lokal na tindahan ng YAML"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Arch Linux driver bundle for Epson multifunction printing and scanning via escpr and imagescan"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Ang drayber ng Arch Linux ay may bungkos para sa Epson multifunction printing at scanning sa pamamagitan ng escpr at imahecan"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Automated recovery service restarting exited or unhealthy Docker Compose stacks and resolving port conflicts"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Ang serbisyo sa pagpapagaling na may kasamang makina na muling lumalabas o hindi mabuti sa katawan Docker Compose mga salansan at paglutas sa mga alitan sa daungan"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Automation role for reverse DNS (PTR) records on Hetzner Cloud servers, primary IPs, floating IPs, and load balancers"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Papel ng awtomisyon para sa reverse DNS (PTR) mga rekord sa Hetzner Cloud servers, pangunahing mga IP, lumulutang na mga IP, at mga tagabalanse ng kargada"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Base development environment for software engineers on Linux, with core editors and language-agnostic tooling"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Base development environment para sa mga software engineer sa Linux, na may core editors at language-agnostic tooling"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Base role for systemd manager configuration via drop-ins, default settings, and unit validation"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Base papel para sa systemd manager configuration sa pamamagitan ng drop-ins, default settings, at unit factuation"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Browser-based spinning wheel app for decision making, random selection, and gamification"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Browser-based iikot wheel app para sa paggawa ng desisyon, random selection, at gramification"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Browser-facing admin interface for the shared LLM gateway, published on its own domain behind the front proxy"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Browser-facing admin interface para sa kabahaging gateway ng LLM, na inilathala sa sarili nitong domain sa likod ng unang proxy"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Build-time tool for simulating root-owned file operations without elevated privileges during package builds"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Magtayo ng-time na kagamitan para sa pag-iinam ng root-owed file operations nang walang mataas na pribilehiyo sa panahon ng pagbuo ng pakete"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central Dockerized search engine shared by multiple apps with per-consumer scoped API keys"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Central Dockerized search engine na pinagsasaluhan ng multiple apps na may per-consumer curcled API key"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central document extraction engine that turns uploaded files into text for retrieval-augmented chat"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Ang Central document engine na kumukuha ng mga talaksan na may karga ay ginagawang teksto para sa recombinal-augmented chat"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central in-memory caching engine with per-consumer key-prefix isolation, usable centrally or as an embedded sidecar"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Gitnang in-memory caching engine na may per-consumer key-prefix na pag-iisa, unibersal na sentral o bilang isang nakapaloob na sidecar"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central loader role for ordered shared-service preloading and queued post-load role inclusions across the deployment"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Central loader papel para sa inorder na share-service preloading at queued post-load na papel na nakapaloob sa ibayo ng depostment"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central logout proxy for single-action sign-out across all OIDC-connected apps, with Nginx snippets and a live status UI"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Central logout proxy para sa single-action sign-out sa ibayo ng lahat ng OIDC-nected apps, na may Nginx snipets at isang live status UI"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central mail orchestration layer routing host mail through Mailu, msmtp, or an optional local SMTP relay"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Ang Central mail orkestration layer na tumatalunton sa mga sulat ng host Mailu, msmtp, o isang opsyonal na lokal na SMTP relay"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central recursive/forwarding DNSSEC resolver on a static IP for consumer stacks to target as their DNS"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Central revisive/forwarding DNSSEC finaler sa isang static IP para sa mga customer stack upang maasinta bilang kanilang DNS"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Description:** Central search and analytics engine with per-consumer index namespaces isolating tenants in a shared Docker deployment"
msgstr "**Paglalarawan:** Ang Central search at analytics engine na may per-consumer index namespaces na nagbubukod ng mga nangungupahan sa isang kabahaging Docker depostment"

