msgid "**Do not alert on ``vault_core_unsealed``.** OpenBao keeps Vault’s metric namespace, and a healthy unsealed node emits ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, so an alert on ``== 0`` fires permanently. Use ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 while sealed); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` corroborates."
msgstr "**Huwag maging alisto ``vault_core_unsealed``.** Ang OpenBao ay nagpapanatili sa Vaultiles metrikong pangalan naspace, at isang malusog na walang tatak na node ay naglalabas ``vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0``, kaya maging alisto ``== 0`` ay permanenteng nagpapaputok. Gamitin ``/v1/sys/health`` (503 habang nasasarhan); ``vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1`` Mga patotoo."

