# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Embodied / dedicated-device mode moves the trust boundary to the whole device.** For an agent that owns and explores a single-purpose machine (a robot platform, a home-assistant appliance), the isolation boundary is the entire dedicated node, not a guest kernel inside it. Privileged/full host access (`/dev`, GPIO, sensors, cameras, host network) is allowed **only** on a node that is dedicated, single-tenant, network-segmented, and explicitly opted in, with the blast radius documented in the role README. It is **forbidden on any shared cluster node**: agents on shared infrastructure always stay under Decision #4. This is the deliberate exception that keeps the general rule intact rather than a hole in it."
msgstr "**Ang Emboblise / dedikadong-device mode ay naglilipat ng hangganan ng tiwala sa buong aparato.** Para sa isang ahente na nagmamay-ari at tumutuklas ng isang nag-iisang-layunin na makina (isang plataporma ng robot, isang pantahanang - gamit na kagamitan), ang hangganan ng pagbubukod ay ang buong dedikadong node, hindi isang panauhing kernel sa loob nito. Pribilehiyo/full host access (`/dev`, GPIO, sensor, kamera, host network) pinapayagan **yaon lamang** sa isang node na dedikado, single-tenant, network-segmented, at malinaw na pinili, na ang pagsabog ay naka-redirect na dokumentado sa papel na ClaCHME. Ito ay **ipinagbabawal sa anumang partikulong node**: Ang mga ahente sa parehong imprastraktura ay laging nananatili sa ilalim ng Pasiya #4. Ito ang sinadyang eksepsiyon na nagpapanatili sa pangkalahatang tuntunin sa halip na isang butas dito."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Enable Two-Factor Authentication (2FA)** You MUST enable 2FA whenever possible. Many password managers (like KeePassXC) can generate [TOTP](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time-based_One-Time_Password) tokens, adding an extra layer of security even if your password is compromised. Synchronize your password database across devices using the [Nextcloud Client](https://nextcloud.com/) 📱💻."
msgstr "**Makahulugang Dalawang-Factor Regulatoration (2FA)** Kaya Mo 2FA kailanma't maaari. Maraming manedyer ng password (tulad ng KeePassXC) maaaring lumikha [TOTP](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Time-based_One-Time_Password) Paunawa, pagdaragdag ng karagdagang seguridad kahit na ang iyong password ay nakompromiso. Isanchronize ang iyong password database sa ibang device gamit ang mga device [Nextcloud Kliente](https://nextcloud.com/) 📱💻."

