msgid "**Internal container port.** Lives inside the container's network namespace, addressed by other containers on the same role-local network. NOT a host-bound port. Multiple roles MAY legitimately declare the same value (e.g. several nginx-based apps with `internal: { http: 80 }`)."
msgstr "**Internasyunal na port ng container.** Mga buhay sa loob ng network namespace ng container, na binibigyang pansin ng iba pang mga lalagyan sa parehong papel-local network. HINDI isang port ng host-bound. Ang maraming papel ay maaaring lehitimong magpahayag ng gayunding halaga (e.g. ilang mga sininx-based apps na may `internal: { http: 80 }`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Internal only:** no published port and no proxy entry, so the kernel is reachable from the container network alone."
msgstr "**Loob lamang:** walang inilathalang port at walang proxy entry, kaya ang kernel ay maaabot mula sa network ng container lamang."

