# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Inventory folders.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) calls [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), which creates one folder per round at `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (or just `<inventory-dir>` when there is a single round). For each folder, `build_dev_inventory` resolves the round's per-app variant payload and bakes it into the inventory's `host_vars` as `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` overrides. The inventory is therefore variant-resolved on disk; no runtime selector is needed."
msgstr "**Inventory folders.** [init.py](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/init.py) mga tawag [build_dev_inventory_matrix](../../../cli/administration/deploy/development/inventory/builder.py), na lumilikha ng isang folder sa bawat bilog `<inventory-dir>-<round>` (o makatarungan `<inventory-dir>` kapag may isang bilog). Para sa bawat folder, `build_dev_inventory` ang per-app variant payload ng round at niluluto ito sa imbentaryo's `host_vars` gaya ng `applications.<app>: <variant-payload>` ay nangingibabaw. Ang imbentaryo samakatuwid ay variant-resolved sa disk; walang runtime selector ang kinakailangan."

