# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Isolation is gVisor on top of in-app sandboxing; Firecracker is out of reach on this engine.** Each agent app runs under `runtime: runsc`, a userspace guest kernel that intercepts syscalls before they reach the host, so untrusted model-generated code stays kernel-isolated even if the app's own sandbox is bypassed. No custom VMM, jailer wiring, or bespoke rootfs pipeline. E2B/Beam noted as alternatives in the role README but not adopted."
msgstr "**Ang pagbubukod ay gVisor sa ibabaw ng in-app sandboxing; ang Firecracker ay hindi maaabot sa makinang ito.** Ang bawat agent app ay tumatakbo sa ilalim `runtime: runsc`, ang isang userspace bisita kernel na humaharang ng mga syscals bago sila makarating sa host, kaya ang hindi ipinagkatiwalang model-generated code ay nananatiling kernel-isolated kahit na ang sariling sandbox ng app ay bypass. Walang kaugalian na VMM, mga kawad ng bantay - preso, o binibigkas na roofs pipeline. E2B/Beam na kilala bilang mga alternatibo sa papel na CREME ngunit hindi pinagtibay."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Isolation:** Every agent runs in its own container or single-replica service under the isolating runtime, with its own volume, its own network whose only other member is the broker, and its own bearer key; an agent that would start under ``runc`` is stopped and refused."
msgstr "**Pagbubukod:** Ang bawat ahente ay tumatakbo sa sarili nitong lalagyan o serbisyong pang-isahang-replica sa ilalim ng nagbubukod na runtime, na may sariling volume, sariling network na ang tanging ibang kasapi ay ang broker, at ang sariling nagdadalang susi nito; isang ahente na magsisimula sa ilalim ng ilalim nito ``runc`` ay humihinto at tinatanggihan."

