# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Keycloak sign-in:** With Keycloak in the deployment, the role sets ``services.sso.flavor: oidc`` and the LiteLLM Gateway reads the platform’s OIDC endpoints from ``GENERIC_CLIENT_ID``, ``GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET``, ``GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT``, ``GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT`` and ``GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT``. Sign in at ``/sso/key/generate``; ``PROXY_ADMIN_ID`` carries the administrator’s username. LiteLLM serves SSO for up to five accounts in ``litellm_usertable`` and refuses beyond that without ``LITELLM_LICENSE``."
msgstr "**Keycloak sign-in:** Kasama Keycloak sa paglalagay, ang papel na ginagampanan ay ``services.sso.flavor: oidc`` at ang LiteLLM Gateway basahin ang platform Events OIDC endpoints mula sa ``GENERIC_CLIENT_ID``, ``GENERIC_CLIENT_SECRET``, ``GENERIC_AUTHORIZATION_ENDPOINT``, ``GENERIC_TOKEN_ENDPOINT`` at ``GENERIC_USERINFO_ENDPOINT``. Tanda sa ``/sso/key/generate``; ``PROXY_ADMIN_ID`` ang pangalan ng administrador. Pinaglilingkuran ng LitLM ang SSO ng hanggang limang salaysay sa ``litellm_usertable`` at tumatanggi nang higit pa riyan kung wala ``LITELLM_LICENSE``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
