msgstr "**Pagsusuri, Babala & Anatiko** 📊 Itinayo-in system, application, at security monitoring gamit ang multi-channel notifications."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Monitoring:** Prometheus scrapes `/v1/sys/metrics` on the role-local network. A sealed node is detected from `/v1/sys/health`, which answers 503 while sealed and 200 once unsealed."
msgstr "**Pagsusuri:** Mga Pangkay na Prometheus `/v1/sys/metrics` sa papel-lokal na network. Natutunton ang isang saradong node mula sa `/v1/sys/health`, na sumasagot 503 habang tinatatakan at isinasara 200 dating walang tatak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
