# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Physical safety is the operator's responsibility, and the role MUST say so.** This role does NOT mandate an emergency-stop or motion rate-limits as a platform acceptance criterion. Because an agent driving motors/actuators can cause physical harm, the README MUST prominently warn that hardware safety (e-stop, current/motion limits, fail-safe wiring) is the operator's responsibility and is out of the platform's scope. The role MUST NOT claim any safety guarantee it does not enforce."
msgstr "**Ang pisikal na kaligtasan ay pananagutan ng operator, at ang papel na MUST ay nagsasabi ng gayon.** Ang papel na ito ay hindi nag-uutos ng isang emergency-stop o motion rate-limits bilang isang platform reasure. Dahil ang isang agent na nagpapatakbo ng mga motor/actuators ay maaaring magdulot ng pisikal na pinsala, ang ClaCHME MUST ay prominenteng nagbabala na ang kaligtasan ng hardware (Ang e-stop, kasalukuyang/motion limits, ay bigo-ligtas na kawad) ay responsibilidad ng operator at wala sa saklaw ng plataporma. Ang bahaging MUST HINDI inaangkin ang anumang garantiya ng kaligtasan na hindi nito ipinatutupad."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Pin**: a concrete stable v15.x semver (no `:latest`, no `:edge`, no v14 LTS, no v16 pre-release line)."
msgstr "**Pin**: isang kongkretong kuwadra v15.x semver (hindi `:latest`, hindi `:edge`, walang v14 LTS, walang v16 pre-release line)."

