# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Preloaded models:** Every entry of ``services.lmstudio.preload_models`` is downloaded on the hosting node with ``lms get --gguf``, overlapped and reaped like the Ollama pre-pull. Each entry carries the ``source`` repository to download, the ``quant`` variant to take from it, the ``name`` LM Studio indexes that repository under and the gateway addresses it by, and the ``alias`` the gateway publishes it as. ``source`` is a full Hugging Face URL, never a search term: a search term resolves to whichever model the catalogue lists first. ``quant`` is appended as ``@<variant>`` and is required: without it LM Studio picks the variant itself, and the ``file``, ``sha256`` and ``bytes`` the entry declares then describe a guess that the store check and the download budget are both measured against."
msgstr "**Mga patiunang modelo:** Bawat pasukan ``services.lmstudio.preload_models`` ay download sa hosting node ``lms get --gguf``, magkasanib at umani na gaya ng Ollama pre-pull. Bawat pasukan ay nagdadala ng ``source`` Repositong kukunin, ang ``quant`` Kakaibang paraan upang alisin ito, ang ``name`` LM Studio Ang mga indise na kinalalagyan sa ilalim at ang pintuang - daan ang tumatawag dito, at ang pinto ``alias`` ang pintuan ay naglalathala nito na parang. ``source`` ay isang ganap na Face URL, hindi kailanman isang search term: isang search terms to where mode the katalogo lists first. ``quant`` ay inuuri bilang ``@<variant>`` at kinakailangan: kung wala ito LM Studio ang mismong pagkakaiba, at ang ``file``, ``sha256`` at ``bytes`` Saka inilalarawan ng entry ang hula na ang tseke ng tindahan at ang badyet ng download ay kapuwa sinusukat nang laban."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Preloaded models:** Every entry of `services.lmstudio.preload_models` is downloaded on the hosting node with `lms get --gguf`, overlapped and reaped like the Ollama pre-pull. Each entry carries the `source` repository to download, the `quant` variant to take from it, the `name` LM Studio indexes that repository under and the gateway addresses it by, and the `alias` the gateway publishes it as. `source` is a full Hugging Face URL, never a search term: a search term resolves to whichever model the catalogue lists first. `quant` is appended as `@<variant>` and is required: without it LM Studio picks the variant itself, and the `file`, `sha256` and `bytes` the entry declares then describe a guess that the store check and the download budget are both measured against."
