# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Revalidation required:** [ADR 0003 - One MCP surface per provider, and a disposition for every role](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md) holds the exhaustive per-role audit and the standing contract, and supersedes this document where this document assumes an empty baseline, treats metadata as enforcement, or marks client provisioning and end-to-end authorization complete. The remaining work is tracked in [035 - MCP Proxy Expansion and Application Interconnection](035-mcp-proxy-expansion.md). Checked items below describe the original implementation slice and MUST NOT be read as proof that the stricter identity, revocation, transport, restart, proxy, and real-tool-call criteria in requirement 035 are complete."
msgstr "**Kailangan ang pagsasauli:** [ADR 0003 - Isang MCP na ibabaw sa bawat provider, at isang ugali sa bawat papel](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md) ay humahawak ng tambulitive per-role audit at ang nakatayong kontrata, at pumapalit sa dokumentong ito kung saan ang dokumentong ito ay nagpapalagay ng isang walang laman na baseline, tinatrato ang metadata bilang pagpapatupad, o markahan ang kliyente na probisyon at end-to-end reference kumpleto. Ang natitirang gawain ay sinusubaybayan [035 - MCP Progression Expansion and Appliment Interconnection](035-mcp-proxy-expansion.md). Checked na mga bagay sa ibaba ay naglalarawan sa orihinal na pagpapatupad na hiwa at MUST HINDI mababasa bilang patunay na ang mas mahigpit na pagkakakilanlan, pagpapawalang-bisa, paghahatid, retart, proxy, at real-tool-calt batayan sa kahilingan 035 ay kumpleto."

