# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO authentication:** Access is protected by Keycloak via oauth2-proxy."
msgstr "**Pagtiyak sa SSO:** Ipinagsasanggalang ng Keycloak sa pamamagitan ng oauth2-proxy."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO flavor is `oauth2`** (oauth2-proxy sidecar → Keycloak), NOT native OIDC — because Checkmk Raw has no OIDC. The oauth2-proxy authenticates against Keycloak and passes `X-Remote-User`; Checkmk's site Apache trusts it via `auth_by_http_header`. This mirrors [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)'s header-SSO bridge (`OPENPROJECT_AUTH__SOURCE__SSO_HEADER` + LDAP-gated header trust)."
msgstr "**Ang lasa ng SSO ay `oauth2`** (Oauth2-proxy sidecar → Keycloak), HINDI katutubo OIDC — dahil Checkmk Si Raw ay walang OIDC. Ang oauth2-proxy kapania laban sa Keycloak at dumaraan `X-Remote-User`; Ang site ng checkmk na Apache ay nagtitiwala rito sa pamamagitan ng `auth_by_http_header`. Itong mga salamin [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)'pangulo-SSO tulay (`OPENPROJECT_AUTH__SOURCE__SSO_HEADER` + LDAP-gated header trust)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**SSO round-trip test:** ``test-oidc-login.js`` drives ``/sso/key/generate`` through the Keycloak login form and asserts the UI no longer falls back to its own password gate."
msgstr "**Pagsubok sa SSO round-trip:** ``test-oidc-login.js`` mga drive ``/sso/key/generate`` sa pamamagitan ng Keycloak Ang login form at iginigiit ang UI ay hindi na bumabalik sa sarili nitong password gate."

# translated-by: libretranslate
