# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Sandbox** (precedence 3): everything else runs under `allowWrite` / `denyRead` / `allowedDomains`. Writes outside `allowWrite` fail with `EROFS`; reads from `~/.ssh`, `~/.gnupg`, `~/.aws`, etc. are denied; outbound connections to anything not in `allowedDomains` fail."
msgstr "**Sandbox** (Unahin 3): lahat ng iba pang bagay ay nasa ilalim ng lupa `allowWrite` / `denyRead` / `allowedDomains`. Sumulat sa labas `allowWrite` bigo `EROFS`; magbasa mula sa `~/.ssh`, `~/.gnupg`, `~/.aws`, atbp. ay itinanggi; outbound koneksiyon sa anumang hindi in `allowedDomains` ay nabibigo."

