# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Self-registration** is *on* when OIDC is enabled and *off* otherwise — also derived from the ``sso`` service flag. Penpot routes first-time OIDC logins through the registration path (a disabled flag makes the callback fail with ``?error=registration-disabled`` for not-yet-provisioned users), so registration must stay on wherever OIDC is. Native admin is bootstrapped and LDAP self-provisions without it. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` renders ``enable-registration`` / ``disable-registration`` accordingly."
msgstr "**Pagpaparehistro sa Sarili** ay *patuloy* kapag nagawa at nagawa ang OIDC *off* Kung hindi — hinango rin mula sa ``sso`` bandilang pangserbisyo. Mga ruta ng Penpot first-time OIDC logins sa pamamagitan ng rehistro path (dahil sa isang may kapansanang bandila, ang callback ay natatanggal ``?error=registration-disabled`` para sa mga hindi-yet-provised na tagagamit), kaya ang pagpaparehistro ay dapat manatili saanman naroon ang OIDC. Katutubong admin ay boostrapped at LDAP self-provisions na wala nito. ``PENPOT_FLAGS`` salin ``enable-registration`` / ``disable-registration`` Kasuwato nito."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Self-registration** is *on* when OIDC is enabled and *off* otherwise — also derived from the `sso` service flag. Penpot routes first-time OIDC logins through the registration path (a disabled flag makes the callback fail with `?error=registration-disabled` for not-yet-provisioned users), so registration must stay on wherever OIDC is. Native admin is bootstrapped and LDAP self-provisions without it. `PENPOT_FLAGS` renders `enable-registration` / `disable-registration` accordingly."
msgstr "**Pagpaparehistro sa Sarili** ay *patuloy* kapag nagawa at nagawa ang OIDC *off* Kung hindi — hinango rin mula sa `sso` bandilang pangserbisyo. Mga ruta ng Penpot first-time OIDC logins sa pamamagitan ng rehistro path (dahil sa isang may kapansanang bandila, ang callback ay natatanggal `?error=registration-disabled` para sa mga hindi-yet-provised na tagagamit), kaya ang pagpaparehistro ay dapat manatili saanman naroon ang OIDC. Katutubong admin ay boostrapped at LDAP self-provisions na wala nito. `PENPOT_FLAGS` salin `enable-registration` / `disable-registration` Kasuwato nito."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Sentinel `__ALL__` in the `whitelist` input** (case-insensitive). The diff logic MUST be skipped and an empty whitelist MUST be emitted, which deploys everything in the workflow's scope. This is the explicit opt-out from diff narrowing for manual dispatch."
msgstr "**Sentinel `__ALL__` sa loob `whitelist` input** (-insensitive). Ang diff logic MUST ay itigil at isang walang laman na whitelist MUST ay ilalabas, na naglalagay ng lahat ng bagay sa saklaw ng workflow. Ito ang maliwanag na opt-out mula sa diff na pagkipot para sa manu-manong pahatid."

