# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Why this set?** [Debian](https://www.debian.org) is preferred for stable community-operated servers because it offers long-term support without commercial backing requirements. [Fedora](https://fedoraproject.org) and [CentOS](https://www.centos.org) are required to ensure compatibility with [Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL)](https://www.redhat.com/en/technologies/linux-platforms/enterprise-linux) environments. Red Hat support MUST be guaranteed because enterprise customers operate under SLA and security compliance requirements that mandate a RHEL-compatible platform, including certified package versions, SELinux enforcement, and vendor-backed security advisories. [Arch Linux](https://archlinux.org) is included to catch integration problems with newer software versions early in the development cycle before they reach stable distributions."
msgstr "**Bakit?** [Debian](https://www.debian.org) ay mas pinipili para sa matatag na community-operated servers dahil ito ay nagbibigay ng long-term support nang walang mga kahilingan sa komersyal na suporta. [Fedora](https://fedoraproject.org) at [MGA CentO](https://www.centos.org) ay kailangan upang matiyak ang pagiging kasuwato ng [Red Hat Enterprise Linux (RHEL)](https://www.redhat.com/en/technologies/linux-platforms/enterprise-linux) kapaligiran. Ang Red Hat support MUST ay magagarantiyahan dahil ang mga parokyano ng negosyo ay kumikilos sa ilalim ng mga kahilingan ng SLA at seguridad na nag-uutos ng isang RHEL-compatiable platform, kabilang ang mga sertipikadong mga bersyon ng pakete, pagpapatupad ng SPLA-backed security advisories. [Linux ng Arko](https://archlinux.org) ay kasama sa paghuli ng mga problema sa pagsasanib sa mas bagong mga bersiyon ng software sa unang bahagi ng siklo ng pag-unlad bago ito umabot sa matatag na distribusyon."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Why:** Friendica currently authenticates in two steps: oauth2-proxy gates the vhost (Keycloak-Authorization-Code-Flow, 2FA-enforceable), then the user must fill Friendica's own `/login` form because stock Friendica has **no header-trusted auto-login** — Owa.php / OAuth/Token.php only read `HTTP_AUTHORIZATION` for API endpoints, never for the web session. The ldapauth addon stays enabled solely as a first-login bootstrap that materialises the `friendica.user` row from openldap."
msgstr "**Bakit:** Friendica: oauth2- Mabusising pintuan ang vehost (Keycloak-Authorization-Code-Flow, 2PBA-enforceable), pagkatapos ay dapat punan ng gumagamit Friendica' `/login` anyo dahil sa stock Friendica mayroon **walang header-trusted auto-login** — Owa.php / OAuth/Token.php basahin lamang `HTTP_AUTHORIZATION` para sa API Mga endpoint, hindi para sa sesyon ng web. Ang ldapauth addon ay nagreresulta lamang bilang isang first-login bootrap na nagreresulta sa materyale ng `friendica.user` hanay mula sa openldap."

