# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**[Hermes Agent](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/)** (Nous Research, MIT). Self-hostable with `local`, `Docker`, `SSH`, `Singularity`, `Modal` backends plus container hardening. Ships an official web dashboard with **self-hosted OIDC** auth (fits the platform SSO), delegates work through **isolated subagents**, has persistent memory, scheduling, vision web browsing, and MCP support (**client since v0.2.0, server since v0.6.0**). Deployed as `web-app-hermes`."
msgstr "**[Ahente ni Hermes](https://hermes-agent.nousresearch.com/)** (Pananaliksik ni Nous, MIT). Makakasundo sa sarili `local`, `Docker`, `SSH`, `Singularity`, `Modal` Bukod pa sa paninigas ng lalagyan. Sakay ng isang opisyal na web dashboard **sarili-hosed OIDC** Hiwa (nakaakma sa platapormang SSO), ang mga delegado ay gumagawang puspusan **nabubukod na mga subahe**, ay may patuloy na memorya, iskedyul, pagtanaw sa web browse, at suporta ng MCP (**kliyente mula noong v0.2.0, server mula noong v0.6.0**). Hinango bilang . `web-app-hermes`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**[OpenClaw](https://openclaw.ai/)** (open-source, npm/pnpm). Built-in Gateway web dashboard (default port `18789`) plus CLI/TUI, browser control, filesystem sandbox, persistent memory, skills/plugins, and native MCP (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, both client and server). Deployed as `web-app-openclaw`."
msgstr "**[Buksan ang Batas](https://openclaw.ai/)** (open-source, npm/pnpm). Itinayo-in Gateway web dashboard (default port `18789`) Bukod sa CLI/TUI, browser control, filesystem sandbox, tuloy-tuloy na memorya, kasanayan/plugins, at katutubong MCP (`@modelcontextprotocol/sdk`, parehong kliyente at server). Hinango bilang . `web-app-openclaw`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`--full-cycle` (async update pass).** When set (or `full_cycle=true` on `make compose-deploy`), the wrapper runs each round's deploy TWICE: first the regular sync pass, then immediately a second pass with `-e ASYNC_ENABLED=true` overriding the host_var, against the SAME variant's folder, BEFORE moving to the next round. The two passes are therefore always co-located on the same host state; the async pass never accidentally targets a host that a previous round's variant left behind."
msgstr "**`--full-cycle` (Dumadaan ang async update).** Kapag Nakatakda (o `full_cycle=true` patuloy `make compose-deploy`), ang pambalot ay tumatakbo sa pagpo - pressure ng bawat round na TWICE: una ang regular na sabay - sabay na daanan, pagkatapos ay isang ikalawang paglipas agad `-e ASYNC_ENABLED=true` Pangunahin host_var, laban sa folder ng SAME variant, BAGO lumipat sa susunod na round. Ang dalawang mga daanan ay samakatuwid ay palaging co-located sa parehong host state; ang asya ay hindi aksidenteng target ang isang host na ang isang nakaraang round's variant na naiwan."

