# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`local.sh` — fully local, no external GitHub.** Checks the runner containers are healthy and the DooD socket works, then `container cp`s the repo into a runner, **builds the Infinito image locally**, and deploys `web-app-dashboard` (all other services disabled) inside a **sealed, throwaway Docker daemon** that shares the runner's network namespace. The sandbox is torn down on exit, so the host stack is never touched and **no GitHub/GHCR access is required**. On the async test pass the heavy deploy is skipped (it is validated once on the sync pass)."
msgstr "**`local.sh` — Talagang lokal, walang panlabas na GitHub.** Ang pagsusuri sa mga runner container ay malusog at ang DooD socket ay gumagana, pagkatapos ay saka `container cp`s ang repo upang maging mananakbo, **gumagawa ng lokal na larawan ng Infinito**, at mga gamit `web-app-dashboard` (lahat ng iba pang paglilingkod na may kapansanan) sa loob ng a **Isinara, itinapong Docker daemon** na kabahagi ng network namespace ng mananakbo. Ang kahon ng buhangin ay sinisira sa labasan, kaya ang salansan ng mga naroroon ay hindi kailanman nahawakan at nahahawakan **hindi kailangan ang GitHub/GHCR access**. Sa pagsusulit sa async, ang mabibigat na suplay ay hindi na ginagamit (Ito ay pinatutunayan minsan sa syncle pass)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`mechanism: bridge`** marks an addon that *is* a network/appservice bridge to an external system (e.g. a Matrix `mautrix` bridge to WhatsApp)."
msgstr "**`mechanism: bridge`** markahan ang isang addon na *ay* isang network/appservice bridge sa isang panlabas na sistema (e.g. a Matrix `mautrix` tulay sa WhatsApp)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`no_remote_surface` (27):** `svc-ai-ollama`, `svc-ai-robot`, `svc-ai-s1`, `svc-ai-searxng`, `svc-ai-tika`, `web-app-chess`, `web-app-dashboard`, `web-app-docs`, `web-app-fediwall`, `web-app-hugo`, `web-app-littlejs`, `web-app-mig`, `web-app-mini-qr`, `web-app-navigator`, `web-app-roulette-wheel`, `web-opt-rdr-domains`, `web-opt-rdr-www`, `web-svc-asset`, `web-svc-cdn`, `web-svc-coturn`, `web-svc-css`, `web-svc-file`, `web-svc-html`, `web-svc-legal`, `web-svc-logout`, `web-svc-mirror`, `web-svc-simpleicons`. These roles have no independently useful authenticated remote action contract at the pinned implementation. Static published content may later be consumed through one owning application's bounded `resource_readonly` adapter, but a new MCP sidecar that merely reimplements a static site's behaviour does not count as integration. Model tool calling in Ollama does not by itself make Ollama an MCP client or server."
msgstr "**`no_remote_surface` (27):** `svc-ai-ollama`, `svc-ai-robot`, `svc-ai-s1`, `svc-ai-searxng`, `svc-ai-tika`, `web-app-chess`, `web-app-dashboard`, `web-app-docs`, `web-app-fediwall`, `web-app-hugo`, `web-app-littlejs`, `web-app-mig`, `web-app-mini-qr`, `web-app-navigator`, `web-app-roulette-wheel`, `web-opt-rdr-domains`, `web-opt-rdr-www`, `web-svc-asset`, `web-svc-cdn`, `web-svc-coturn`, `web-svc-css`, `web-svc-file`, `web-svc-html`, `web-svc-legal`, `web-svc-logout`, `web-svc-mirror`, `web-svc-simpleicons`. Ang mga papel na ito ay walang independiyenteng magagamit na tiyak na remote action contract sa pindified pagpapatupad. Ang nilalamang smatic na inilathala ay maaaring gamitin sa dakong huli sa pamamagitan ng pag - iingat ng isang aplikasyon `resource_readonly` Ang pag-aangkop, ngunit ang isang bagong MCP sidecar na nagreresulta lamang ng isang static na pag-uugali ng site ay hindi ibinibilang bilang pagsasama-sama. Modelong kasangkapan na ginagamit Ollama ay hindi gumagawa sa ganang sarili Ollama isang kliyente ng MCP o server."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**`privileged_control_plane` (27):** `svc-ai-agent-broker`, `svc-ai-jupyter`, `svc-bkp-local-2-device`, `svc-bkp-nfs-2-local`, `svc-bkp-remote-2-local`, `svc-bkp-secrets-2-local`, `svc-bkp-volume-2-local`, `svc-dns-unbound`, `svc-net-firewall`, `svc-net-tor`, `svc-net-wireguard-core`, `svc-net-wireguard-firewalled`, `svc-net-wireguard-plain`, `svc-opt-keyboard-color`, `svc-opt-ssd-hdd`, `svc-opt-swapfile`, `svc-prx-openresty`, `svc-registry-cache`, `svc-registry-docker`, `svc-runner`, `svc-storage-nfs-client`, `svc-storage-nfs-server`, `svc-swarm-manager`, `svc-swarm-node`, `svc-virt-kata`, `update`, `web-app-openbao`. These roles can recover secrets, alter routing or host state, run code, change deployment state, or reach storage/control-plane sockets; they require a separate audited operations gateway and human approval rather than general-purpose application MCP."
msgstr "**`privileged_control_plane` (27):** `svc-ai-agent-broker`, `svc-ai-jupyter`, `svc-bkp-local-2-device`, `svc-bkp-nfs-2-local`, `svc-bkp-remote-2-local`, `svc-bkp-secrets-2-local`, `svc-bkp-volume-2-local`, `svc-dns-unbound`, `svc-net-firewall`, `svc-net-tor`, `svc-net-wireguard-core`, `svc-net-wireguard-firewalled`, `svc-net-wireguard-plain`, `svc-opt-keyboard-color`, `svc-opt-ssd-hdd`, `svc-opt-swapfile`, `svc-prx-openresty`, `svc-registry-cache`, `svc-registry-docker`, `svc-runner`, `svc-storage-nfs-client`, `svc-storage-nfs-server`, `svc-swarm-manager`, `svc-swarm-node`, `svc-virt-kata`, `update`, `web-app-openbao`. Ang mga papel na ito ay maaaring mabawi ang mga lihim, baguhin ang pagsakop o host na estado, tumakbo ng code, baguhin ang kalagayan ng paglalagay, o maabot ang mga imbakan/kontrol-planking-plane kits; ang mga ito ay nangangailangan ng hiwalay na auded operating gate at pagsang-ayon ng tao sa halip na pangkalahatang-purpose application MCP."

