# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Best-effort: the puppeteer browser is not downloaded here (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) so ``install-lint`` stays sandbox-safe. mmdc only needs a browser to RENDER, which ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` provisions on demand (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) right before it renders. That browser ships as a zip, so ``unzip`` is ensured here (puppeteer's extractor needs it, else it leaves an empty version dir and mmdc reports the browser missing). A failed install warns instead of aborting ``install-lint``, so sandboxes without npm/browser access still get the rest of the lint toolchain."
msgstr "Best-effort: ang papet browser ay hindi naka-download dito (``PUPPETEER_SKIP_DOWNLOAD``) gayo'y ``install-lint`` laging sandbox-ligtas. Ang mmdc ay nangangailangan lamang ng browser upang maging RENDER, na ``scripts/lint/mermaid.sh`` mga paglalaan kung kinakailangan (``npx puppeteer browsers install chrome-headless-shell``) Bago ito isalin. Ang mga barkong iyon ng browser ay parang siper, kaya ``unzip`` ay natitiyak dito (Kailangan ito ng tagaguhit ng papet, kung hindi ay nag - iiwan ito ng isang walang laman na dir ng bersyon at mmdc na nag - uulat na nawawala ang browser). Isang bigong install ay nagbabala sa halip na magpalaglag ``install-lint``, kaya ang mga sandbox na walang npm/browser access ay nakukuha pa rin ang natitirang lint toolchain."

