# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cleanup-workflow fixes (follow-up to the 11.1.0 cleanup automation): the *crs-k/stale-branches* action is pinned to *v9.0.1* (the previous *@v8* was unresolvable and failed the job) and its non-existent *protected-branches* input is replaced with the action's real *branches-filter-regex*; the GHCR CI-image cleanup script now reports what it scans, keeps and deletes with a per-package summary and a *DRY_RUN* mode, so a no-op run is no longer indistinguishable from a broken one."
msgstr "Mga fix ng Cleanup-workflow (susunod sa 11.1.0 Paglilinis ng awtomasyon): ang *crs-k/stale-foul* ang nangyayari *v9.0.1* (ang nauna *@v8* ay hindi mapasunod at nabigo sa trabaho) at ang non-existent nito *protektadong-kapital* Ang input ay pinapalitan ng reality ng aksyon *sangay-fitter-regex*; ang GHCR CI-image cleaning script ay nag-uulat ngayon ng kung ano ito ay scan, pinananatili at ini-deletes na may isang per-package na buod at a *DRY_RUN* Mode, kaya ang isang non-op run ay hindi na makikilala sa isang sira."

