# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients do not read the server list directly. [`lookup('mcp_servers')`](../../../../../plugins/lookup/mcp_servers.py) computes the intersection of the provider's admitted clients, resolved by `derive_allowed_consumers` in [`utils/roles/applications/mcp.py`](../../../../../utils/roles/applications/mcp.py), with the calling client's `supported_transports` and `supported_auths`, resolves each provider's declared credential, and returns:"
msgstr "Hindi tuwirang binabasa ng mga Client ang listahan ng server. [`lookup('mcp_servers')`](../../../../../plugins/lookup/mcp_servers.py) Ipuntos ang interseksiyon ng mga tinatanggap na kliyente ng provider, na nalutas ng `derive_allowed_consumers` sa loob [`utils/roles/applications/mcp.py`](../../../../../utils/roles/applications/mcp.py), sa pagtawag sa kliyente `supported_transports` at `supported_auths`, lutasin ang ipinahayag na katiyakan ng bawat tagapaglaan, at magbalik:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a Gitea personal access token as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. The token is issued against the administrator account and kept in `sys-token-store`. Its `auth_subject` is `administrator`, so MCP calls run with administrator rights rather than as the requesting user."
msgstr "Naghaharap ang mga Client Gitea personal na access bilang tanda `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Ang torta ay ipinalabas laban sa ulat ng administrador at itinago `sys-token-store`. `auth_subject` ay `administrator`, kaya ang MCP ay tumatawag na may mga karapatang administrador sa halip na bilang ang humihiling na tagagamit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a Gitea personal access token as ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. The token is issued against the administrator account and kept in ``sys-token-store``. Its ``auth_subject`` is ``administrator``, so MCP calls run with administrator rights rather than as the requesting user."
msgstr "Naghaharap ang mga Client Gitea personal na access bilang tanda ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. Ang torta ay ipinalabas laban sa ulat ng administrador at itinago ``sys-token-store``. ``auth_subject`` ay ``administrator``, kaya ang MCP ay tumatawag na may mga karapatang administrador sa halip na bilang ang humihiling na tagagamit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a long-lived access token as `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. The token is minted once per deployment and kept in `sys-token-store` under the `administrator` user, not in the role's `credentials:` block. An unauthenticated request is answered with 404: Home Assistant does not reveal the endpoint."
msgstr "Ang mga Client ay nag-aalok ng isang mahabang-buhay na akses na token bilang `Authorization: Bearer <token>`. Ang torta ay ginagawa minsan sa bawat gamit at itinatago `sys-token-store` sa ilalim ng `administrator` gumagamit, hindi sa papel `credentials:` block. Isang di - tiyak na kahilingan ang sinasagot 404: Ang home Assistant ay hindi nagsisiwalat ng endpoint."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Clients present a long-lived access token as ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. The token is minted once per deployment and kept in ``sys-token-store`` under the ``administrator`` user, not in the role’s ``credentials:`` block. An unauthenticated request is answered with 404: Home Assistant does not reveal the endpoint."
msgstr "Ang mga Client ay nag-aalok ng isang mahabang-buhay na akses na token bilang ``Authorization: Bearer <token>``. Ang torta ay ginagawa minsan sa bawat gamit at itinatago ``sys-token-store`` sa ilalim ng ``administrator`` gumagamit, hindi sa bahagi ng katawan ``credentials:`` block. Isang di - tiyak na kahilingan ang sinasagot 404: Ang home Assistant ay hindi nagsisiwalat ng endpoint."

