# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Cross-service probes (biber denied at prometheus, biber denied at matomo, dashboard tile reachability) are NOT part of the per-role biber persona. They live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), parameterised once over the provider's `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest. For the dashboard, the parameterised scenario delegates to `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, which owns the tile visibility / iframe-embed / \"Tab\" pop-out assertions in one SPOT."
msgstr "Cross-service probes (Ang biber ay nagkait sa prometheus, ang biber ay nagkait sa matomo, ang dashboard tile cantable) ay hindi bahagi ng per-role biber persona. Nakatira sila sa sariling spec ng tagapaglaan (`web-app-{prometheus,matomo,dashboard}/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`), isalang minsan sa provider `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` ay nakikita. Para sa dashboard, ang inihandang mga delegado sa senaryo `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/dashboard-card-flow.js::runDashboardCardScenario(page, context, target)`, na nagmamay-ari ng tile view / kung-imbed / \"Tab\" Iginiit ng pop-out sa isang SPOT."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service probes are NOT part of the per-role administrator persona. Dashboard tile reachability is owned by `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, which delegates the per-target body to the `runDashboardCardScenario` helper in `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile visible → click loads in `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" button pops the embed into a fresh browser tab). That helper is the SPOT for dashboard-tile mechanics; consumer specs MUST NOT reimplement any of those assertions. Prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity are owned by `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach and tracker presence are owned by `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest."
msgstr "Ang mga cross-service probes ay HINDI bahagi ng per-role administrator manga. Ang sukat ng baldosa sa Dashboard ay pag - aari ng `web-app-dashboard/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`, na nagbibigay ng per-target na katawan sa per-target `runDashboardCardScenario` katulong `dashboard-card-flow.js` (tile na nakikita → pasikut - sikot na mga kargada `#main iframe` → header \"Tab\" Ipinintang ng buton ang empanada sa bagong browser tab). Ang katulong na iyon ay ang SPOT para sa dashboard-tile mechanics; ang mga mamimili ay nag-eeksperimentong MUST HINDI muling binibigyang-diin ang alinman sa mga pag-aangkin na iyon. Ang prometheus admin-reach at screw paridad ay pag-aari ng `web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Matomo admin-reach at tracker presensiya ay pag-aari ng `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`. Tinutugtog ng bawat tagapaglaan ang paggigiit sa mga katangian nito `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` ay nakikita."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Cross-service surface assertions (dashboard tile reachability, prometheus admin-reach and scrape parity, matomo admin-reach and tracker presence, biber-denied-at-prometheus, biber-denied-at-matomo) are owned by the provider's own spec. Each provider parameterises the assertion over its `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` manifest, rendered via `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Consumer roles' personas MUST NOT duplicate these probes."
msgstr "Krus-service na mga pag-aangkin (dashboard tile goability, prometheus admin-reach at screw parity, matomo admin-reach at tracker presensiya, biber-deed-at-prometheus, biber-dened-at-matomo) ay pag - aari ng sariling spec ng tagapaglaan. Tinutugtog ng bawat tagapaglaan ang paggigiit sa ibabaw nito `<NAME>_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` mahayag, isinalin sa pamamagitan ng `lookup('roles_with_service', '<svc>')`. Mga tauhan ng MUST HINDI ginaya ng mga mamimili ang mga probe na ito."

