# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Deploys one chunk of the sweep. Every matrix row is a single `role#variant` carrying the deploy mode, onion state, distro and filesystem the rotation assigned it: `swarm` rows get a simulated 3-node DinD cluster with an NFS server plus a drain/reschedule state-survival assertion, `compose` and `host` rows run the single-node drill. When `whitelist` is empty, the discover job derives one from the branch's diff vs `origin/main`; see the \"Diff-driven app selection\" subsection in [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md). A row marked 📖 -- the role's smallest variant, see [instructions.md](instructions.md) -- replays the role README's `### Production` block on the same runner once the deploy has released it."
msgstr "Ilubog ang isang piraso ng alon. Bawat hanay ng matrix ay iisa `role#variant` Dala - dala ang nakalagay na mode, sibuyas, distro at filesystem ang atas dito: `swarm` mga hanay ay tumatanggap ng isang larawan 3-node DinD cluster na may NFS server plus isang drenahe/reschedule estado-survival na pag-aangkin, `compose` at `host` ang nagpapatakbo ng nag-iisang-node drill. Kailan `whitelist` ay walang laman, ang tuklas na trabaho ay kumukuha ng isa mula sa mga diff v ng sangay `origin/main`; tingnan ang \"Diff-driven app selection\" Pagtuklas [pipeline.md](../../../artefact/git/pipeline.md). Isang hanay na may marka 📖 - ang pinakamaliit na pagkakaiba ng papel, tingnan ang [instructions.md](instructions.md) - Ginampanan muli ang papel na ClaCHME's `### Production` block sa parehong runner minsang napalabas na ito."

