# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Direct-probe deny-checks MUST validate the response body, not only the status code. A `200 OK` is acceptable ONLY when the body contains provider-specific markers proving the response is the genuine provider surface. For prometheus, the markers are `prometheus_build_info` or `<title>Prometheus</title>`. For matomo, the markers are matomo's login-form markers or `piwik` and `matomo` strings in the body. Any 200 with a non-matching body is treated as a misconfigured proxy or a denial-as-200 surface and fails loudly. The deny-checks live in the provider's own spec (`web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` and `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`)."
msgstr "Direct-probe itanggi-checks MUST na nagpapatunay sa tugong katawan, hindi lamang ang status code. A `200 OK` ay tinatanggap ONY kapag ang katawan ay naglalaman ng provider-specific markers na nagpapatunay sa tugon ay ang tunay na provider ibabaw. Para sa prometheus, ang mga palatandaan ay `prometheus_build_info` o `<title>Prometheus</title>`. Para sa matomo, ang mga marker ay login-form marker ng matomo o kaya ay mga matomo `piwik` at `matomo` mga pisi sa katawan. Sinuman 200 na may non-match na katawan ay itinuturing na maling nakaayos na proxy o pagtatatuwa-as-200 sa ibabaw at bumabagsak nang malakas. Ang mga hindi-checks ay nakatira sa sariling spec ng provider (`web-app-prometheus/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js` at `web-app-matomo/files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`)."

