msgid "Documents a `services.matomo.track: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('matomo')` drops it from `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` and the matomo tracker e2e contract. Reserved for static-file (autoindex) and 301-redirect vhosts that carry no user-facing HTML page worth a `_paq` tracker. The marker accompanies the `track:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Mga dokumento ay Isang `services.matomo.track: false` Op-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Ang papel ay nananatili `services.matomo.{enabled,shared}: true` (Kaya't ang kontratang papel-wiring ay nananatiling nasasapatan) ngunit `roles_with_service('matomo')` ay naghulog nito `MATOMO_TARGET_ROLES_JSON` at ang matomo tracker e2e kontrata. Inireserba para sa static-file (autoindex) at 301-redirect vhosts na walang dalang user-facing HTML page na nagkakahalaga ng isang halaga `_paq` tagasubaybay. Ang palatandaan ay kasama ng `track:` flag ng datos ang mga parangal na seeup."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Documents a `services.prometheus.scrape: false` opt-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. The role keeps `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (so the role-wiring contract stays satisfied) but `roles_with_service('prometheus')` drops it from `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Reserved for 301-redirect-only vhosts that never serve a request through lua-resty-prometheus, so they emit no `app=\"<role>\"` label and have no scrape target. The marker accompanies the `scrape:` data flag the lookup honors."
msgstr "Mga dokumento ay Isang `services.prometheus.scrape: false` Op-out in `roles/<role>/meta/services.yml`. Ang papel ay nananatili `services.prometheus.{enabled,shared}: true` (Kaya't ang kontratang papel-wiring ay nananatiling nasasapatan) ngunit `roles_with_service('prometheus')` ay naghulog nito `PROMETHEUS_TARGET_ROLES_JSON`. Ireserba 301-redirect-lamang mga vhost na hindi kailanman nagsisilbi ng kahilingan sa pamamagitan ng lua-resty-prometheus, kaya hindi sila naglalabas ng `app=\"<role>\"` Pabansag at walang gawgaw target. Ang palatandaan ay kasama ng `scrape:` flag ng datos ang mga parangal na seeup."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Documents an `unsafe-*: true` flag in `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. MUST be paired with a `Reason:` on the same line naming what breaks without the relaxation. `unsafe-inline` re-admits the inline execution an XSS needs and `unsafe-eval` re-admits string-to-code, so the flag has to be verified against the running app, not copied from another role."
msgstr "Mga dokumento `unsafe-*: true` watawat sa loob `roles/*/meta/csp.yml`. UST ay itambal sa isang `Reason:` sa parehong linya ng pagbibigay ng pangalan sa kung ano ang pahinga nang walang pagrerelaks. `unsafe-inline` Muling-admit ang inline bitay ng isang XSS na pangangailangan at `unsafe-eval` Re-admits string-to-code, kaya kailangang patunayan ang bandila laban sa tumatakbong app, hindi kinopya mula sa ibang papel."

