# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Drops the per-entity default Docker network when `compose.sh` left it behind with the wrong / empty `com.docker.compose.network` label (typical between matrix-deploy rounds). Skips removal when the network still has active container endpoints, so shared-service networks (svc-db-mariadb, svc-db-postgres, …) stay in place while their provider container is up. The global `docker network prune -f` sweep that catches orphans whose names do NOT match the entity is run once by the orchestrator [apps.sh](../apps.sh) after the entity loop. Idempotent."
msgstr "Bumababa ang per-entity default Docker network kapag `compose.sh` iniwan ito ng mali / walang laman `com.docker.compose.network` Pangalan (karaniwang sa pagitan ng matrix-deploy rounds). Skips pag-alis kapag ang network ay mayroon pa ring mga aktibong container endpoints, kaya ibinahagi-service networks (svc-db-mariadb, svc-db-postgres, ...) Manatili sa lugar habang nakataas ang kanilang lalagyan ng tagapaglaan. Ang pangglobo `docker network prune -f` Timplahan na nanghuhuli ng mga ulila na ang mga pangalan ay hindi katugma ng entity ay minsang pinatatakbo ng orkestra [apps.sh](../apps.sh) matapos ang pagsilo ng entity. Idempotente."

