msgid "Dual clearnet+onion with `Onion-Location` bridge and mirrored SSO realms; per-app dedicated onions / Tor Client Authorization; distributed backups over onion; transparent full-egress torification (only `.onion`-destination mail egress is in phase 2); migration of existing clearnet nodes."
