# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Email integration in v1: **outbound SMTP only**. When `web-app-mailu` is in `group_names`, Frappe's outbound Email Account is auto-configured against the central SMTP endpoint so notification / password-reset emails leave the box. **IMAP inbound (mail-to-Communication) is deferred to a follow-up requirement.** Rationale: the survey found no precedent in this repo for auto-provisioning role-owned mailboxes in Mailu, so the inbound side requires a new generic Mailu mechanism that is out of scope for this PR."
msgstr "Pagsasama ng Email sa v1: **Walang SMTP Lamang**. Kapag `web-app-mailu` nasa `group_names`, Frappe's outbound Email Account ay auto-iayos laban sa central SMTP endpoint kaya ang notification / password-reset emails ay umalis sa kahon. **Napakaraming IMAP (mail-to-Communication) ay iniaantala sa susunod na-up na kahilingan.** Rationale: walang nakitang batayan ang surbey sa repong ito para sa mga auto-provisioning na papel-owed mailbox sa Mailu, kaya ang panloob na bahagi ay nangangailangan ng isang bagong generic Mailu mekanismong hindi saklaw para sa PR na ito."

