# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Every MCP-capable role MUST expose a role-local `mcp` service block in `meta/services.yml`. The block MUST be absent from roles that have no upstream MCP surface at all. A role whose upstream surface exists but cannot be served by this deployment MUST carry a block declaring `blocker` instead of `direction`, so the audit reports the reason rather than an absence."
