msgstr "Ang Pag - aalis ng Halaga `add_header` / `Header set/add` linya para sa `X-Frame-Options` / `X-XSS-Protection` / `X-Download-Options` / `X-Permitted-Cross-Domain-Policies`. Prefer Content-Security-Policy sa pamamagitan ng papel na ginagampanan `meta/server.yml` (`csp.flags` / `csp.whitelist`)."

