msgstr "Mga Ipunto 🔧"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Inside a play the process boundary is the task: Ansible forks a fresh worker per task, so `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` starts empty in every worker. `get_merged_applications` therefore also accepts the play-scoped carrier fact `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (payload plus cache key, parked once by the constructor stage) and serves it when the key matches. See [applications.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/plugins/lookup/applications.md) for the contract."
msgstr "Sa loob ng isang dula ang hangganan ng proseso ay ang gawain: Ang madaling makuhang tinidor ay ginagawang panibago ang bawat gawain, kaya `_MERGED_APPLICATIONS_CACHE` ay nagsisimulang walang laman sa bawat manggagawa. `get_merged_applications` Kaya tanggapin din ang play-scoped carrier fact `_INFINITO_APPLICATIONS_RENDERED` (payload at cache key, na ipinarada minsan sa pamamagitan ng entablado) at isilbi ito kapag ang susing posporo ay magkatambal. Tingnan [applications.md](../../docs/contributing/artefact/files/plugins/lookup/applications.md) para sa kontrata."

