# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Leave `KEEP_NEWEST_PER` and `INCLUDE_PATHS` unset to cancel every matching run, as the lifecycle events do — a closed PR and a deleted branch have no run left that deserves to survive. A fallback also mirrors whatever gates its group: `global-ci-*` cancels on every ref except `main`, so the push job carries the same `github.ref_name != 'main'` guard, while `pr-ci-*` is declared `cancel-in-progress: true` unconditionally, so the pull request job is ungated too."
msgstr "Umalis `KEEP_NEWEST_PER` at `INCLUDE_PATHS` Palibhasa'y hindi handa na kanselahin ang bawat katugmang pagtakbo, gaya ng nangyayari sa buhay — isang saradong PR at isang inalis na sanga ang walang natirang natitira upang mabuhay. Ang pagkabuwal ay sumasalamin din sa anumang pintuang-daan ng grupo nito: `global-ci-*` Pagkansela sa bawat ref maliban sa `main`, kaya gayundin ang tulak na trabaho `github.ref_name != 'main'` maging mapagbantay `pr-ci-*` ay ipinahahayag `cancel-in-progress: true` Walang pasubali, kaya ang kahilingan sa trabaho ay hindi rin nakukuha."

