# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "MDAD is pulled in as a git checkout at deploy time, not vendored. Source: `https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy`. Upstream ships from `master` (no release tags exist), so the pin is the concrete commit SHA `9634cc3f7956e312eaf04647d85cbab46173f2e9` (master HEAD at PR-cut time) stored in `meta/services.yml::matrix.upstream.ref`. Clone destination: `{{ lookup('container', application_id, 'directories.instance') }}mdad/`. Bump path: bump the SHA, redeploy. Operator-confirmed."
msgstr "Ang MDAD ay hinihila bilang isang git checkout sa oras ng paggamit, hindi ipinagbibili. Pinagmulan: `https://github.com/spantaleev/matrix-docker-ansible-deploy`. Paitaas na mga barko mula sa `master` (walang mga release tag), kaya ang pin ay ang kongkretong pag-gawa ng SHA `9634cc3f7956e312eaf04647d85cbab46173f2e9` (master HEAD sa PR-cut time) nakaimbak sa `meta/services.yml::matrix.upstream.ref`. Lugar ng Clone: `{{ lookup('container', application_id, 'directories.instance') }}mdad/`. Hampas: bumangga sa SHA, redeploy. Operator-kumpirma."

