# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "MDAD's `ansible-playbook setup.yml` invocation is encapsulated in a dedicated sub-container (DinD #2 relative to the Infinito deploy container which is DinD #1). The runner image is built locally from `roles/web-app-matrix/files/flavor/ansible/runner/Dockerfile` and pinned via `services.matrix.runner.image`. The runner bind-mounts `/var/run/docker.sock`, `/etc/systemd/system`, `/run/systemd`, `/usr/local/bin`, `/matrix`, and the MDAD checkout so MDAD's writes land in the deploy container's namespace (same Docker daemon and systemd as the rest of the stack)."
msgstr "MDAD's `ansible-playbook setup.yml` incapsulated sa isang dedikadong sub-container (ID #2 kamag - anak ng Infinito na lalagyan ng lalagyan na DinD #1). Ang imahe ng mananakbo ay itinayo sa lugar na iyon mula sa `roles/web-app-matrix/files/flavor/ansible/runner/Dockerfile` at dumaan `services.matrix.runner.image`. Ang mananakbo ay nagbibigkis-bilang `/var/run/docker.sock`, `/etc/systemd/system`, `/run/systemd`, `/usr/local/bin`, `/matrix`, at ang MDAD checkout kaya ang MDAD's ay sumusulat ng lupa sa magagamit na pangalan ng lalagyan (ang mismong Docker daemon at inayos bilang ang natitirang bahagi ng salansan)."

