# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New ERPNext role that ships the upstream Frappe Framework v15 stack as a web-app-erpnext role — backend, frontend, websocket, scheduler and two queue workers — wired into the central Keycloak via a built-in Keycloak Social Login Key and into the central OpenLDAP via the LDAP Settings doctype. The three-variant matrix (SSO plus LDAP, no auth, LDAP only) is exercised end-to-end and a repo-wide lint caps Ansible task names at 120 characters."
msgstr "Bago ERPNext na naglululan ng barkong pasalungat sa Frappe Framework v15 nakasalansan bilang isang web-app-erpnext papel — likuran, harapan, websocket, tagapag - iskedyul at dalawang manggagawa sa queue — ang nakatali sa gitna Keycloak sa pamamagitan ng isang orihinal na-in Keycloak Social Login Key at sa gitna OpenLDAP sa pamamagitan ng LDAP settings doctype. Ang Tatlong-kanlurant na Materriya (SSO AT LDAP, walang auth, LDAP lamang) ay isinasagawang dulo-to-end at isang repo-wide lint caps Ansible na mga pangalan ng gawain sa 120 mga tauhan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New Jitsi Meet role that adds an oauth2-proxy gated meeting surface plus matching LDAP-variant Playwright coverage. The spec layout is reorganised into a shared module and per-scenario test files so future scenarios can be added without touching the monolith."
msgstr "Bago Jitsi Meet papel na nagdaragdag ng oauth2-proxy gated competition pass at magkapares LDAP-variant Playwright coverage. Ang spec structure ay muling nireorganisa sa isang kabahaging module at per-scenario test files upang ang mga senaryo sa hinaharap ay maaaring idagdag nang hindi hinihipo ang monolito."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New OUs SHOULD NOT be invented. Place users under `OU.USERS`, RBAC roles under `OU.ROLES`, and organizational groups under `OU.GROUPS`."
msgstr "Hindi na kailangang maimbento pa ang mga bagong OU. Ilagay sa ilalim ng `OU.USERS`, papel ng RBAC sa ilalim ng `OU.ROLES`, at mga grupong pang - organisasyon sa ilalim ng `OU.GROUPS`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New Penpot role (web-app-penpot, requirement 235) that ships the upstream Penpot design platform comprising frontend, backend, exporter and Redis at image version 2.5.4, wired into the central Keycloak via OIDC and into the central OpenLDAP. Native local-password login is available as a toggle that is disabled automatically under OIDC, with the native-login and registration flags derived from the SSO flag. A custom JVM truststore imports the Infinito self-signed CA so OIDC over TLS succeeds, and the role is exercised end-to-end with Playwright covering OIDC login, logout and project creation. The local subnet was moved to 192.168.105.192/28 to avoid a collision with the ERPNext range."
msgstr "Bago Penpot papel (web-app-penpot, kahilingan 235) na naglalayag sa ilog Penpot plataporma ng disenyo na binubuo ng frontend, backend, tagapagluwas at Redis sa bersyon ng imahen 2.5.4, ikinakabit sa gitna Keycloak via OIDC at patungo sa gitna OpenLDAP. Native local-password login ay makukuha bilang isang tonggle na awtomatikong may kapansanan sa ilalim ng OIDC, na may katutubong-login at mga bandila ng pagpaparehistro na hinango mula sa bandila ng SSO. Isang kaugalian na JVM truststore ang nag-aangkat ng Infinito self-signed CA so OIDC sa mga tagumpay ng TLS, at ang papel ay isinasagawang dulo-to-end na may Playwright sumasaklaw sa OIDC login, logout at project creation. Inilipat ang lokal na subnet 192.168.105.192/28 upang maiwasan ang banggaan ERPNext hanay."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "New Pi-hole role (*web-app-pihole*) that ships the upstream Pi-hole DNS sinkhole and network-wide ad blocker, with its admin web interface gated behind *oauth2-proxy* and Keycloak RBAC and a native admin-password login (the *FTLCONF* web API password) available as a fallback variant. The upstream resolver and timezone are configurable, the role waits on the Pi-hole HTTP endpoint during deploy, and it is exercised end-to-end with Playwright covering the OAuth2, native-login and guest-access scenarios. The role ships at lifecycle beta."
msgstr "Bagong papel na Pi-hole (*web-app-pihole*) na ang mga barko sa ilog ng Pi-hole DNS sinkhole at network-wide ad blocker, na may admin web interface na naka-trade sa likod *Oauth2-proxy* at Keycloak RBAC at isang katutubong admin-password login (ang *FTLCONF* web API password) magagamit bilang isang uri ng pagkahulog. Ang terropainter at timezone ay maaaring baguhin, ang papel ay naghihintay sa Pi-hole HTTP endpoint sa panahon ng pagluklok, at ito ay isinasagawang dulo-to-end na may Playwright na tumatakip sa OAuth2, mga katutubong-login at panauhing-acces na senaryo. Ang papel ng mga barko sa lifecycle beta."

