# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Once all branch-caused failures are addressed, you MUST `git push` the branch on which you iterated to the operator's fork. For any root cause you could not resolve, you MUST file a separate issue per [External Failures](#external-failures) describing what was attempted and why it remains unresolved."
msgstr "Kapag natugunan na ang lahat ng sangay-sanhi na kabiguan, ikaw MUST `git push` ang sanga kung saan kayo nag-eeksperimento sa tinidor ng operator. Para sa anumang ugat na hindi mo malutas, ikaw MUST ay naglabas ng isang hiwalay na isyu sa bawat isa [Mga Kabiguan](#external-failures) Inilalarawan kung ano ang tinangka at kung bakit ito nananatiling hindi nalulutas."

