# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operating-system package managers such as [apt](https://wiki.debian.org/Apt), [pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman) and [dnf](https://dnf.readthedocs.io/) keep installed software in sync with their upstream distribution repositories. Each one ships with a different command surface but they all serve the same goal: refresh the index and upgrade every installed package on the host."
msgstr "Operating-system pakete managers tulad ng [Malamang](https://wiki.debian.org/Apt), [Pacman](https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman) at [dnf](https://dnf.readthedocs.io/) ilagay ang naka-install na software kasabay ng kanilang mga repositoryo sa itaas ng ilog. Bawat isa sa mga barkong may iba't ibang utos subalit ang mga ito ay pawang nagsisilbi sa iisang tunguhin: paginhawahin ang indise at i-upgrade ang bawat naka-install na pakete sa host."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Operating-system package managers such as `apt <https://wiki.debian.org/Apt>`__, `pacman <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman>`__ and `dnf <https://dnf.readthedocs.io/>`__ keep installed software in sync with their upstream distribution repositories. Each one ships with a different command surface but they all serve the same goal: refresh the index and upgrade every installed package on the host."
msgstr "Operating-system pakete managers tulad ng `apt <https://wiki.debian.org/Apt>`__, `pacman <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/pacman>`__ at `dnf <https://dnf.readthedocs.io/>`__ ilagay ang naka-install na software kasabay ng kanilang mga repositoryo sa itaas ng ilog. Bawat isa sa mga barkong may iba't ibang utos subalit ang mga ito ay pawang nagsisilbi sa iisang tunguhin: paginhawahin ang indise at i-upgrade ang bawat naka-install na pakete sa host."

