msgstr "Mga May - ari `_USERS_DEFAULTS_CACHE` at `_MERGED_USERS_CACHE`. API: `get_user_defaults`, `get_merged_users`. The Ansible-facing `users` Nakakaubos ng plagin `get_merged_users` mula mismo sa module na ito (`from utils.cache.users import get_merged_users`)."

