# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Per-consumer provisioning (``tasks/01_init.yml``) runs with ``application_id=svc-db-rabbitmq`` and ``database_consumer_id=<consumer>``; it resolves the consumer’s vhost name, username and password via ``lookup('engine', 'rabbitmq', <consumer>, ...)`` and reconciles an idempotent vhost, user and ``set_permissions`` grant scoped to that vhost. Existing vhosts and users are skipped, and the consumer password is realigned with the inventory on every deploy."
msgstr "Per-consumer na paglalaan (``tasks/01_init.yml``) kaakibat ng ``application_id=svc-db-rabbitmq`` at ``database_consumer_id=<consumer>``; tinitiyak nito ang vhost na pangalan ng mamimili, username at password sa pamamagitan ng ``lookup('engine', 'rabbitmq', <consumer>, ...)`` at pinagtutugma ang isang idempotenteng vhost, user at ``set_permissions`` Ipagkaloob ang saklaw nito. Ang umiiral na mga vhost at mga gumagamit nito ay hindi na ginagamit, at ang kontrasenyas ng mamimili ay pinatutunayan ng imbentaryo sa lahat ng gamit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Per-consumer provisioning (``tasks/01_init.yml``) runs with ``application_id=svc-db-redis`` and ``database_consumer_id=<consumer>``; it resolves the consumer’s username, password and key-prefix via ``lookup('engine', 'redis', <consumer>, ...)`` and reconciles an idempotent ``ACL SETUSER`` restricted to ``~{entity}:*``. The ACL users are recreated by the consumer’s ``01_init`` on every deploy, so a container restart that drops the in-memory ACL set is healed on the next run."
msgstr "Per-consumer na paglalaan (``tasks/01_init.yml``) kaakibat ng ``application_id=svc-db-redis`` at ``database_consumer_id=<consumer>``; nilulutas nito ang username, password at key-prefix sa pamamagitan ng ``lookup('engine', 'redis', <consumer>, ...)`` at pinagtutugma ang isang idempotente ``ACL SETUSER`` limitado ``~{entity}:*``. Ang mga gumagamit ng ACL ay muling binuo ng mga tagakonsumo ``01_init`` sa bawat pag-play, kaya ang isang container restart na naghulog ng in-memory ACL set ay napagaling sa susunod na pagtakbo."

