# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Pure function — reads role metadata via cached YAML helpers and emits ``PlanEntry`` tuples; no filesystem side effects. The include set per round is resolved by the ``CombinedResolver`` (see ``.legacy_resolver``): each role contributes its own pulled-in providers and the include is the union. A service-key is therefore pulled in as soon as ANY role in the round-aware closure says it should be (literal ``True`` OR the ``\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`` Jinja form, both accepted by ``utils.roles.applications.services.registry.is_explicit_truth``); if EVERY role marks it ``False`` it stays out of the include."
msgstr "Dalisay na gawain — basahin ang papel na metadata sa pamamagitan ng mga katulong na YAML at mga inilabas ``PlanEntry`` Tuples; walang filesystem side effects. Ang kasama rito na nakatakda sa bawat round ay pinagpapasiyahan ng ``CombinedResolver`` (tingnan ``.legacy_resolver``): Ang bawat papel ay nakakatulong sa sarili nitong draft-in providers at ang kabilang dito ay ang unyon. Ang isang service-key kung gayon ay hinihila sa sandaling ang anumang papel sa round-acear closet ay nagsasabi na dapat ito (literal ``True`` O ang ``\"{{ '<role>' in group_names }}\"`` Jinja form, parehong tinanggap ng ``utils.roles.applications.services.registry.is_explicit_truth``); kung ang bawat papel ay palatandaan nito ``False`` Nananatili itong hindi kasama."

