# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Return the per-service mount block (``volumes:`` + ``configs:`` + ``secrets:``) as a YAML string starting at column 0."
msgstr "Ibalik ang per-service mount block (``volumes:`` + ``configs:`` + ``secrets:``) bilang isang taling YAML na nagsisimula sa hanay 0."

