# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Roles that are not green for the given scope: ``total`` (a mode that ran is not green), ``swarm``, or ``docker`` (compose). A role with no job in the requested mode is skipped, not failed: a host driver that never deploys in swarm is not a swarm failure, only roles whose swarm job ran and did not pass are."
msgstr "Mga papel na hindi luntian para sa ibinigay na saklaw: ``total`` (hindi berde ang paraan ng pagtakbo), ``swarm``, o ``docker`` (Kumakatha). Ang isang papel na walang trabaho sa hiniling na mode ay hindi matagumpay, hindi bigo: ang isang tsuper na hindi kailanman naglalagay ng kuyog ay hindi bigo sa dami ng tao, mga papel lamang na ang trabaho ng kuyog ay tumatakbo at hindi lumilipas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Roles that call `lookup('email', ...)` are treated as dependents of Mailu. The integration check [test_mailu_dependency.py](../../../../../tests/integration/infrastructure/services/test_mailu_dependency.py) scans every role for the `lookup('email'` pattern and fails if such a role does not declare `services.email` with `enabled: true` and `shared: true` at the file root of its `meta/services.yml`. A new email consumer MUST declare that service block in its role's `meta/services.yml`."
msgstr "Mga papel na tumatawag `lookup('email', ...)` ay itinuturing na mga dependensiya Mailu. Ang integration check [test_mailu_dependency.py](../../../../../tests/integration/infrastructure/services/test_mailu_dependency.py) Sinusuri ang bawat papel para sa `lookup('email'` parisan at kabiguan kung ang gayong papel ay hindi nagpapahayag ng `services.email` kasama `enabled: true` at `shared: true` sa dulo ng talaksan `meta/services.yml`. Ipinahayag ng isang bagong mamimili sa email na ang service block sa papel nito `meta/services.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Roles that have no auth surface at all (federation-only services with no local accounts, e.g. `web-app-bridgy-fed`) MAY collapse the three persona scenarios into one baseline reachability scenario. The README MUST document the missing auth tier and the omission MUST be visible from the role's `lifecycle` and `services.yml` exceptions."
msgstr "Mga papel na walang pang - ibabaw na bahagi (pederasyon-lamang serbisyo na walang mga lokal na account, e.g. `web-app-bridgy-fed`) Maaaring mauwi ang tatlong eksenang ito sa iisang eksena. Ang dokumento ng CASME MUST na nawawalang auth at ang hindi pag - inom ng MUST ay makikita sa papel na ginagampanan nito `lifecycle` at `services.yml` Maliban."

