# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role's deployed backup unit (a fresh differential `backup-nfs-to-local` generation of the live export), then mirrors the snapshot into the target (`rsync -a --delete`, with the shared `<state>/backup` root protected from deletion and never copied in). `--no-safety-backup` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang iskrip; sinisimulan muna nito ang naka - backup na yunit ng papel (isang bagong pagkakaiba `backup-nfs-to-local` salinlahi ng buháy na iniluluwas), pagkatapos ay isalamin ang litrato sa target (`rsync -a --delete`, sa mga nakibahagi `<state>/backup` ugat na protektado mula sa deleksiyon at hindi kailanman kinopya). `--no-safety-backup` Tumatakbo ang yunit kapag ang target ay hindi nakatitipid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role's deployed backup unit (a fresh differential baudolo generation of every volume and database), resolves the volume's mountpoint and mirrors the snapshot into it (`rsync -a --delete`). `--no-safety-backup` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Patakbuhin ang iskrip; sinisimulan muna nito ang naka - backup na yunit ng papel (isang bagong naiibang salinlahi ng baudolo ng bawat tomo at database), lutasin ang estasyon ng volume at isalamin ang litrato rito (`rsync -a --delete`). `--no-safety-backup` Tumatakbo ang yunit kapag ang target ay hindi nakatitipid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role’s deployed backup unit (a fresh differential ``backup-nfs-to-local`` generation of the live export), then mirrors the snapshot into the target (``rsync -a --delete``, with the shared ``<state>/backup`` root protected from deletion and never copied in). ``--no-safety-backup`` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Patakbohin ang iskrip; sinisimulan muna nito ang papel na ginagamit na backup unit (isang bagong pagkakaiba ``backup-nfs-to-local`` salinlahi ng buháy na iniluluwas), pagkatapos ay isalamin ang litrato sa target (``rsync -a --delete``, sa mga nakibahagi ``<state>/backup`` ugat na protektado mula sa deleksiyon at hindi kailanman kinopya). ``--no-safety-backup`` Tumatakbo ang yunit kapag ang target ay hindi nakatitipid."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Run the script; it first starts the role’s deployed backup unit (a fresh differential baudolo generation of every volume and database), resolves the volume’s mountpoint and mirrors the snapshot into it (``rsync -a --delete``). ``--no-safety-backup`` skips the unit run when the target holds nothing worth saving."
msgstr "Patakbohin ang iskrip; sinisimulan muna nito ang papel na ginagamit na backup unit (isang bagong naiibang salinlahi ng baudolo ng bawat tomo at database), lutasin ang volumeisons inakyat at ipinababanaag ang larawan dito (``rsync -a --delete``). ``--no-safety-backup`` Tumatakbo ang yunit kapag ang target ay hindi nakatitipid."

