# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - `<stack>_<service_key>`, matching how Docker Swarm names every service and how `container service ps` accepts them. The stack name is derived from ``application_id`` via the ``get_entity_name`` filter, mirroring how ``docker stack deploy`` composes the stack name in ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``."
msgstr "Sowarm mode - `<stack>_<service_key>`, Magtugma kung paano Docker Swarm Sabihin ang bawat paglilingkod at kung paano `container service ps` Tanggapin ang mga ito. Ang pangalan ng talaksan ay kinuha sa ``application_id`` sa pamamagitan ng ``get_entity_name`` pansala, pagsalamin kung paano ``docker stack deploy`` Binubuo ang pangalan ng talaksan sa ``sys-svc-compose/handlers/main.yml``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - a shell subshell that resolves the running task's container ID at exec time, e.g. `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Swarm names every service ``<stack>_<key>`` and accepts no prefix matching; the helper composes that name from STACK and SERVICE_KEY args. The subshell defers resolution to the moment of exec, avoiding the stale ID and parse-time-failure pitfalls of returning a resolved value at vars-resolution time."
msgstr "Swarm mode - isang shell subshell na siyang nagreresulta sa tumatakbong lalagyan ng ID sa oras ng e.g. `\"$(/usr/bin/resolve-container-id mattermost mattermost)\"`. Swarm ang pangalan ng bawat serbisyo ``<stack>_<key>`` at hindi tumatanggap ng unlapi na katumbas; ang katulong ay bumubuo ng pangalang iyan mula sa STACK at SERVICE_KEY mga arg. Ang subshell ay nagreresulta sa resolusyon sa sandali ng produksyon, na iniiwasan ang lumang ID at parse-time-failure na mga patibong ng pagbabalik ng isang nalutas na halaga sa vars-resolution time."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Swarm mode    - the same reference, prefixed with the in-cluster registry host:port (e.g. ``manager.example.com:5000/mattermost/mattermost-team-edition:11.8.0``) when ``swarm.registry.host`` and ``swarm.registry.port`` are set. With no registry configured, swarm falls back to the un-prefixed form."
msgstr "Swarm mode - ang parehong reperensiya, unlaping may in-cluster register host:port (e.g. ``manager.example.com:5000/mattermost/mattermost-team-edition:11.8.0``) kapag ``swarm.registry.host`` at ``swarm.registry.port`` ang nakatakda. Dahil sa walang rerehistrong nakaayos, ang kuyog ay bumabalik sa anyong hindi pa nai-prefix."

