# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Docker MariaDB Role offers an easy and efficient way to deploy a MariaDB server inside a Docker container. Manage your data securely and effectively, making it ideal for production or local development."
msgstr "Ang Docker MariaDB Ang papel ay nagbibigay ng madali at mahusay na paraan ng paggamit MariaDB server sa loob ng isang Docker container. Maingat at mabisang pangasiwaan ang iyong impormasyon, ginagawa itong angkop para sa produksiyon o sa lokal na pag - unlad."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Docker updater watches ``image`` plus ``version``, the repository updater ``repository`` plus ``ref``. A pin outside both - an ``app_version``, a ``release``, a tag in a registry neither updater speaks - declares where its upstream lives::"
msgstr "Ang mga relong Docker updater ``image`` plus ``version``, ang pansamantalang updater ``repository`` plus ``ref``. Isang pin sa labas ng dalawang ito ``app_version``, a ``release``, isang tag sa isang rehistro ni ang updater ay nagpapahayag kung saan nakatira ang ilog nito:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Docker-SimpleIcons role streamlines the deployment and management of a simple, efficient icon server. It helps you:"
msgstr "Ang Docker-SimpleIcons papel ay nagreresulta sa paglalagay at pangangasiwa ng isang simple at mahusay na icon server. Nakatutulong ito sa iyo:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Docker/OCI hostname for an application's container: ``bounded_name`` at the 63-byte limit sethostname(2) enforces."
msgstr "Ang Docker/OCI hostname para sa isang application's container: ``bounded_name`` sa 63-byte ang limitasyon ng sethostname(2) ay nagpapatupad."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Flowise supervisor criteria are Phase 2, and reading both upstreams turned \"not built yet\" into a concrete blocker: `stdio_only`, the same reason `web-app-discourse` carries in [ADR 0003](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md). Neither agent's server mode speaks a transport a second container can reach."
msgstr "Ang Flowise Ang mga pamantayan ng superbisor ay Phase 2, at ang pagbabasa sa dalawang ilog ay bumaling \"hindi pa natatayo\" sa isang tagaharang ng kongkreto: `stdio_only`, parehong dahilan `web-app-discourse` ipinasok [ADR 0003](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md). Alinman sa mga server mode ng agent ay hindi nakapagsasalita ng isang transport isang pangalawang container na maaaring maabot."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Frappe MCP component is experimental and unverified against the pinned Frappe v16."
msgstr "Ang bahaging Frappe MCP ay eksperimental at walang bisa laban sa pindutan na Frappe v16."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The Frappe site-setup wizard is **bypassed** on first deploy via auto-bootstrap: `bench new-site` with `--admin-password`, `--db-name`, `--mariadb-user-host-login-scope=%` arguments, plus `bench install-app erpnext`, plus a post-start API call from the role's `tasks/` to mark the wizard as completed (`frappe.db.set_default('setup_complete', '1')`). A fresh deploy lands directly on the ERPNext desk."
msgstr "Ang Frappe site-setup na salamangkero ay **Nalampasan** sa unang gamit sa pamamagitan ng auto-bootstrap: `bench new-site` kasama `--admin-password`, `--db-name`, `--mariadb-user-host-login-scope=%` mga argumento, bukod pa `bench install-app erpnext`, at isang post-start API ng papel `tasks/` upang markahan ang manghuhula na tapos na (`frappe.db.set_default('setup_complete', '1')`). Bagong - gamit na mga lupain na tuwirang nasa ERPNext desk."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The GFS / global-server side of upstream (`Dockerfile.gfs`) is not deployed. Only the household instance (`Dockerfile.sh`) is."
msgstr "Ang GFS / global-server na panig ng itaas ng ilog (`Dockerfile.gfs`) ay hindi ginagamit. Tanging ang sambahayan lamang (`Dockerfile.sh`) ay maaari."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The H1 emoji MUST come after the title text, not before it."
msgstr "Ang H1 Ang emoji MUST ay darating pagkatapos ng titulong teksto, hindi bago nito."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The H1 heading MUST be the human-readable name of the application or service, not the role ID."
