# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "The cluster consists of privileged systemd containers on a dedicated lab bridge (`192.168.244.0/24`, MTU 1400): three swarm nodes (1 manager + 2 workers), a non-swarm NFSv4 server serving the shared volume storage, and a non-swarm backup host for the DR drill. The node image ([`compose/swarm/Dockerfile`](../../../../compose/swarm/Dockerfile)) bakes python3 + dnsmasq and masks the zfs boot units the parent image's userland enables; the containers and the lab network are declared in [`compose/swarm/compose.yml`](../../../../compose/swarm/compose.yml) (project `${SWARM_NAME}`, backup host behind the `drill` profile) and started by one `docker compose up` in `routine/01_bootstrap.sh`. Lab DNS is provisioned by `compose/swarm/playbook.yml` over `ansible_connection: docker` (Ansible never uses ssh here); swarm init/join itself happens inside the deploy via the `svc-swarm-node` role, not in any bring-up script."
msgstr "Ang kumpol ay binubuo ng pantanging mga lalagyan sa isang dedikadong tulay sa laboratoryo (`192.168.244.0/24`, MTU 1400): tatlong kuyog ng mga node (1 manager + 2 mga manggagawa), isang non-swarm NFSv4 server na nagsisilbi sa partite volume storage, at isang non-swarm backup host para sa DR drill. Ang larawan ng node ([`compose/swarm/Dockerfile`](../../../../compose/swarm/Dockerfile)) nilulutong python3 + dnsmasq at maskarahan ang zfs boot units na nagagawa ng userland ng magulang na imahen; ang mga sisidlan at ang network ng laboratoryo ay ipinahahayag [`compose/swarm/compose.yml`](../../../../compose/swarm/compose.yml) (proyekto `${SWARM_NAME}`, backup host sa likod ng `drill` Larawan) at sinimulan ng isa `docker compose up` sa loob `routine/01_bootstrap.sh`. Ang Lab DNS ay inilalaan ng `compose/swarm/playbook.yml` over `ansible_connection: docker` (Hindi kailanman gumagamit dito ng ssh ang asible); kuyog init/join mismo ang nangyayari sa loob ng stapping sa pamamagitan ng `svc-swarm-node` papel, hindi sa anumang ad-up script."

