# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys a central recursive/forwarding DNSSEC resolver (Unbound) in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It runs as a trivial single-service stack with a static IP on its own network, so consumer stacks can point their ``dns:`` at it instead of embedding their own resolver."
msgstr "Ang kumplikadong papel na ito ay naglalagay ng isang sentral na regressive/forwarding DNSEC finalder (Unbound) sa isang Docker container na ginagamit Docker Compose. Ito ay tumatakbo bilang isang maliit na isahang-service na salansan na may static IP sa sarili nitong network, kaya ang mga salansan ng mamimili ay maaaring magtutok ng kanilang mga ``dns:`` sa halip na alisin ang kanilang sariling pasiya."

# translated-by: libretranslate
