# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a PostgreSQL database in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It is designed to simplify database administration by automating the creation of networks, containers, and essential database tasks (such as database and user creation) for a secure and high-performance environment."
msgstr "Ito'y isang imposibleng papel na ginagamit at isinasaayos ang isang PostgreSQL database sa isang Docker container gamit ang Docker Compose. Ito ay dinisenyo upang gawing simple ang pamamahala ng database sa pamamagitan ng pagkokoma sa paglikha ng mga network, container, at mahahalagang gawain ng database (tulad ng database at user creation) para sa isang tiwasay at mataas na kapaligiran."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a Qdrant vector database in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It runs Qdrant as a central, pinned engine that many application roles share over the cross-stack network, keeping the consumer roles stateless and NFS-shareable in swarm."
msgstr "Ito'y isang imposibleng papel na ginagamit at isinasaayos ang isang Qdrant Ang vector database sa isang Docker container na ginagamit Docker Compose. Tumatakbo ito Qdrant bilang isang sentral, pindradong makina na maraming mga papel na application ay nakikibahagi sa cross-stack network, pinananatili ang mga papel ng mamimili na walang estado at NFS-priable sa kuyog."

