msgid "This Ansible role deploys and configures a central Typesense search engine in a Docker container using Docker Compose. It is designed as a central engine: many application roles share one pinned Typesense stack instead of each embedding its own sidecar, keeping the application roles stateless, unpinned and NFS-shareable in swarm."
msgstr ""

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and manages a containerized [Simple Icons](https://simpleicons.org/) server, providing easy access to over 2,000 SVG and PNG icons for use in web projects, documentation, and branding."
msgstr "Ito'y maaaring gamitin at pangasiwaan ang isang containerized [Simple Icons](https://simpleicons.org/) server, madaling makuha 2,000 SVG at PNG icons para gamitin sa mga proyektong web, dokumentasyon, at pag-ehero."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys and manages a containerized `Simple Icons <https://simpleicons.org/>`__ server, providing easy access to over 2,000 SVG and PNG icons for use in web projects, documentation, and branding."
msgstr "Ito'y maaaring gamitin at pangasiwaan ang isang containerized `Simple Icons <https://simpleicons.org/>`__ server, madaling makuha 2,000 SVG at PNG icons para gamitin sa mga proyektong web, dokumentasyon, at pag-ehero."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role deploys the ONLYOFFICE Document Server in Docker to provide real-time, in-browser editing for documents, spreadsheets, and presentations. It automates the setup of the Document Server container, NGINX reverse proxy configuration, network isolation via Docker networks, and environment variable management for secure integration with Nextcloud or other WOPI-compatible platforms."
msgstr "Ang Ansible papel na ito ay naglalagay ng ONLYOFICE Document Server sa Docker upang magbigay ng real-time, in-browser editing para sa mga dokumento, disheets, at mga representasyon. Ito ay nagkokodigo ng setyup ng Document Server container, NGINX reverse proxy configuration, network separation sa pamamagitan ng Docker networks, at environment variable management para sa secured integration kasama ang Nextcloud o iba pang mga platapormang WOPI-compatible."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures **consistent global theming** across all NGINX-served applications by injecting CSS files."
msgstr "Tinitiyak nito ang kaniyang papel **walang pagbabagong pangglobong pagtitipon** Sa kabila ng lahat ng mga aplikasyong NGINX-served sa pamamagitan ng pagtuturok ng mga file ng CSS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures **consistent global theming** across all NGINX-served applications by injecting CSS files.   The role leverages [`colorscheme-generator`](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/colorscheme-generator/) to generate a dynamic, customizable color palette for light and dark mode, compatible with popular web tools like **Bootstrap**, **Keycloak**, **Nextcloud**, **Taiga**, **Mastodon**, and many more."
msgstr "Tinitiyak nito ang kaniyang papel **walang pagbabagong pangglobong pagtitipon** Sa kabila ng lahat ng mga aplikasyong NGINX-served sa pamamagitan ng pagtuturok ng mga file ng CSS. Ang papel na ginagampanan [`colorscheme-generator`](https://github.com/kevinveenbirkenbach/colorscheme-generator/) upang lumikha ng isang dinamiko, maayos ang kulay na paleta para sa liwanag at madilim na mode, kasuwato ng popular na mga kasangkapang web gaya ng **Bootstrap**, **Keycloak**, **Nextcloud**, **Taiga**, **Mastodon**, at marami pang iba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures that [.profile](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts) is sourced in both [Bash](https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/) and [Zsh](https://www.zsh.org/) environments. It enables consistent environment variable loading across different login shells by linking shell-specific profile files (`.bash_profile`, `.zprofile`) to a centralized `.profile`."
msgstr "Tinitiyak iyan ng kahanga - hangang papel na ito [. profile](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts) ay inilalathala sa dalawang ito [Labag](https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/) at [Zsh](https://www.zsh.org/) kapaligiran. Pinangyayari nito ang hindi nagbabagong kapaligiran na magkarga sa iba't ibang login shell sa pamamagitan ng pag-uugnay ng shell-specific profile files (`.bash_profile`, `.zprofile`) sa isang sentralisado `.profile`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures that `.profile <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts>`__ is sourced in both `Bash <https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/>`__ and `Zsh <https://www.zsh.org/>`__ environments. It enables consistent environment variable loading across different login shells by linking shell-specific profile files (``.bash_profile``, ``.zprofile``) to a centralized ``.profile``."
msgstr "Tinitiyak iyan ng kahanga - hangang papel na ito `.profile <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bourne_shell#Startup_scripts>`__ ay inilalathala sa dalawang ito `Bash <https://www.gnu.org/software/bash/>`__ at `Zsh <https://www.zsh.org/>`__ kapaligiran. Pinangyayari nito ang hindi nagbabagong kapaligiran na magkarga sa iba't ibang login shell sa pamamagitan ng pag-uugnay ng shell-specific profile files (``.bash_profile``, ``.zprofile``) sa isang sentralisado ``.profile``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role ensures that the target host’s system hostname is set to the inventory hostname."
msgstr "Tinitiyak ng kapansin - pansing papel na ito na ang target na hostites system hostname ay nakatakda sa imbentaryong hostname."

