# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This Ansible role extracts the project version from the local ``pyproject.toml`` (using ``playbook_dir``) and writes it as a system-wide environment variable into ``/etc/environment`` on the managed host."
msgstr "Itong kapansin - pansing papel ay kumukuha sa bersiyon ng proyekto mula sa lokal ``pyproject.toml`` (paggamit ``playbook_dir``) at isinusulat ito bilang isang system-wide na kapaligiran na iba-iba sa ``/etc/environment`` sa nangangasiwang punong - abala."

