# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page covers the repository rules that govern GitHub Actions workflow files under `.github/workflows/`. For the catalog of every workflow (description, triggers, inputs) see [workflows.md](../../../tools/github/actions/workflows.md). For the script placement rule that applies to extracted shell helpers, see [scripst.md](../../scripst.md)."
