# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page is the administration SPOT for granting and revoking application role memberships via Keycloak. It covers the **how**; for the **why** (design, schema, LDAP layout, client-scope contract) see [RBAC design](../../contributing/design/iam/rbac.md)."
msgstr "Ang pahinang ito ay ang administration SPOT dahil sa pagkakaloob at muling paghiling ng mga bahaging ginagampanan sa pamamagitan ng pag - iingat Keycloak. Sinasaklaw nito ang **kung paano**; para sa **kung bakit** (Disenyo, schema, plano ng LDAP, kontrata ng kliyente-scope) tingnan [Disenyo ng RBAC](../../contributing/design/iam/rbac.md)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This page lists every repository secret that GitHub Actions workflows in this repository consume, and documents the failure mode when a secret is missing. For repository **variables** see [configuration.md](configuration.md). For the workflow catalog see [workflows.md](workflows.md)."
