# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploy Decidim, an open-source participatory democracy platform for public consultations, civic processes, community voting, and collaborative policy creation."
msgstr "Ang bahaging ito ay ginagamit Decidim, isang open-source participatory demokrasya platform para sa mga pampublikong konsultasyon, mga prosesong sibiko, pagboto ng komunidad, at kooperatibong patakaran na paglikha."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **LibreTranslate** as a containerized web service using Docker Compose. It is designed to integrate seamlessly into the Infinito.Nexus stack, including optional Redis and database backends, CSP handling, and analytics integration."
msgstr "May ganitong papel **LibreTranslate** bilang isang containerized web service na ginagamit ang Docker Compose. Ito ay dinisenyo upang walang - tigil na makibagay sa Infinito.Nexus nakasalansan, kasama ang opsyonal Redis at ang database backends, CSP handling, at analytics integrated."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Magento 2** via Docker Compose. It is aligned with the Infinito.Nexus stack patterns:"
msgstr "May ganitong papel **Magento 2** gagamitin Docker Compose. Kahanay ito ng Infinito.Nexus Mga parisan ng talaksan:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Shopware 6** using **Docker**. It automates installation, migration, and configuration of your storefront, integrating with a central **MariaDB** database. Optional components like **Redis** and **OpenSearch** enhance performance and search capabilities, while **OIDC** integrates the administration backend with **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign in the same way: Shopware has no admin-LDAP extension this role can install, so LDAP identities arrive through Keycloak's user federation rather than through a plugin of their own."
msgstr "May ganitong papel **Shopware 6** paggamit **Docker**. Itong mga kasama sa kotse ay nag - iinstala, nandarayuhan, at nagsasaayos ng iyong harapan, pati na ang gitnang bahagi **MariaDB** database. Mga bahaging opsyonal na gaya ng **Redis** at **Bukás na Paghahanap** ay nagpapasulong sa kakayahan sa pagsasagawa at paghahanap, samantalang **OIDC** Ang administrasyon ay sumasang - ayon dito **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign sa parehong paraan: Shopware Walang admin-LDAP extension ang papel na ito ay maaaring mag-install, kaya LDAP configence ay dumating Keycloak'Ang gumagamit ng pederasyon sa halip na sa pamamagitan ng kanilang sariling plagin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys **Shopware 6** using **Docker**. It automates installation, migration, and configuration of your storefront, integrating with a central **MariaDB** database. Optional components like **Redis** and **OpenSearch** enhance performance and search capabilities, while **OIDC** integrates the administration backend with **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign in the same way: Shopware has no admin-LDAP extension this role can install, so LDAP identities arrive through Keycloak’s user federation rather than through a plugin of their own."
msgstr "May ganitong papel **Shopware 6** paggamit **Docker**. Itong mga kasama sa kotse ay nag - iinstala, nandarayuhan, at nagsasaayos ng iyong harapan, pati na ang gitnang bahagi **MariaDB** database. Mga bahaging opsyonal na gaya ng **Redis** at **Bukás na Paghahanap** ay nagpapasulong sa kakayahan sa pagsasagawa at paghahanap, samantalang **OIDC** Ang administrasyon ay sumasang - ayon dito **Keycloak**. Directory accounts sign sa parehong paraan: Shopware Walang admin-LDAP extension ang papel na ito ay maaaring mag-install, kaya LDAP configence ay dumating KeycloakAng mga gumagamit ng pederasyon sa halip na sa pamamagitan ng kanilang sariling plagin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Baserow using Docker Compose, integrating key components such as PostgreSQL for the database, Redis for caching, and NGINX for secure domain management and certificate handling. It is designed to offer a robust, scalable solution for running your own Baserow instance in a containerized environment."
msgstr "May ganitong papel Baserow paggamit Docker Compose, pagsamahin ang mga pangunahing sangkap gaya ng PostgreSQL para sa database, Redis para sa caching, at NGINX para sa matatag na pangangasiwa sa domain at sertipikong pangangasiwa. Dinisenyo ito upang mag - alok ng isang matibay, madaling makuhang solusyon para sa pagpapatakbo ng iyong sariling bahay Baserow halimbawa sa isang kapaligirang may lalagyan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Coturn via Docker Compose using the ``sys-stk-semi-stateless`` stack."
msgstr "May ganitong papel Coturn gagamitin Docker Compose paggamit ng ``sys-stk-semi-stateless`` magsalansan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Coturn via Docker Compose using the `sys-stk-semi-stateless` stack.   It automatically configures:"
msgstr "May ganitong papel Coturn gagamitin Docker Compose paggamit ng `sys-stk-semi-stateless` magsalansan. Awtomatikong nakaayos nito:"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Discourse using Docker, automating tasks such as container orchestration, service configuration, and routine administrative operations. It integrates key components like Redis and PostgreSQL, sets up domain routing with NGINX, and ensures streamlined updates for a reliable forum experience."
msgstr "May ganitong papel Discourse Ginagamit ang Docker, mga gawaing automating tulad ng orkestrasyon ng lalagyan, pagsasaayos ng serbisyo, at rutinang mga operasyong pampangasiwaan. Pinagsasama nito ang mahahalagang bahagi na gaya ng Redis at PostgreSQL, magtakda ng domain na sumasakop sa pamamagitan ng NGINX, at tiyakin ang mga streamlined update para sa isang maaasahang karanasan sa forum."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys ERPNext as an Infinito.Nexus web app using the upstream ``frappe/erpnext`` single-image multi-role pattern from `frappe_docker <https://github.com/frappe/frappe_docker>`__: one Docker image, different commands per container (backend gunicorn, frontend nginx, websocket socketio, scheduler, two queue workers, plus a one-shot configurator). MariaDB and Redis come from the central ``svc-db-mariadb`` and ``svc-db-redis`` providers — the three Frappe Redis logical roles (``cache``, ``queue``, ``socketio``) share one central Redis instance via DB-number split (0 / 1 / 2). Authentication uses Frappe’s built-in Social Login Key against the shared Keycloak OIDC client without an oauth2-proxy sidecar; LDAP federation and outbound SMTP via Mailu are wired when their providers are present."
msgstr "May ganitong papel ERPNext bilang isang Infinito.Nexus web app gamit ang pasalungat sa agos ``frappe/erpnext`` Single-image multi-role pattern mula sa `frappe_docker <https://github.com/frappe/frappe_docker>`__: isang larawan ng Docker, iba't ibang utos sa bawat container (Backend gunicorn, frontend nginx, websocket socket sapio, iskedyulr, dalawang queue worker, at isang-shot recogulator). MariaDB at Redis mula sa gitna ``svc-db-mariadb`` at ``svc-db-redis`` Mga tagapaglaan — ang tatlong Frappe Redis Makatuwirang mga papel (``cache``, ``queue``, ``socketio``) sa isang gitna Redis Halimbawa sa pamamagitan ng DB-number split (0 / 1 / 2). Realation ay gumagamit ng Frappeisons na ginawa-in Social Login Key laban sa kabahaging-bahagi Keycloak OIDC client na walang oauth2-proxy sidecar; LDAP pederation at outbound SMTP via Mailu ay naka - wire kapag naroroon ang kanilang mga tagapaglaan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys ERPNext as an Infinito.Nexus web app using the upstream `frappe/erpnext` single-image multi-role pattern from [frappe_docker](https://github.com/frappe/frappe_docker): one Docker image, different commands per container (backend gunicorn, frontend nginx, websocket socketio, scheduler, two queue workers, plus a one-shot configurator). MariaDB and Redis come from the central `svc-db-mariadb` and `svc-db-redis` providers — the three Frappe Redis logical roles (`cache`, `queue`, `socketio`) share one central Redis instance via DB-number split (0 / 1 / 2). Authentication uses Frappe's built-in Social Login Key against the shared Keycloak OIDC client without an oauth2-proxy sidecar; LDAP federation and outbound SMTP via Mailu are wired when their providers are present."
msgstr "May ganitong papel ERPNext bilang isang Infinito.Nexus web app gamit ang pasalungat sa agos `frappe/erpnext` Single-image multi-role pattern mula sa [frappe_docker](https://github.com/frappe/frappe_docker): isang larawan ng Docker, iba't ibang utos sa bawat container (Backend gunicorn, frontend nginx, websocket socket sapio, iskedyulr, dalawang queue worker, at isang-shot recogulator). MariaDB at Redis mula sa gitna `svc-db-mariadb` at `svc-db-redis` Mga tagapaglaan — ang tatlong Frappe Redis Makatuwirang mga papel (`cache`, `queue`, `socketio`) sa isang gitna Redis Halimbawa sa pamamagitan ng DB-number split (0 / 1 / 2). Resertation ay gumagamit ng Frppe's debut-in Social Login Key laban sa kabahaging-bahagi Keycloak OIDC client na walang oauth2-proxy sidecar; LDAP pederation at outbound SMTP via Mailu ay naka - wire kapag naroroon ang kanilang mga tagapaglaan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Fider as part of the Infinito.Nexus stack using a single Docker Compose container backed by PostgreSQL. It configures SSO via Keycloak automatically on first deploy, optional email notifications via Mailu, and HTTPS via NGINX reverse proxy."
msgstr "May ganitong papel Fider bilang bahagi ng Infinito.Nexus pagsasalansan gamit ang isa lamang Docker Compose Inatras na sisidlan PostgreSQL. Inaayos nito ang SSO sa pamamagitan ng Keycloak Kusang - loob sa unang paggamit, opsyonal na mga nota sa email na ginagamit Mailu, at HTTPS sa pamamagitan ng NGINX reverse proxy."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Friendica using Docker, managing the Friendica application container alongside a central MariaDB instance. It provides tools for full resets, manual and automatic database reinitialization, email and general configuration debugging, and autoinstall processes, all to ensure your Friendica installation remains reliable and easy to maintain."
msgstr "May ganitong papel Friendica paggamit ng Docker, pangangasiwa sa Friendica container sa tabi ng gitna MariaDB Halimbawa. Naglalaan ito ng mga kasangkapan para sa ganap na pagsasaayos, manu - mano at awtomatikong pag - aayos ng database, email at pangkalahatang pag - aalis ng kuryente, at pag - iinstala ng sasakyan, lahat ay upang matiyak ang iyong mga proseso Friendica Ang instalasyon ay nananatiling maaasahan at madaling panatilihin."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role deploys Funkwhale using Docker. It orchestrates multiple services (including the API, Frontend, Celery Worker, Celery Beat, and Typesense) integrating with centralized PostgreSQL and Redis services for a fully containerized music sharing experience."
msgstr "May ganitong papel Funkwhale paggamit ng Docker. Ito'y may maraming serbisyo (kasali na ang API, Frontend, Manggagawa ng Celery, Celery Beat, at Typesense) Pakikipag - ugnayan sa mga sentralisado PostgreSQL at Redis mga serbisyo para sa isang ganap na containerized music share karanasan."

