# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the KeePassXC desktop application on Pacman-based workstations through the system package manager. It is intended for personal-workstation roles in the desktop tier and does not configure databases, browser integrations, or autofill helpers."
msgstr "Ang bahaging ito ang nagluluklok sa KeePassXC desktop application sa Pacman-based workstations sa pamamagitan ng system package manager. Ito ay nilalayon para sa mga personal-workstation na papel sa desktop path at hindi nakaayos ang mga database, browser integment, o autofill na katulong."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the Nix package manager in a **secure, reproducible, and idempotent** way across multiple Linux distributions."
msgstr "Ang papel na ito ay nagluluklok sa Nix pakete manager sa isang a **Matatag, madaling baguhin, at walang - hanggan** sa ibayo ng multiple Linux distributions."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the Nix package manager via pacman on Arch x86_64 or via the official installer with SHA256 verification."
msgstr "Ang papel na ito ay nagluluklok sa manedyer ng paketeng Nix sa pamamagitan ng pacman sa Arko x86_64 o sa pamamagitan ng opisyal na installer na may SHA256 beripikasyon."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the OBS Studio desktop application on Pacman-based workstations through the system package manager. It targets the desktop tier and does not configure scenes, capture devices, or streaming profiles."
msgstr "Ang bahaging ito ang nagluluklok sa OBS Studio desktop application sa Pacman-based workstations sa pamamagitan ng system package manager. Pinupuntirya nito ang ibabaw na andana at hindi inaayos ang mga eksena, binibihag ang mga kagamitan, o umaagos na mga profile."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the SSH client packages required to enable secure remote access and key-based authentication on Linux systems. It ensures that the appropriate SSH client is installed depending on the target distribution and that the installation is executed only once."
msgstr "Ang papel na ito ay nag-install ng mga pakete ng kliyente ng SSH na kinakailangan upang magkaroon ng ligtas na remote access at key-based realation sa Linux systems. Tinitiyak nito na ang angkop na kliyente ng SSH ay mailuluklok depende sa target na pamamahagi at na ang instalasyon ay nilalapat nang minsan lamang."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the [python-pip](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)) package on the target system. It ensures that the pip package manager is available for installing Python packages."
msgstr "Ang bahaging ito ang nagluluklok sa [python-pip](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)) pakete sa target system. Tinitiyak nito na ang pip pakete manager ay makukuha para sa pag-install ng mga paketeng Python."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) package and deploys a default sudoers file to ensure secure and consistent privilege escalation on the target system. It uses a preconfigured sudoers file that follows best practices and includes directives to read drop-in files from `/etc/sudoers.d`."
msgstr "Ang bahaging ito ang nagluluklok sa [sudo](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo) at naglalagay ng talaksang default sudoers upang matiyak ang matatag at di - nagbabagong pribilehiyo na lumalaganap sa target na sistema. Gumagamit ito ng pre-ayos na talaksang sudoers na sumusunod sa mga pinakamahusay na gawain at kinabibilangan ng mga instruksiyon upang basahin ang mga drop-in file mula sa `/etc/sudoers.d`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the ``baudolo`` CLI, lays out the on-host backup tree, deploys the systemd service that drives the periodic run, and wires the cleanup-of-failed-backups dependency so partial snapshots are not retained. Database seeding for individual apps is contributed by the consumer roles via ``tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml``, which they include conditionally once ``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` is in ``group_names``."
msgstr "Ang bahaging ito ang nagluluklok sa ``baudolo`` Ang CLI, ang naglalatag ng on-host backup tree, ay naglalagay ng systemd service na nagpapatakbo sa pana-panahong pagtakbo, at ang mga kawad ng paglilinis-of-failed-backups dependency kaya ang mga partial snaps ay hindi pinananatili. Ang buto ng Datbase para sa bawat apps ay may bahagi sa mamimili sa pamamagitan ng ``tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml``, na kasama rito minsan ``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` nasa ``group_names``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `baudolo` CLI, lays out the on-host backup tree, deploys the systemd service that drives the periodic run, and wires the cleanup-of-failed-backups dependency so partial snapshots are not retained. Database seeding for individual apps is contributed by the consumer roles via `tasks/03_seed-database-to-backup.yml`, which they include conditionally once `svc-bkp-volume-2-local` is in `group_names`."
