# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `python-pip <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)>`__ package on the target system. It ensures that the pip package manager is available for installing Python packages."
msgstr "Ang bahaging ito ang nagluluklok sa `python-pip <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pip_(package_manager)>`__ pakete sa target system. Tinitiyak nito na ang pip pakete manager ay makukuha para sa pag-install ng mga paketeng Python."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ package and deploys a default sudoers file to ensure secure and consistent privilege escalation on the target system. It uses a preconfigured sudoers file that follows best practices and includes directives to read drop-in files from ``/etc/sudoers.d``."
msgstr "Ang bahaging ito ang nagluluklok sa `sudo <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sudo>`__ at naglalagay ng talaksang default sudoers upang matiyak ang matatag at di - nagbabagong pribilehiyo na lumalaganap sa target na sistema. Gumagamit ito ng pre-ayos na talaksang sudoers na sumusunod sa mga pinakamahusay na gawain at kinabibilangan ng mga instruksiyon upang basahin ang mga drop-in file mula sa ``/etc/sudoers.d``."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL`), and serialises the run against the rest of the manipulation group via [sys-lock](../sys-lock/). The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the [svc-storage-nfs-server](../svc-storage-nfs-server/) services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) to keep the snapshot tree bounded and [user-backup](../user-backup/) so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr "Ang papel na ito ay nagluluklok ng backup script at ng naka - system na serbisyo na nagpapatakbo rito sa isinaayos na iskedyul (`SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL`), at serialises ang pagtakbo laban sa iba pang pangkat ng manipulasyon sa pamamagitan ng [sys-lock](../sys-lock/). Ang source path ay ang base ng NFS export na nalutas mula sa source path na naayos mula sa NFS [svc-storage-nfs-server](../svc-storage-nfs-server/) ang mga serbisyo ng SPOT; paglalagay ng papel sa punong - abala na naglilingkod sa pagluluwas. Lumulutang [sys-ctl-cln-bkps](../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/) upang panatilihing nakatali ang nakunang punungkahoy at [user-backup](../user-backup/) Kaya ang punungkahoy ay maaaring hilahin ng mga nag - anyaya sa tabi ng ilog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the backup script and the systemd service that drives it on the configured schedule (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL``), and serialises the run against the rest of the manipulation group via `sys-lock <../sys-lock/>`__. The source path is the NFS export base resolved from the `svc-storage-nfs-server <../svc-storage-nfs-server/>`__ services SPOT; deploy the role on the host that serves the export. Deploy `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ to keep the snapshot tree bounded and `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ so downstream hosts can pull the tree."
msgstr "Ang papel na ito ay nagluluklok ng backup script at ng naka - system na serbisyo na nagpapatakbo rito sa isinaayos na iskedyul (``SYS_SCHEDULE_BACKUP_NFS_TO_LOCAL``), at serialises ang pagtakbo laban sa iba pang pangkat ng manipulasyon sa pamamagitan ng `sys-lock <../sys-lock/>`__. Ang source path ay ang base ng NFS export na nalutas mula sa source path na naayos mula sa NFS `svc-storage-nfs-server <../svc-storage-nfs-server/>`__ ang mga serbisyo ng SPOT; paglalagay ng papel sa punong - abala na naglilingkod sa pagluluwas. Lumulutang `sys-ctl-cln-bkps <../sys-ctl-cln-bkps/>`__ upang panatilihing nakatali ang nakunang punungkahoy at `user-backup <../user-backup/>`__ Kaya ang punungkahoy ay maaaring hilahin ng mga nag - anyaya sa tabi ng ilog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group ``svc-swarm-node`` and probe-mounts the configured ``storage.nfs.server`` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
msgstr "Ang papel na ito ay nag-install ng distro-appropriate NFS client packages sa bawat host sa grupong Ansible ``svc-swarm-node`` at ang probe-mounts ang nakaayos ``storage.nfs.server`` at ang himpilan ng pagluluwas mula sa svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT upang tiyakin ang kakayahan at pagiging madaling gamitin sa kasalukuyang panahon. Ang aktuwal na stacker volume mounts ay nangyari mamaya, na pinapatakbo ng Docker engine sa container start."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role installs the distro-appropriate NFS client packages on every host in the Ansible group `svc-swarm-node` and probe-mounts the configured `storage.nfs.server` and the export base from the svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT to confirm reachability and writability at deploy time. The actual docker volume mounts happen later, driven by the Docker engine at container start."
msgstr "Ang papel na ito ay nag-install ng distro-appropriate NFS client packages sa bawat host sa grupong Ansible `svc-swarm-node` at ang probe-mounts ang nakaayos `storage.nfs.server` at ang himpilan ng pagluluwas mula sa svc-storage-nfs-server services.yml SPOT upang tiyakin ang kakayahan at pagiging madaling gamitin sa kasalukuyang panahon. Ang aktuwal na stacker volume mounts ay nangyari mamaya, na pinapatakbo ng Docker engine sa container start."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role is a generic GNOME-extension installer driven by ``services.gnome-extensions.plugins``, a 3-tuple list (``action``, ``uuid``, ``url``) consumed by ``cli-gnome-extension-manager``. It ships no concrete extensions of its own and reads no ``meta/addons/`` files. Roles that ship concrete GNOME extensions, such as `dsk-gnome <../dsk-gnome/>`__, declare them through the unified addon contract under ``meta/addons/`` (requirement 026), with one file per extension (``mechanism: extension``, ``source: upstream``, ``config: { uuid, url }``); see that role for the per-file example."
msgstr "Ang papel na ito ay isang generic na installer ng pag-extension na pinapatakbo ng ``services.gnome-extensions.plugins``, a 3- Tinanggal ang listahan (``action``, ``uuid``, ``url``) kinakain ng ``cli-gnome-extension-manager``. Hindi ito nagpapadala ng sariling kongkretong ekstensiyon at hindi ito nagbabasa ``meta/addons/`` mga file. Mga papel na ginagampanan ng barkong may kongkretong mga extension ngrkton, gaya ng `dsk-gnome <../dsk-gnome/>`__, ipahayag ang mga ito sa pamamagitan ng nagkakaisang kontrata ng addon sa ilalim ``meta/addons/`` (kailangan 026), na may isang talaksan sa bawat extension (``mechanism: extension``, ``source: upstream``, ``config: { uuid, url }``); tingnan ang papel na iyon para sa halimbawang per-file."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "This role is a generic GNOME-extension installer driven by `services.gnome-extensions.plugins`, a 3-tuple list (`action`, `uuid`, `url`) consumed by `cli-gnome-extension-manager`. It ships no concrete extensions of its own and reads no `meta/addons/` files. Roles that ship concrete GNOME extensions, such as [dsk-gnome](../dsk-gnome/), declare them through the unified addon contract under `meta/addons/` (requirement 026), with one file per extension (`mechanism: extension`, `source: upstream`, `config: { uuid, url }`); see that role for the per-file example."
msgstr "Ang papel na ito ay isang generic na installer ng pag-extension na pinapatakbo ng `services.gnome-extensions.plugins`, a 3- Tinanggal ang listahan (`action`, `uuid`, `url`) kinakain ng `cli-gnome-extension-manager`. Hindi ito nagpapadala ng sariling kongkretong ekstensiyon at hindi ito nagbabasa `meta/addons/` mga file. Mga papel na ginagampanan ng barkong may kongkretong mga extension ngrkton, gaya ng [dsk-gnome](../dsk-gnome/), ipahayag ang mga ito sa pamamagitan ng nagkakaisang kontrata ng addon sa ilalim `meta/addons/` (kailangan 026), na may isang talaksan sa bawat extension (`mechanism: extension`, `source: upstream`, `config: { uuid, url }`); tingnan ang papel na iyon para sa halimbawang per-file."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "This role is a group-name tag. It exists so the project's inventory validator accepts `svc-swarm-manager` as a legitimate application_id. The actual swarm-init logic lives in `svc-swarm-node` and dispatches on `'svc-swarm-manager' in group_names`."
