# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Three settings keys in `vars/main.yml` are silent no-ops on v6.2.0: `security.enable_captcha`, `security.captcha_key` and `security.captcha_secret`. The live `settings` table carries a single `security.captcha` object (`{\"altcha\": {…}, \"hcaptcha\": {\"key\", \"secret\", \"enabled\"}}`), so all three `UPDATE`s match zero rows and neither `ON_ERROR_STOP` nor the reaper notices. hCaptcha has therefore never been active, which also makes the `HCAPTCHA_SERVICE_ENABLED` rationale in `templates/playwright.env.j2` describe protection that is not there. Rewrite the three keys as one object, then decide whether a captcha on the public subscription form is wanted at all."
msgstr "Tatlong setting key sa `vars/main.yml` ay tahimik na mga no-op sa v6.2.0: `security.enable_captcha`, `security.captcha_key` at `security.captcha_secret`. Ang buhay `settings` ang isang mesa `security.captcha` bagay (`{\"altcha\": {…}, \"hcaptcha\": {\"key\", \"secret\", \"enabled\"}}`), kaya silang tatlo `UPDATE`magtugma ang mga hanay na sero at ang alinman dito `ON_ERROR_STOP` Ni napapansin man ito ng mang - aani. Kaya ang hCaptcha ay hindi kailanman naging aktibo, na siya ring gumagawa sa `HCAPTCHA_SERVICE_ENABLED` Mangangatuwiran `templates/playwright.env.j2` ay naglalarawan ng proteksiyon na wala roon. Isulat muli ang tatlong susi bilang isang bagay, pagkatapos ay magpasiya kung ang isang captcha sa anyong pampublikong suskripsiyon ay nais."

