msgid "Unified addon syntax (requirement 026): every role-level plugin, browser/GNOME extension, Matrix bridge and cross-role integration was migrated to a single declarative *meta/addons/* contract, replacing the per-role ad-hoc plugin definitions. 86 addon files now describe addons for *desk-chromium*, *desk-firefox*, *desk-gnome*, *web-app-discourse*, *web-app-friendica*, *web-app-joomla*, *web-app-mediawiki*, *web-app-pretix*, *web-app-wordpress*, *web-app-xwiki*, *web-app-nextcloud*, *web-app-odoo* and *web-app-matrix*. Each service-coupled addon gets a *tasks/addons* integration hook and its own Playwright spec (87 per-addon specs added), addon flags are gated on actual partner deployment through a new *addon_env_flags* lookup, and a lint requires a hook plus a spec for every coupled addon. The cross-role integration matrix is regenerated from a dedicated data module (*integration_matrix_data.py*)."
msgstr "Di - maipaliwanag na mga Adon Compost (kailangan 026): bawat bahaging-level plin, browser/GNOME extension, Matrix Ang tulay at cross-role integration ay nailipat sa isang declarative *meta/admons/* kontrata, palitan ang per-role ad-hoc plubin na depinisyon. 86 Ang mga talaksang addon ngayon ay naglalarawan ng mga addon para sa *desk-chromium*, *desk-firefox*, *desk-gnome*, *web-app-discourse*, *web-app-friendica*, *web-app-joomla*, *web-app-mediawiki*, *web-app-pretix*, *web-app-wordpress*, *web-app-xwiki*, *web-app-nextcloud*, *web-app-odoo* at *web-app-matrix*. Ang bawat service-coupled addon ay nakakakuha ng isang addon *mga gawain/addon* Pagsasama ng kawit at ng sarili nitong uri ng Playwright (87 Idinagdag ang per-addon specs), ang mga bandilang addon ay ipinarada sa aktuwal na kapareha sa pamamagitan ng isang bago *addon_env_flags* Pagtingin, at isang lint ay nangangailangan ng isang hook at isang spec sa bawat mag-asawang addon. Ang cross-role integration matrix ay muling ginagawa mula sa isang dedikadong data module (*integration_matrix_data.py*)."

