# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Upstream MDAD is a fully-fledged Ansible playbook (`setup.yml` plus a top-level role `matrix-base` that pulls in roughly seventy sub-roles). It is NOT a drop-in Ansible role: it expects to be the root playbook with its own inventory hosts (`matrix.{{ DOMAIN }}` style) and its own `host_vars/<host>/vars.yml`."
msgstr "Ang Upstream MDAD ay isang full-fled Ansible playbook (`setup.yml` Tapos isang pang-itaas na papel `matrix-base` na humihila ng mga pitumpung sub-role). Hindi ito isang papel na drop-in Ansible: inaasahang ito ang root playbook na may sarili nitong imbentaryong host (`matrix.{{ DOMAIN }}` istilo) at ang sarili nito `host_vars/<host>/vars.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
