msgid "Users design flows on a drag-and-drop canvas (LLM, RAG, tools, webhooks), test them interactively, and publish endpoints that applications or bots can call. Flowise works well with local backends such as **Ollama** (directly or via **LiteLLM**) and **Qdrant** for retrieval."
