# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Whether a resolver answers on the bridge is not something the host's own ``resolv.conf`` can say - a systemd-resolved stub and a node dnsmasq both read as loopback-only, and only the second one also binds the bridge. Until that is declared rather than inferred, the bridge may be an address nothing serves, so it never goes out alone: a list that would carry it by itself gets the project's public resolver behind it. Without that the daemon has a single dead nameserver and every container and image build loses DNS."
msgstr "Hindi sagot ng punong - abala kung sasagot ba siya sa tulay ``resolv.conf`` ay maaaring magsabi - isang systemd-resoluted stub at isang node dnsmasq na parehong binabasa bilang loopback-lamang, at ang ikalawa lamang ang nagbibigkis sa tulay. Hangga't hindi ito ipinahahayag sa halip na inferred, ang tulay ay maaaring walang anumang silbi, kaya hindi ito lumalabas na mag - isa: isang listahan na magdadala nito sa ganang sarili ay nakakakuha ng pangmadlang tagalutas ng proyekto sa likuran nito. Kung wala nito, ang daemon ay may nag-iisang patay na momeserver at bawat lalagyan at imaheng itinatayo ay nawawalan ng DNS."

