# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "WordPress's canonical surface is the public blog front page. The OIDC round-trip fires on `/wp-login.php`, which the `daggerhart-openid-connect-generic` addon auto-redirects to Keycloak (`login_type: auto`, see [`meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml`](./meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml)); the shared personas enter at the site root and never visit that path. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The journeys themselves are not dropped: `test-admin-oidc-login.js` drives the admin login, logout and landing assertion, and `test-rbac-roles.js` drives the Keycloak-group-to-WordPress-role mapping over the same entry point."
msgstr "Ang kanonikal na ibabaw ng WordPress ay ang public blog front page. Ang apoy ng OIDC round-trip `/wp-login.php`, na siyang `daggerhart-openid-connect-generic` I-dod ang auto-redirects sa Keycloak (`login_type: auto`, tingnan [`meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml`](./meta/addons/daggerhart-openid-connect-generic.yml)); ang kabahaging mga persona ay pumapasok sa ugat ng site at hindi kailanman pumupunta sa landas na iyon. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) samakatuwid ay ipahayag `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` at `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Ang mga paglalakbay mismo ay hindi ibinababa: `test-admin-oidc-login.js` ang nagpapatakbo sa admin login, logout at landing demand, at `test-rbac-roles.js` ang nagpapatakbo sa Keycloak-logo-to-WordPress- Irole sopa sa parehong entidad."

