msgstr "Ang iyong mgaL ay walang katutubong SSO; ang sesyon ng admin ay ginawa mula sa oauth2-proxy identity header sa pamamagitan ng ``shunt_is_valid_user`` drop-in ```files/sso/infinito_sso.php`` <./files/sso/infinito_sso.php>`__, which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group (```meta/services.yml`` <./meta/services.yml>`__), so ``biber`` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true``, and the denial is asserted explicitly by ``files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js``. The ``administrator`` Ang isa ay nananatiling buháy at nagsasagawa ng dulo ng tulay."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "YOURLS has no native SSO; the admin session is minted from the oauth2-proxy identity header by the `shunt_is_valid_user` drop-in in [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), which honours the header only on the gated admin path and only for members of the YOURLS administrator group. The gate itself admits only that same RBAC group ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), so `biber` is rejected before YOURLS renders anything: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, and the denial is asserted explicitly by `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. The `administrator` persona stays live and exercises the bridge end to end."
msgstr "Ang iyong mgaL ay walang katutubong SSO; ang sesyon ng admin ay ginawa mula sa oauth2-proxy identity header sa pamamagitan ng `shunt_is_valid_user` drop-in [`files/sso/infinito_sso.php`](./files/sso/infinito_sso.php), na nagpaparangal lamang sa tagapangulo sa may tarangkahang admin path at para lamang sa mga miyembro ng admin YOURLS Grupong administrador. Ang tarangkahan mismo ang umaamin lamang sa grupong iyon ng RBAC ([`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml)), kaya `biber` ay tinatanggihan bago YOURLS isalin ang anumang bagay: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) sabi ng `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`, at ang pagkakaila ay tuwirang iginigiit ng `files/playwright/test-biber-denied.js`. Ang `administrator` Ang isa ay nananatiling buháy at nagsasagawa ng dulo ng tulay."

