# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] \"Sign in with Bluesky\" completes an AT Protocol OAuth round-trip against the platform PDS provided by [`web-app-bluesky`](../../roles/web-app-bluesky/), and an authenticated user can create a `community.lexicon.calendar.event` record that is written to their PDS repo."
msgstr "[ ] \"Sumulat na kasama ng Bluesky\" Tinatapos ang AT Protocol OAuth round-trip laban sa platapormang inilaan ng PDS [`web-app-bluesky`](../../roles/web-app-bluesky/), at ang isang tiyak na gumagamit ay maaaring lumikha ng isang `community.lexicon.calendar.event` record na nakasulat sa kanilang PDS repo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] (Phase 2) A Flowise supervisor flow runs a cross-agent pipeline that hands a result from one agent to the other and returns a combined output; single-agent use still works without Flowise. **Blocked:** depends on the criterion above."
msgstr "[ ] (Bilis 2) A Flowise Ang daloy ng superbisor ay nagpapatakbo ng isang cross-agent pipeline na nag-aabot ng isang resulta mula sa isang agent tungo sa isa pa at nagbabalik ng isang pinagsamang output; ang isahang-agent na paggamit ay gumagana pa rin ng wala Flowise. **Naharangan:** ay depende sa pamantayan sa itaas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] (Phase 2) Hermes' and OpenClaw's MCP-server mode is enabled; Flowise connects to both as MCP clients and delegates a task to each. **Blocked:** `stdio_only`, see [Blocked on hardware and on Phase 2](#blocked-on-hardware-and-on-phase-2)."
msgstr "[ ] (Bilis 2) Si Hermes at si Hermes OpenClawAng MCP-server mode ay nagagawa; ang Flowise ay kumokonekta sa parehong bilang MCP clients at mga delegado ng isang atas sa bawat isa. **Naharangan:** `stdio_only`, tingnan [Nakabara sa hardware at sa Phase 2](#blocked-on-hardware-and-on-phase-2)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] **Clarifying questions only at the start.** Any open question, ambiguity, or missing decision (e.g. how the worker join tokens are persisted, exact NFS export options per distro, how the per-role `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` opt-out is plumbed, exact placement-constraint shape for the swarm-without-nfs warning path, exact openresty `upstream` resolution syntax for swarm-internal DNS) MUST be raised once at the very beginning of the run, in a single batched question round, BEFORE any file is changed. Once those questions are answered, the agent MUST NOT pause for further clarification. Additional ambiguities discovered mid-run MUST be resolved by the agent using its best judgement, recorded in the affected role's `README.md` or a code comment, and revisited only at PR review."
msgstr "[ ] **Sa simula pa lamang ay bumabangon na ang mga tanong.** Anumang tanong, alinlangan, o maling pasiya (e.g. kung paano sumasali ang manggagawa sa mga tokens, eksaktong NFS export options kada distro, paano ang per-role `DEPLOYMENT_MODE: compose` Ang opt-out ay tubero, eksaktong placement-constraint na hugis para sa kuyog-walang-nfs warning path, eksaktong openrety `upstream` Resolution to pluster-internal DNS) UPANG maibangon minsan sa simula pa lamang ng pagtakbo, sa isang nakasalansang round na tanong, BAGO baguhin ang anumang salansan. Minsang masagot ang mga tanong na iyan, hindi humihinto ang ahente para sa higit pang paglilinaw. Ang karagdagang mga ambiguidad na natuklasang mid-run MUST ay maaaring lutasin ng ahente gamit ang pinakamahusay nitong paghuhusga, na naitala sa apektadong papel's `README.md` o isang komento ng kodigo, at muling sinuri lamang sa PR."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] **Every ✅ cell is wired**: for each ✅ pair (row → column), the row role declares an addon in its `meta/addons/` that integrates the column role, with `mechanism` set appropriately and (when the column role is an in-repo role) a `bridges:` entry resolving to the row role's `meta/services.yml` service for that target."
msgstr "[ ] **Bawat Isa ✅ ang selula ay may kawad**: para sa bawat isa ✅ pares (→ kolum), ang papel ng hanay ay nagpapahayag ng isang addon sa kanyang `meta/addons/` na nag - uugnay sa papel ng hanay, pati na ang `mechanism` inilagay nang angkop at (kapag ang hanay papel ay isang papel na in-repo) a `bridges:` Nagpapasiya sa papel ng hanay `meta/services.yml` sa layuning iyan."

