# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "[ ] A sealed instance is detectable: `/v1/sys/health` returns 503 (asserted by `test-seal-status.js`) and an alert rule fires on that condition. *An `OpenBaoSealed` alert now ships with the role itself, in `templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2`, which the `alert_rule_roles` lookup concatenates into the Prometheus rule file. The health-code contract is asserted by the spec suite and the healthy path was confirmed live (200 in both compose and swarm), but the **firing** condition was never observed — that needs an instance deliberately sealed, which the AppRole-only admin model makes awkward to arrange in a test.* **Correction from implementation:** OpenBao keeps Vault's metric namespace, so the gauge is `vault_core_unsealed`, not `openbao_core_unsealed` — and it is unusable as an alert source here: on a healthy, demonstrably unsealed node it is emitted as `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, so `== 0` would fire permanently. Use the health endpoint as the primary signal, with `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` as the metric-side corroboration. The alert rule itself is still outstanding."
msgstr "[ ] Ang isang tinatakang halimbawa ay maaaring mapansin: `/v1/sys/health` bumalik 503 (iginiit ni `test-seal-status.js`) at isang alistong alituntunin ang nag - aalab sa kalagayang iyon. *An `OpenBaoSealed` Mag - ingat ngayon sa mga barko na ang papel ay ginagampanan, sa `templates/prometheus/alert_rules.yml.j2`, na siyang `alert_rule_roles` Lumaganap ang pag - eensayo Prometheus Ang talaksang alituntunin. Ang kontratang pangkalusugan-code ay iginigiit ng spec suite at ang malusog na landas ay napatunayang live (200 sa kapuwa katha at kuyog), ngunit ang **paputok** Hindi kailanman naobserbahan ang kondisyon – na nangangailangan ng isang pagkakataon na sinadyang selyado, na nakaaasiwang isaayos ng modelong AppRole-lamang admin sa isang pagsusulit.* **Pagtutuwid mula sa pagpapatupad:** Pinananatili ng OpenBao ang metrikong pangalan ng Vault, kaya ang gauge ay `vault_core_unsealed`, hindi `openbao_core_unsealed` — at ito'y hindi maaaring maging isang alistong pinagmumulan dito: sa isang malusog, di - matututulang node ito'y inilalabas na gaya ng inilalabas `vault_core_unsealed{cluster=\"\"} 0`, kaya `== 0` ang permanenteng magpapaputok. Gamitin ang estasyong pangkalusugan bilang pangunahing hudyat, na may kasamang `vault_core_active{cluster=\"…\"} == 1` bilang metriko-side na pagpapatunay. Ang alistong tuntunin mismo ay natatangi pa rin."

