# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Creating an agent optionally provisions a dedicated platform user account via the existing `users`/LDAP/Keycloak mechanism; the agent authenticates as that account (OIDC dashboard login, MCP `auth_subject: user`), and deploying against an existing account instead also works. **Partly done:** the account half is implemented and linted (see [Agent identity](#agent-identity)); the MCP half is **blocked** on no deployed provider offering per-user OAuth, which is the bar [ADR 0003](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md) sets before `auth_subject: user` may be declared."
msgstr "[ ] Ang paglikha ng isang agent nang hindi sapilitan ay nagbibigay ng isang dedikadong account sa plataporma sa pamamagitan ng umiiral `users`/LDAP/Keycloak mekanismo; ang ahente ay nagpapatunay na gayon nga (OIDC dashboard login, MCP `auth_subject: user`), at sa halip ay laban sa umiiral na ulat ay gumagana rin. **Bahaging ginawa:** ang kalahati ng ulat ay ipinatutupad at binabaybay (tingnan [Mga Ahente](#agent-identity)); ang kalahati ng MCP ay **barado** sa walang magagamit na provider na nag-aalok ng per-user OAuth, na siyang bar [ADR 0003](../architecture/decisions/0003-mcp-surface-per-provider.md) nakaharap `auth_subject: user` ay maaaring ipahayag."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] Credentials and secret URL components are absent from logs, generated non-secret configuration, API responses, task output, Playwright traces, and exception text. **Three of the six surfaces are held statically:** logs and task output by [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), which requires `no_log` or `mask_values` on any MCP task that both handles a secret and prints; Playwright traces by [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), which forbids a `playwright.env.j2` from rendering `mcp_credential`, a `credentials.mcp_*` secret or a `key_credential` URL component. Generated non-secret configuration needs a secret/non-secret classification of rendered files that does not exist yet; API responses and exception text are runtime observations for the deploy phase."
msgstr "[ ] Ang mga kredential at lihim na mga bahagi ng URL ay wala sa mga troso, lumilikha ng hindi-lihim na pagsasaayos, API mga tugon, task output, Playwright bakas, at eksepsiyon teksto. **Tatlo sa anim na pang - ibabaw ay nasa staticly:** mga troso at task output ng [test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secrets_are_masked.py), na nangangailangan ng `no_log` o `mask_values` sa anomang gawain ng MCP na kapuwa humahawak ng isang lihim at naglilimbag; Tamang mga bakas ng laro [test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py](../../tests/lint/ansible/services/test_mcp_secret_not_in_playwright.py), na nagbabawal ng isang `playwright.env.j2` kapag nagsasalin `mcp_credential`, a `credentials.mcp_*` lihim o a `key_credential` Bahagi ng URL. Generated non-secre configuration ay nangangailangan ng isang lihim/non-secre classification ng mga iginawad na file na hindi pa umiiral; API mga tugon at eksepsiyon teksto ay runtime obserbasyon para sa stased phase."

