# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] When OIDC is enabled, the role creates the Keycloak `administrator` as an external Semaphore admin at deploy time (`semaphore user add --admin --external`, matching `preferred_username` + email), so the OIDC callback elevates that operator to admin (verified for the `administrator` persona). Upstream has no native claim→admin mapping; this deploy-time external-admin seed is the documented smallest reconciliation step (README)."
msgstr "[ ] Kapag nagawa ang OIDC, ang papel ay lumilikha ng Keycloak `administrator` bilang isang panlabas na Semaphore admin sa kasalukuyang panahon (`semaphore user add --admin --external`, katugma `preferred_username` + email), kaya itinataas ng OIDC callback ang operator sa admin (Pinatunayan para sa `administrator` tao). Upstream ay walang katutubong pag-aangkin→admin sopang; ang prese-time panlabas na-admin na buto na ito ay ang dokumentadong pinakamaliit na hakbang ng pakikipagkasundo (PAGBABASA)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] When SSO is enabled, the oauth2-proxy gate fronts Checkmk and authenticates against Keycloak (client auto-provisioned via the `redirect_uris` filter)."
msgstr "[ ] Kapag ang SSO ay nagawa, ang oauth2- Magarbong tarangkahan sa harap Checkmk at nagpapatunay laban sa Keycloak (Ang kliyente ay gumagamit ng auto-provision sa pamamagitan ng `redirect_uris` filter)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] When `svc-db-openldap` is in `group_names`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ENABLE=true` plus `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SERVER` (host:port), `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_BIND_DN` / `_BIND_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_DN` / `_SEARCH_FILTER`, and the `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_*` attributes are rendered from the central LDAP vars (env names per the v2.x config schema)."
msgstr "[ ] Kailan `svc-db-openldap` nasa `group_names`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ENABLE=true` plus `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SERVER` (punong - abala: Pag - uulat), `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_BIND_DN` / `_BIND_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_DN` / `_SEARCH_FILTER`, at ang `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_*` Ang mga katangian ay isinalin mula sa gitnang LDAP vars (mga pangalan sa bawat v2.x Larawan ng schema)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[ ] When `svc-db-openldap` is in `group_names`, an LDAP connection is provisioned (`files/configure-sso.sh`) so LDAP users (matching the `X-Remote-User`) exist with roles/contact groups. LDAP is a backend identity source behind the oauth2 gate — there is no separate LDAP login surface, so it is exempted from a Playwright gate (`# nocheck: playwright-service-flag`), mirroring [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)."
msgstr "[ ] Kailan `svc-db-openldap` nasa `group_names`, isang koneksiyon ng LDAP ang inilalaan (`files/configure-sso.sh`) kaya't ang mga gumagamit ng LDAP (Katumbas ng `X-Remote-User`) Umiiral na may mga papel/contact group. Ang LDAP ay isang backend identity source sa likod ng oauth2 tarangkahan — walang hiwalay na LDAP login ibabaw, kaya ito ay libre sa isang Playwright gate (`# nocheck: playwright-service-flag`), Pagsalamin [`web-app-openproject`](../../roles/web-app-openproject/)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
