# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[CHANGELOG.md](../../../CHANGELOG.md) at the repository root holds the most recent releases inline. Older releases live one-file-per-version under [docs/changelog/](../../changelog/), linked from the `## Older Releases` section at the bottom of the active changelog."
msgstr "[CHANGELOG.md](../../../CHANGELOG.md) sa ugat na pinaglalagyan ng laman ang pinakabagong inilabas na inline. Ang mga lumang release ay live na isang-file-per-version sa ilalim [docs/changelo/](../../changelog/), kaugnay sa `## Older Releases` seksiyon sa ibaba ng aktibong changelog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[CHANGELOG.md](../../../CHANGELOG.md) is trimmed; every older entry is written to its own file under [docs/changelog/](../../changelog/) named `<padded-semver>-<release-date>.md`, and the `## Older Releases` index at the bottom of the active changelog is rebuilt from the archive directory listing so it never drifts away from what is on disk."
msgstr "[CHANGELOG.md](../../../CHANGELOG.md) ay pinuputol; bawat mas matandang pagpasok ay isinusulat sa sarili nitong salansan sa ilalim [docs/changelo/](../../changelog/) Pangalan `<padded-semver>-<release-date>.md`, at ang `## Older Releases` Ang indise sa ibaba ng aktibong changelog ay muling itinatayo mula sa arkibong directory na nagtatala upang hindi ito kailanman maanod palayo sa nasa disk."

