# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`mcp_authorization`](../../../../../../plugins/filter/mcp/authorization.py) raises for `auth: oidc`, because a rendered config cannot carry a caller's token, and `mcp_authorization_is_renderable` returns `false` so the static-config clients drop the server instead of presenting a wrong secret."
msgstr "[`mcp_authorization`](../../../../../../plugins/filter/mcp/authorization.py) kailangan `auth: oidc`, sapagkat hindi kayang dalhin ng isang iginawad na pagkaayos ang tanda ng tumatawag, at ang isang salin ay hindi makapagdadala ng isang tanda `mcp_authorization_is_renderable` bumalik `false` kaya't ang mga static-config na kliyente ay naghulog ng server sa halip na magharap ng maling lihim."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`mcp_tool_server_connections`](../../../../../../plugins/filter/mcp/tool_server_connections.py) emits `auth_type: system_oauth` with an empty `key` for those servers, so Open WebUI resolves the caller's own token per request."
msgstr "[`mcp_tool_server_connections`](../../../../../../plugins/filter/mcp/tool_server_connections.py) naglalabas `auth_type: system_oauth` na walang laman `key` para sa mga server na iyon, kaya Open WebUI ang bawat kahilingan ng tumatawag."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) admits only the Prometheus administrator RBAC group through the oauth2-proxy gate, so the `biber` persona is denied before it ever reaches a Prometheus page: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. That denial is not lost coverage — this role's own spec asserts it for every consumer, together with the admin reach and scrape-target parity checks. The `administrator` persona is blocked only when `services.sso.enabled` is false: without the co-deployed Keycloak there is no proxy in front of Prometheus, hence no login round-trip and no logout control to drive. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) ang tanging inaamin Prometheus Ang administrador na grupo ng RBAC sa pamamagitan ng oauth2- Maluwag na tarangkahan, kaya ang `biber` ang isang tao ay pinagkakaitan bago pa ito makarating sa isang Prometheus pahina: [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) sabi ng `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. Ang pagkakailang iyon ay hindi nawawalang pagsaklaw – iginigiit ito ng sariling spec ng papel na ito para sa bawat mamimili, kasama ang admin maabot at scrap-target parity check. Ang `administrator` ang isang tao ay hinahadlangan lamang kapag `services.sso.enabled` ay mali: walang co-deployed Keycloak walang proxy sa harap ng Prometheus, samakatuwid walang login round-trip at walang logout control upang magmaneho. Ang `guest` ang sabi ng tao at ng baseline cantableally."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) admits only the `web-app-lam` administrator RBAC group to the oauth2-proxy (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`), and `biber` carries an empty role list in the development inventory. The proxy denies `biber` before LAM is ever reached, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) ang tanging inaamin `web-app-lam` Executive RBAC group sa oauth2-proxy (`sso.oauth2.allowed_groups`), at `biber` ay nagdadala ng isang walang laman na talaan ng papel sa imbentaryo ng pag - unlad. Itinatanggi ng proxy `biber` bago LAM ay nararating, kaya [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) sabi ng `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) declares no `sso` service, so this role is never registered as a Keycloak client. Its only HTTP surface is the anonymous logout conductor and the `/logout` endpoints proxied by [`templates/logout-proxy.conf.j2`](./templates/logout-proxy.conf.j2) — there is no login form, no account and no session to end. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The service's real coverage is per consumer: [`files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) parameterises the injected logout JS over `roles_with_service('logout')`."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) sabi ng hindi `sso` serbisyo, kaya ang papel na ito ay hindi kailanman nakarehistro Keycloak kliyente. Ang tanging HTTP na ibabaw nito ay ang hindi kilalang konduktor ng logout at ang hindi kilalang konduktor ng logout `/logout` Mga endpoint na Nililinyahan ng [`templates/logout-proxy.conf.j2`](./templates/logout-proxy.conf.j2) — walang login form, walang account at walang sesyon na matatapos. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) samakatuwid ay ipahayag `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` at `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Ang tunay na saklaw ng serbisyo ay sa bawat mamimili: [`files/playwright/playwright.spec.js`](./files/playwright/playwright.spec.js) Ang injection logout JS sa ibabaw nito `roles_with_service('logout')`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) pins `sso.enabled` and `logout.enabled` to `false`, and the role seeds no chess account — [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) renders only the `APP_ADMIN_URL` / `APP_ADMIN_EMAIL` contact pair. Neither the `biber` nor the `administrator` persona has a login surface here, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) mga tulos `sso.enabled` at `logout.enabled` hanggang sa `false`, at ang papel na ginagampanan ng binhi ay walang account sa chess — [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) isalin lamang ang `APP_ADMIN_URL` / `APP_ADMIN_EMAIL` contact pares. Alinman sa dalawa `biber` ni ang `administrator` May login sa ibabaw dito, kaya [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) sabi ng `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` at `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Ang `guest` ang sabi ng tao at ng baseline cantableally."

