# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/01_admin.yml`](./tasks/01_admin.yml) provisions only the administrator in Shopware's user table. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) pins `services.sso.flavor: oidc`, so no oauth2-proxy fronts the role and the storefront carries no authenticated surface at all; the Keycloak login provider that [`tasks/setup/oidc.yml`](./tasks/setup/oidc.yml) configures covers the administration backend alone. `biber` therefore has no account in any matrix variant and [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` unconditionally."
msgstr "[`tasks/01_admin.yml`](./tasks/01_admin.yml) ang tanging probisyon ng administrador Shopware'sa mesa ng gumagamit nito. [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml) mga tulos `services.sso.flavor: oidc`, kaya walang oauth2-proxy ang may hawak sa papel at sa harap ng tindahan ay walang dalang tunay na ibabaw; ang Keycloak Tagatustos ng login na [`tasks/setup/oidc.yml`](./tasks/setup/oidc.yml) Ang mga pagsasaayos ay sumasaklaw sa administration backend lamang. `biber` samakatuwid ay walang ulat sa anumang uri ng matrix at [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) salin `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` Walang pasubali."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/01_setup.yml`](./tasks/01_setup.yml) seeds only the administrator into Magento's admin table (`bin/magento setup:install --admin-user`, credentials from [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)); `biber` reaches the backend solely through the oauth2-proxy declared in [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml). In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants that proxy is absent and `biber` has no native account, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. The `administrator` persona keeps its native login via `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` and runs in every variant."
msgstr "[`tasks/01_setup.yml`](./tasks/01_setup.yml) ay ang administrador lamang Magento'ang mesang admin (`bin/magento setup:install --admin-user`, kredensiyal mula sa [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)); `biber` makarating sa likuran sa pamamagitan lamang ng oauth2- Proxy ipinahayag sa [`meta/services.yml`](./meta/services.yml). Sa loob ng `services.sso.enabled: false` Mga pagkakaiba sa matrix na proxy ay wala at `biber` walang katutubong ulat, kaya [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) salin `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`. Ang `administrator` Pinananatili ng masona ang katutubong login nito sa pamamagitan ng `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` at tumatakbo sa lahat ng iba't ibang paraan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/05_administrator.yml`](./tasks/05_administrator.yml) creates the account with `tootctl accounts create` and never sets or captures a password, so `ADMIN_PASSWORD` — the Keycloak secret — cannot drive Mastodon's native `/auth/sign_in`; `biber` has no Mastodon account at all, since the OIDC sign-in ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) is the only path that would create one. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants that path is removed, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The SeaweedFS companion scenario ([`files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js`](./files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js)) drives the same admin journey and skips on the same flag."
msgstr "[`tasks/05_administrator.yml`](./tasks/05_administrator.yml) sa paglikha ng ulat `tootctl accounts create` at hindi kailanman nagtatakda o kumukuha ng password, kaya `ADMIN_PASSWORD` — ang Keycloak lihim — hindi makapagmaneho Mastodon' katutubo `/auth/sign_in`; `biber` walang Mastodon account, mula noong sign-in ng OIDC ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) ang tanging landas na lilikha ng isa. Nasa `services.sso.enabled: false` Iba't ibang uri ng matrix na daan, kaya [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) salin `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` at `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Ang SeaweedFS kalagayan ng kasama ([`files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js`](./files/playwright/test-seaweedfs.js)) ang nagpapatakbo sa parehong admin na paglalakbay at paglukso sa parehong bandila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml`](tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml) runs after `update.php`. It includes the shared gateway consumer contract, then reads both globals back out of the running container with `maintenance/run.php getConfiguration --format=json` and asserts the provider, the base URL and the model, so an unconfigured surface cannot reach a green deploy."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml`](tasks/utils/ai_gateway.yml) tumatakbo pagkatapos `update.php`. Kasama rito ang kontrata ng consumer na pinagsaluhan ng mga sasakyan, pagkatapos ay basahin ang dalawang pangglobong kontrata pabalik sa lalagyan `maintenance/run.php getConfiguration --format=json` at iginigiit ang tagapaglaan, ang base na URL at ang modelo, kaya ang hindi nakaayos na ibabaw ay hindi maaaring umabot sa berdeng gamit."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) creates a dedicated non-superuser owner (`mcp@<canonical-domain>`, unusable password) plus its own workspace, and binds the endpoint to that pair."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) lumilikha ng isang dedikadong may-ari ng non-superuser (`mcp@<canonical-domain>`, hindi magagamit na password) At pati na ang sarili nitong workspace, at talian ang dulo ng pares na iyon."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) waits for the ExApp heartbeat, registers the deploy daemon and the ExApp (route `^/mcp`, verbs `POST,GET,DELETE`, access level `1`), enables the ExApp, mints an app password for the dedicated MCP account via `occ user:auth-tokens:add`, persists it through `sys-token-store` under `users['mcp-web-app-nextcloud'].tokens['web-app-nextcloud']`, and asserts that an authenticated `initialize` call answers `200`."
msgstr "[`tasks/utils/mcp.yml`](./tasks/utils/mcp.yml) Hinihintay ang exApp tibok ng puso, itinatala ang kasalukuyang daemon at ang ExApp (ruta `^/mcp`, pandiwa `POST,GET,DELETE`, antas ng access `1`), na nagpapangyari sa ExApp, na gumawa ng isang app password para sa dedikadong MCP account sa pamamagitan ng `occ user:auth-tokens:add`, ipagpatuloy ito `sys-token-store` sa ilalim `users['mcp-web-app-nextcloud'].tokens['web-app-nextcloud']`, at iginigiit na ito'y totoo `initialize` mga sagot `200`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`templates/config.exs.j2`](./templates/config.exs.j2) wires Keycloak as the only login provider this role configures, and [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) creates no Mobilizon account; `MOBILIZON_INSTANCE_DISABLE_DATABASE_LOGIN` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) additionally closes the database login whenever LDAP is on. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants neither persona has credentials, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. The `guest` persona and the baseline assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "[`templates/config.exs.j2`](./templates/config.exs.j2) mga kawad Keycloak bilang ang tanging tagatustos ng login ang bahaging ito ng pagsasaayos, at [`tasks/main.yml`](./tasks/main.yml) Lumilikha ng hindi Mobilizon salaysay; `MOBILIZON_INSTANCE_DISABLE_DATABASE_LOGIN` ([`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2)) Higit pang nagsasara ang database login kapag may LDAP. Nasa `services.sso.enabled: false` Ang mga pagkakaiba sa matrix ay walang kredensiyal, kaya [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) salin `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` at `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`. Ang `guest` ang sabi ng tao at ng baseline."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) seeds only the administrator into SuiteCRM (`SUITECRM_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `SUITECRM_ADMIN_PASSWORD`); `biber` reaches the app through SuiteCRM's own SAML login against Keycloak, where `SAML_AUTO_CREATE` mints the account on first assertion. In the `services.sso.enabled: false` matrix variants there is no SAML entry point and `biber` has no native account, so [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` for the generic persona journeys (the LDAP spec still signs `biber` in from the directory). The `administrator` persona keeps its native login via `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` and runs in every variant."
msgstr "[`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) ay ang administrador lamang SuiteCRM (`SUITECRM_ADMIN_USERNAME` / `SUITECRM_ADMIN_PASSWORD`); `biber` makarating sa app SuiteCRM'sariling login ng SAML laban sa Keycloak, kung saan `SAML_AUTO_CREATE` Unang binanggit ang ulat. Nasa `services.sso.enabled: false` Ang mga matrix variant ay walang SAML entry point at `biber` walang katutubong ulat, kaya [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) salin `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` para sa mga paglalakbay sa generic persona (mga palatandaan pa rin ng LDAP spec `biber` sa loob ng directory). Ang `administrator` Pinananatili ng masona ang katutubong login nito sa pamamagitan ng `ADMIN_NATIVE_PASSWORD` at tumatakbo sa lahat ng iba't ibang paraan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) renders `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` in every matrix variant, because the shared persona helper cannot drive this role's sign-in in any of them. Three independent reasons, each sufficient on its own:"
msgstr "[`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) salin `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` at `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true` Sa bawat matrix variant, dahil ang kabahaging taona katulong ay hindi makapagpatakbo ng sign-in ng papel na ito sa alinman sa kanila. Tatlong independiyenteng dahilan, bawat isa'y sapat na sa ganang sarili:"

