msgid "[x] A restarted container comes back **unsealed with no operator action** (`/v1/sys/seal-status` reports `sealed: false`). Asserted by `test-seal-status.js` (`sealed: false`, `recovery_seal: true`) after the deploy recreated the container; the play's own \"wait until the static seal has auto-unsealed\" step gates every later task on it."
msgstr "[x] Nagbalik ang isang lalagyan na may panibagong gamit **walang operator** (`/v1/sys/seal-status` ulat `sealed: false`). Nag - aalala `test-seal-status.js` (`sealed: false`, `recovery_seal: true`) pagkatapos na muling makuha ang lalagyan; ang mismong dula \"maghintay hanggang sa ang static seal ay may auto-un crown\" Gumawa ng mga pintuang - daan sa bawat huling atas."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "[x] A restore procedure is documented and executed once end to end: restore the volume, redeploy, and confirm the instance auto-unseals and a previously stored secret is still readable. Drill run on the variant-2 stack: container quiesced, `openbao_data` archived (33 MB), the live volume **wiped to zero entries**, restored from the archive, and restarted — OpenBao came back `initialized: true, sealed: false` with the secret, the PKI root CA and all five policies recovered. This also confirms the documented dependency: the restored store is only readable because the seal key in the inventory was unchanged."
msgstr "[x] Ang isang pamamaraan ng restorasyon ay dokumentado at pinatay minsan sa pagtatapos: ibalik ang volume, redeploy, at pagtibayin ang pagkakataon auto-unseals at ang isang dating nakatagong lihim ay mababasa pa rin. Si Drill ay tumatakbo sa variant-2 nakasalansan: lalagyan, `openbao_data` archive (33 MB), ang live volume **ay nabura hanggang sa wala**, ibinalik mula sa arkibo, at inulit — OpenBao bumalik `initialized: true, sealed: false` na may lihim, ang ugat ng PKI na CA at lahat ng limang patakaran ay gumaling. Pinatutunayan din nito ang dokumentadong dependensiya: ang isinauling tindahan ay maaari lamang basahin sapagkat ang seal key sa imbentaryo ay hindi nagbago."

