msgid "[x] MDAD's `ansible-playbook` is invoked inside a dedicated runner sub-container (image: `services.matrix.runner.image`, built locally from `files/flavor/ansible/runner/Dockerfile`) so its Ansible runtime is isolated from Infinito-Nexus's. The runner mounts the Docker socket, systemd dirs, `/matrix`, `/usr/local/bin`, and the MDAD checkout from the deploy container. A `mount --make-rshared /` runs once in the deploy container before the runner starts because MDAD's systemd units bind-mount with `bind-propagation=slave`."
msgstr "[x] MDAD's `ansible-playbook` sa loob ng isang dedikadong sub-container (Larawan: `services.matrix.runner.image`, itinayo sa lugar na iyon mula `files/flavor/ansible/runner/Dockerfile`) Kaya't ang Ansible runtime nito ay nakahiwalay sa Infinito-Nexus's. Ang mananakbo ay umaakyat sa Docker socket, may sistemang mga dir, `/matrix`, `/usr/local/bin`, at ang MDAD checkout mula sa lalagyan. A `mount --make-rshared /` tumatakbo minsan sa lalagyan bago magsimula ang mananakbo dahil ang systemd units ng MDAD ay nagbibigkis ng-mount `bind-propagation=slave`."

