msgid "`Docker Swarm <https://docs.docker.com/engine/swarm/>`__ is Docker’s built-in clustering and container-orchestration mode. It groups multiple Docker hosts into a single virtual host that can schedule services, replicate tasks, and route traffic via an internal mesh."
msgstr "`Docker Swarm <https://docs.docker.com/engine/swarm/>`__ ay Dockerisons itinayo-in cluting at container-orchestration mode. Pinagsasama - sama nito ang multiple Docker upang maging isang tunay na punong - abala na maaaring mag - iskedyul ng mga serbisyo, magkopya ng mga gawain, at magpatakbo ng mga sasakyan sa pamamagitan ng isang panloob na bitak."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Dockerfile.sh` exposes 8124 for aiolibdatachannel signalling beside 8099. Nothing listens on it at rest, so only 8099 is published; whether it binds lazily during a call is untested."
msgstr "`Dockerfile.sh` mga paglalantad 8124 para sa aiolibdata machannel na nagbibigay ng hudyat sa tabi 8099. Walang nakikinig dito kung nagpapahinga, kaya lamang 8099 ay inilalathala; kung ito man ay magbibigkis nang malakas sa panahon ng pagdalaw ay hindi sinusubok."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`DomainLookup` resolves the SMTP host when `environment` points to an external Mailu deployment. Failures MUST fall back to `localhost`."
