msgid "`RUN apk add` (Alpine ≥3.18 HTTPS)"
msgstr "`RUN apk add` (Alpine ≥3.18 MGA HTTP)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUN apk add` (inner Dockerfile build, Alpine ≤3.17 HTTP)"
msgstr "`RUN apk add` (Nagtatayo ang panloob na Dockerfile, ang Alps ≤3.17 HTTP)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUN apt-get install` (inner Dockerfile build, Debian/Ubuntu)"
msgstr "`RUN apt-get install` (Nagtatayo ang panloob na Dockerfile, ang Debian/Ubuntu)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUN pip/npm/gem/composer/go install` (inner Dockerfile build)"
msgstr "`RUN pip/npm/gem/composer/go install` (Dumarami ang panloob na Dockerfile)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUNNER_COUNT` defaults to `RESOURCE_HOST_CPUS // RUNNER_CPUS` (auto-scaled to hardware). Override explicitly when debugging a specific count."
msgstr "`RUNNER_COUNT` Mga hindi pagtupad `RESOURCE_HOST_CPUS // RUNNER_CPUS` (Naka-redirect sa hardware). Override kapag binabale - wala ang isang espesipikong bilang."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION` is **required** and has no default; it is passed automatically by the CLI."
msgstr "`RUNNER_DISTRIBUTION` ay **kailangan** at walang default; ito ay awtomatikong ipinapasa ng CLI."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUNNER_GITHUB_OWNER` and `RUNNER_GITHUB_REPO` resolve from `GITHUB_REPOSITORY_OWNER` / `GITHUB_REPOSITORY` env vars when set (CI context), falling back to `meta/services.yml` for production deploys."
msgstr "`RUNNER_GITHUB_OWNER` at `RUNNER_GITHUB_REPO` ng `GITHUB_REPOSITORY_OWNER` / `GITHUB_REPOSITORY` mga env var kapag nakatakda (Ang konteksto ng CI), nagbabalik sa `meta/services.yml` para sa produksiyon."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RUNTIME` (`dev`/`act`/`github`) selects which test stages run."
msgstr "`RUNTIME` (`dev`/`act`/`github`) Piliin kung aling yugto ng pagsubok ang tumatakbo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`RetroArch <https://www.retroarch.com/>`__ is a frontend for emulators, game engines, and media players powered by the `Libretro <https://www.libretro.com/>`__ framework. It supports multiple UI styles including `XMB <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XrossMediaBar>`__ and `Ozone <https://docs.libretro.com/>`__, and provides a unified interface for retro gaming across platforms."
msgstr "`RetroArch <https://www.retroarch.com/>`__ ay isang frontend para sa mga emulator, mga game engine, at mga media player na pinatatakbo ng `Libretro <https://www.libretro.com/>`__ balangkas. Sinusuportahan nito ang maraming istilo ng UI kabilang ang `XMB <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/XrossMediaBar>`__ at `Ozone <https://docs.libretro.com/>`__, at naglalaan ng isang nagkakaisang interface para sa muling paggawa sa mga plataporma."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Roulette Wheel <https://github.com/p-wojt/roulette-wheel>`__ is a Node.js-based front-end application that simulates a roulette wheel in the browser."
msgstr "`Roulette Wheel <https://github.com/p-wojt/roulette-wheel>`__ ay isang Node.js- Nababa ang front-end application na gumagaya sa gulong ng roulette sa browser."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` (base64 32 bytes, `head -c32 /dev/urandom | base64`) encrypts stored access keys; `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_HASH` / `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_ENCRYPTION` secure sessions."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_ACCESS_KEY_ENCRYPTION` (himpilan64 32 byte, `head -c32 /dev/urandom | base64`) Nakaimbak na mga susi; `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_HASH` / `SEMAPHORE_COOKIE_ENCRYPTION` Maluwag na sesyon."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` seed the first admin (no setup wizard)."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_ADMIN`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_NAME`, `SEMAPHORE_ADMIN_EMAIL` ang unang admin (walang salamangkero ng setup)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT` ∈ `bolt` (file at `/var/lib/semaphore`), `mysql`, `postgres`. Postgres uses `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB`."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_DB_DIALECT` ∈ `bolt` (talaksan sa `/var/lib/semaphore`), `mysql`, `postgres`. Postgres ay gumagamit ng `SEMAPHORE_DB_HOST/PORT/USER/PASS/SEMAPHORE_DB`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ACTIVATED`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_HOST`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PORT`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_NEEDTLS`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_BIND`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_SEARCH`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_FILTER`, plus attribute mappings (`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_DN/UID/MAIL/CN`)."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_ACTIVATED`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_HOST`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PORT`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_NEEDTLS`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_BIND`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_PASSWORD`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_DN_SEARCH`, `SEMAPHORE_LDAP_SEARCH_FILTER`, pati na ang mga sopa (`SEMAPHORE_LDAP_MAPPING_DN/UID/MAIL/CN`)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` = JSON map. Per-provider: `display_name`, `provider_url` (issuer), `client_id`, `client_secret`, `redirect_url`. Redirect path is `https://<host>/api/auth/oidc/<provider_id>/redirect`. **Semaphore has native OIDC — no `oauth2-proxy` sidecar needed.**"
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_OIDC_PROVIDERS` = Mapa ng JSON. Per-Pilipinas: `display_name`, `provider_url` (nagbibigay ng), `client_id`, `client_secret`, `redirect_url`. Ang direksiyon ng landas ay `https://<host>/api/auth/oidc/<provider_id>/redirect`. **Ang Semaphore ay may katutubong OIDC — wala `oauth2-proxy` Kailangan ang sidecar.**"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SEMAPHORE_WEB_ROOT` sets the externally-reachable base URL; required for correct OIDC redirects behind `sys-svc-proxy`."
msgstr "`SEMAPHORE_WEB_ROOT` ang panlabas na-reachable base URL; kinakailangan para sa tamang OIDC redirects sa likuran `sys-svc-proxy`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SH_APPS_CATALOG_URL` is emptied so the container never fetches the app catalog from github.com. Set it to a self-hosted catalog when one exists."
msgstr "`SH_APPS_CATALOG_URL` ay inaalisan ng laman kaya hindi kailanman kinukuha ng container ang katalogo ng app mula sa github.com. Ilagay sa isang self-hosted katalogo kapag umiiral ang isa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SH_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` is unset — the SPA is same-origin. Needed only if a third-party client should talk to the API."
msgstr "`SH_CORS_ALLOWED_ORIGINS` ay di-set — ang SPA ay parehong-origin. Kailangan lamang kung ang ikatlong-bahaging kliyente ay dapat makipag-usap sa API."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SH_MAX_STORAGE_BYTES` is pinned to 4 GiB in `vars/main.yml` so the app's media cap stays inside `services.socialhome.min_storage` (5 GB). Raising one without the other lets the volume outgrow its declared budget."
msgstr "`SH_MAX_STORAGE_BYTES` ay ikinakabit sa 4 Ang GiB in `vars/main.yml` Kaya ang takip ng media ay nananatili sa loob `services.socialhome.min_storage` (5 GB). Ang pagpapalaki sa isa nang wala ang isa pa ay nag - aalis sa tomo ng ipinahayag na badyet nito."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SSH (Secure Shell) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__ is a cryptographic network protocol for operating network services securely over an unsecured network. The `OpenSSH <https://www.openssh.com/>`__ project provides the reference implementation, including ``ssh-agent`` for managing authentication keys."
msgstr "`SSH (Secure Shell) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Secure_Shell>`__ ay isang cryptographic network protocol para sa mga serbisyo ng operating network nang mahusay sa isang di - tiyak na network. Ang `OpenSSH <https://www.openssh.com/>`__ ay nagbibigay ng reperensiyang pagpapatupad, kasali na ang ``ssh-agent`` para sa paghawak ng mga susi sa mapagkakatiwalaan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SYS_SERVICE_RUNNER_STATE` (string): desired state (`started`, `restarted`, ...)"
msgstr "`SYS_SERVICE_RUNNER_STATE` (string): nais na kalagayan (`started`, `restarted`, ...)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SearXNG <https://docs.searxng.org/>`__ is a metasearch engine. It forwards a query to other search engines and returns the merged result without an account and without a tracking profile."
msgstr "`SearXNG <https://docs.searxng.org/>`__ ay isang metasearch engine. Isinusulong nito ang isang tanong sa iba pang mga search engine at ibinabalik ang pinagsanib na resulta nang walang account at walang pagsusuri."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`SeaweedFS <https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs>`__ is a fast distributed storage system for blobs, objects, and files. It exposes an S3-compatible API, so applications store and retrieve objects with standard S3 SDKs and CLIs."
msgstr "`SeaweedFS <https://github.com/seaweedfs/seaweedfs>`__ ay isang mabilis na ipinamamahaging sistema ng imbakan para sa mga blob, bagay, at talaksan. Inilalantad nito ang S3-Katugma API, kaya ang mga aplikasyon ay nag - iimbak at kumukuha ng mga bagay na may pamantayang S3 Mga SDK at CLIS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Semaphore UI <https://semaphoreui.com/>`__ is a modern web UI and API for running Ansible playbooks, Terraform/OpenTofu plans, and shell scripts on a schedule or on demand. This role deploys the official ```semaphoreui/semaphore`` <https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore>`__ container behind the Infinito.Nexus reverse proxy with central PostgreSQL, native Keycloak OIDC Single Sign-On, and optional LDAP login."
msgstr "`Semaphore UI <https://semaphoreui.com/>`__ ay isang modernong web UI at API para sa pagpapatakbo ng Ansible playbooks, Terraform/OpenTofu plano, at shell scripts sa isang iskedyul o demand. Ang papel na ito ay ginagamit ng opisyal ```semaphoreui/semaphore`` <https://github.com/semaphoreui/semaphore>`Ilagay sa likod ng lalagyan Infinito.Nexus baligtad na proxy na may gitnang proxy PostgreSQL, katutubo Keycloak OIDC Single Sign-On, at opsyonal LDAP login."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Svc Engine <https://example.com/>`__ is an application."
msgstr "`Svc Engine <https://example.com/>`__ ay isang aplikasyon."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Svc Objstore <https://example.com/>`__ is an application."
msgstr "`Svc Objstore <https://example.com/>`__ ay isang aplikasyon."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_COMMAND` (default: `npm install --no-fund --no-audit && npx playwright test`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_COMMAND` (default: `npm install --no-fund --no-audit && npx playwright test`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE_DISTRO` (default: `noble`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE_DISTRO` (default: `noble`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE` (resolved in `vars/main.yml` from `meta/services.yml.playwright.image` + `.version` via `lookup('config', 'test-e2e-playwright', 'services.playwright.image|version')`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_IMAGE` (determinado `vars/main.yml` mula sa `meta/services.yml.playwright.image` + `.version` gagamitin `lookup('config', 'test-e2e-playwright', 'services.playwright.image|version')`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_REPORTS_BASE_DIR` (default: `/var/lib/infinito/logs/test-e2e-playwright`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_REPORTS_BASE_DIR` (default: `/var/lib/infinito/logs/test-e2e-playwright`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR` (default: `/tmp/test-e2e-playwright`)"
msgstr "`TEST_E2E_PLAYWRIGHT_STAGE_BASE_DIR` (default: `/tmp/test-e2e-playwright`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Taiga <https://www.taiga.io/>`__ is a powerful and intuitive open-source project management platform tailored for agile teams. Whether you’re practicing Scrum, Kanban, or a custom hybrid workflow, Taiga offers a rich, customizable environment to plan, track, and collaborate on your projects, without the complexity of enterprise tools or the vendor lock-in of SaaS platforms."
msgstr "`Taiga <https://www.taiga.io/>`__ ay isang malakas at intuwisyon open-source project management platform na nababagay para sa mga maliksing koponan. Ikaw man ay nag - eensayo ng Scrum, Kanban, o isang tradisyonal na hybrid workflow, Taiga ay nag - aalok ng isang mayaman, maayos na kapaligiran upang iplano, tuntunin, at pagtulungan sa iyong mga proyekto, nang walang masalimuot na mga kagamitang pangnegosyo o ang tindero ng mga plataporma ng SaAS."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Test E2E Cli <https://example.com/>`__ is an application."
msgstr "`Test E2E Cli <https://example.com/>`__ ay isang aplikasyon."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ToolServerConnection.auth_type: system_oauth` resolves the caller's token through `oauth_manager.get_oauth_token(user.id, oauth_session_id)` and presents it as the Bearer"
msgstr "`ToolServerConnection.auth_type: system_oauth` ang hudyat ng tumatawag `oauth_manager.get_oauth_token(user.id, oauth_session_id)` at inihaharap ito bilang Oso"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Unit tests` verify isolated logic."
msgstr "`Unit tests` Tiyakin ang nakabukod na lohika."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`UsersLookup` yields the `no-reply` user dict used to derive `from` and `password`. Missing entries MUST yield an empty dict. The fallback for `from` is then `root@<inventory_hostname>.localdomain`."
msgstr "`UsersLookup` nagbibigay ng `no-reply` panggagamit na ginagamit upang makuha `from` at `password`. Missing entry Ang MUST ay nagbibigay ng walang laman na dikt. Ang Pagkatisod `from` pagkatapos ay `root@<inventory_hostname>.localdomain`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__ is a powerful source code editor with a wide plugin ecosystem, supporting development workflows across many languages and platforms. See also the `Arch Wiki - Development Tools <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Category:Development>`__ and general `Software Engineering <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_engineering>`__ on Wikipedia."
msgstr "`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/>`__ ay isang malakas na source code editor na may isang malawak na plagin ecosystem, sumusuporta sa pag-unlad na gumagana sa ibayo ng maraming mga wika at platform. Tingnan din ang `Arch Wiki - Development Tools <https://wiki.archlinux.org/title/Category:Development>`__ at pangkalahatan `Software Engineering <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Software_engineering>`__ tungkol sa Wikipedia."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Visual Studio Code <https://github.com/microsoft/vscode>`__ in a selectable flavor: the distribution’s Code - OSS build, VSCodium, or Microsoft’s own binary."
msgstr "`Visual Studio Code <https://github.com/microsoft/vscode>`__ sa isang masarap na lasa: ang distributioni Code - Ang OSS ay nagtatayo, ang VSCodium, o ang Microsoftigers ay nagmamay-ari ng binaryo."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`WordPress <https://en.wordpress.org/>`__ is a versatile and widely used `content management system (CMS) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Content_management_system>`__ that powers millions of websites, from blogs and portfolios to e-commerce and corporate sites. This deployment provides a containerized WordPress instance optimized for multisite operation, advanced media management, and extensive plugin support, allowing you to fully leverage the rich features of the WordPress software."
msgstr "`WordPress <https://en.wordpress.org/>`__ ay maraming gamit at malawakang ginagamit `content management system (CMS) <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Content_management_system>`__ na nagbibigay ng kapangyarihan sa milyun - milyong website, mula sa mga blog at portfolio hanggang sa mga e-commerce at mga site ng korporasyon. Ang paglalagay na ito ay naglalaan ng isang containerized WordPress Halimbawang ginawa para sa multisite na operasyon, makabagong pangangasiwa sa media, at malawak na suporta ng plagin, anupat hinahayaan kang lubusang mangibabaw sa mayayamang katangian ng mga plagin WordPress software."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Zammad <https://zammad.org/>`__ is an open-source helpdesk and ticketing system. Agents handle customer requests across email, chat, phone and web; customers can open tickets from a self-service portal."
msgstr "`Zammad <https://zammad.org/>`__ ay isang open-source aiddesk at sistema ng tiket. Ang mga ahente ay humahawak ng mga kahilingan ng parokyano sa ibayo ng email, chat, telepono at web; ang mga parokyano ay maaaring magbukas ng mga tiket mula sa isang self-service portal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`Zoom <https://zoom.us/>`__ is a popular video conferencing application for online meetings, webinars, and collaboration."
msgstr "`Zoom <https://zoom.us/>`__ ay isang popular na video na naggagawad ng aplikasyon para sa mga pulong sa Internet, mga webinar, at pagtutulungan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`[user@]host:/dev/...` → a device on the host, recovered over ssh then pulled; `[user@]host:/image` → the image is pulled and recovered locally (`device` / `full`)"
