# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``/usr/local/bin`` is NOT bind-mounted, even though MDAD writes a few helper scripts there. The runner’s ``ansible-core`` lives at ``/opt/ansible/bin/`` (out of the way) to keep the option open, but mounting the deploy container’s ``/usr/local/bin`` over the runner causes a Python ABI mismatch segfault (host Python is built differently from ``python:3.13-slim``). MDAD’s host-side helper scripts are not invoked by the deploy flow."
msgstr "``/usr/local/bin`` ay hindi tiin-mounted, kahit na ang MDAD ay nagsusulat ng ilang katulong na script doon. Ang mga Eksperimento ng mananakbo ``ansible-core`` mabuhay sa ``/opt/ansible/bin/`` (Alis) upang mapanatiling bukas ang mapagpipilian, subalit maglagay ng mga lalagyan ``/usr/local/bin`` sa runner ay nagiging sanhi ng isang Python ABI mismatch segfault (iba ang pagkakagawa sa host Python ``python:3.13-slim``). MDAD’s host-side help scripts ay hindi na-record sa pamamagitan ng pag-sett."

# translated-by: libretranslate
