msgid "``svc-db-redis`` (role-local sidecar, service name ``redis``)"
msgstr "``svc-db-redis`` (bahaging-lokal na sidecar, pangalan ng serbisyo ``redis``)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``svc-swarm-manager`` (subset marker), ``svc-storage-nfs-client`` (no ``application_id``), ``svc-registry-docker`` (consumed by the swarm handler that pushes locally-built images, but not declared as a meta-dep so it stays out of compose-mode deploys) are added explicitly because the dep-walker only knows roles that are in the ``applications`` dict. The DR-drill backup roles arrive implicitly: the apps' ``container_backup`` service declaration pulls ``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` into the closure, and ``svc-bkp-nfs-2-local`` deploys via its group membership on the NFS server host (``extend_inventory``) through the group-driven role includes."
msgstr "``svc-swarm-manager`` (subset marker), ``svc-storage-nfs-client`` (hindi ``application_id``), ``svc-registry-docker`` (pigil ng alperes handler na nagtutulak sa mga imahe ng lokal na-build, ngunit hindi ipinahayag bilang meta-dep kaya ito ay nananatiling hindi kasama sa mga pyramid-mode depost) ay idinadagdag ng malinaw dahil ang dep-walker ay alam lamang ang mga papel na nasa loob ng ``applications`` Hiwain. Ang mga papel na DR-drill backup ay dumating nang lubusan: ang apps' ``container_backup`` humihila ang pagpapahayag ng serbisyo ``svc-bkp-volume-2-local`` sa pagsasara, at ``svc-bkp-nfs-2-local`` Mga gamit sa pamamagitan ng mga miyembro nito sa grupo sa host ng NFS server (``extend_inventory``) sa pamamagitan ng group-driving papel kabilang."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``sys-svc-mail-msmtp``: msmtp client and sendmail replacement"
msgstr "``sys-svc-mail-msmtp``: kliyenteng msmtp at palitan ngmail"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``sys-svc-mail``: central mail orchestration"
msgstr "``sys-svc-mail``: orkestra ng koreo"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``sys-token-store`` is a lightweight Ansible helper role for **resolving and persisting per-user application tokens** in a unified and idempotent way."
msgstr "``sys-token-store`` ay isang magaang na papel na ginagampanan ng katulong **Paglutas at patuloy na paglalapat ng per-user na mga patlang** sa isang nagkakaisang paraan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "``sys_token_store_token`` (must be non-empty)"
