# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ci.sh` exports `INFINITO_MAKE_DEPLOY=1` so `MODE_CI` (defined in `group_vars/all/01_modes.yml`) flips to `true` for the duration of a make-driven deploy. It is sourced by every deploy entry-point under `scripts/tests/deploy/local/deploy/`. Sourcing it from `all.sh` would set the marker for unrelated `make test*` or `make build*` recipes too, which is exactly what the service-gating contract forbids."
msgstr "`ci.sh` Transportasyon `INFINITO_MAKE_DEPLOY=1` gayo'y `MODE_CI` (binigyang - katuturan sa `group_vars/all/01_modes.yml`) flip sa `true` Sapagka't ang tagal ng pag-eeensayo. Ito ay dinadaglat ng bawat entry-point sa ilalim ng `scripts/tests/deploy/local/deploy/`. Paggising dito mula sa `all.sh` ang magtatakda ng palatandaan para sa walang kaugnayan `make test*` o `make build*` Mga resipi rin, na siyang mismong ipinagbabawal ng service-ging contract."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`classification` is required and MUST be deployable; all MCP-specific fields MUST be literals (only `enabled`/`shared` may carry Jinja)."
msgstr "`classification` ay kinakailangan at MUST ay magagamit; lahat ng MCP-specific fields MUST ay literal (yaon lamang `enabled`/`shared` ay maaaring magdala ng Jinja)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`classification` is required and is one of `native_server`, `native_client`, `native_both`, `plugin_server`, `sidecar_server`, `adapter_server`. A role that cannot serve declares no `mcp` block at all."
msgstr "`classification` ay kinakailangan at isa sa `native_server`, `native_client`, `native_both`, `plugin_server`, `sidecar_server`, `adapter_server`. Ang isang papel na hindi maaaring gampanan ay hindi nagpapahayag ng `mcp` bloke."

