msgid "`cli contributing network address suggest`: propose the next free per-role IPv4 subnet(s) gap-first within the established umbrella blocks."
msgstr "`cli contributing network address suggest`: Imungkahi ang susunod na free per-role IPv4 subnet(s) puwang-una sa loob ng nakatatag na mga bloke ng payong."

