# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`init.py` writes the inventory; `deploy/cli.py` decides which application ids to hand to `cli.administration.deploy.dedicated`. Both derive their per-round set from the same `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` closure and MUST apply the same `prune_orphans_after_disable` cut with the same round-merged services map. `validate_application_ids` rejects any id that is absent from the inventory, so a deploy-side set wider than the init-side set aborts the run before the first role deploys."
msgstr "`init.py` sulat ng imbentaryo; `deploy/cli.py` magpasiya kung aling aplikasyon ang iaabot sa kamay `cli.administration.deploy.dedicated`. Parehong galing sa iisang set `plan_dev_inventory_matrix` Ang Pagsara at MUST ay Gumamit din ng `prune_orphans_after_disable` na may parehong round-merged na service map. `validate_application_ids` Itakwil ang anumang id na wala sa imbentaryo, kaya ang isang stapped-side ay mas malawak kaysa sa init-side set abortions ang tumatakbo bago ang unang papel na pag-play."

