# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`make compose-playwright role=<role>` (or `make swarm-playwright role=<role>` against the swarm cluster) exited `0` on its last invocation, run WITHOUT any `pw=\"--grep …\"` narrowing, so the entire spec (every test and every persona) ran and ALL passed. Redeploying while only a grepped subset is green and other tests are red or unrun is FORBIDDEN: the full suite MUST be green in the container first."
msgstr "`make compose-playwright role=<role>` (o `make swarm-playwright role=<role>` laban sa kumpol ng kuyog) Lumabas `0` nang ito'y huling idaing, tumakbo Nang WALANG Anuman `pw=\"--grep …\"` Pagkipot, kaya ang buong spec (bawat pagsubok at bawat tao) tumakbo at ang lahat ay lumipas. Ang pagpula habang ang isang grepped subset lamang ay berde at ang iba pang mga pagsubok ay pula o walang run ay FORBIDEN: ang buong suite MUST ay kulay berde sa lalagyan muna."

