# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`plg_system_keycloak` is built imperatively inside the Joomla container and speaks OIDC against Keycloak. Its enablement derives directly from the `sso` service flag, and its OIDC runtime contract (issuer, client id/secret, redirect/end-session URLs, fallback toggle, and RBAC group paths) lives under the addon's `config:` block, which [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) renders into the `JOOMLA_OIDC_*` plugin environment."
msgstr "`plg_system_keycloak` ay kailangang itayo sa loob ng Joomla container at magsalita laban sa OIDC Keycloak. Ang kakayahan nito ay tuwirang nagmumula sa `sso` bandila ng paglilingkod, at ang kontrata nito sa oras ng OIDC (deliver, kliyenteng id/lihim, redirect/end-session URLs, fallback toggle, at RBAC group paths) nabubuhay sa ilalim ng addon `config:` block, na [`templates/env.j2`](./templates/env.j2) isalin sa `JOOMLA_OIDC_*` Kapaligirang plagin."

