# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`ports.internal`, `ports.local` and `ports.public` are **always** category-keyed maps, even when the map has only one entry. Polymorphic int-or-map values are NOT supported. The category names are: `http`, `database`, `websocket`, `oauth2`, `ldap`, `ssh`, `ldaps`, `stun_turn`, `stun_turn_tls`, `federation`, plus the structured `relay` block under `public:`."
msgstr "`ports.internal`, `ports.local` at `ports.public` Ay **Lagi** mga mapa ng kategorya-keyed, kahit na ang mapa ay may isang entry lamang. Ang mga halagang polymorphic int-or-map ay HINDI suportado. Ang mga kategorya ay: `http`, `database`, `websocket`, `oauth2`, `ldap`, `ssh`, `ldaps`, `stun_turn`, `stun_turn_tls`, `federation`, pati na ang tatag `relay` bloke sa ilalim `public:`."

