# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`svc-dns-unbound` is a single-service, single-network, static-IP, pinned role. mailu's services drop their own unbound + static IP, attach to the `svc-dns-unbound` network, and point `dns:` at its static IP. The static-IP allocation therefore lives in a trivial 1-service stack (no deadlock) instead of mailu's 13-service / 4-network stack. mailu also stops embedding redis (uses central) -> fewer services -> less VIP pressure."
msgstr "`svc-dns-unbound` ay isang solo-service, single-network, static-IP, pindutan papel. Ang mga serbisyo ng mailu ay bumababa ng kanilang sariling unbound + static IP, na nakakabit sa statistical IP `svc-dns-unbound` network, at punto `dns:` sa static IP nito. Ang static-IP allocation samakatuwid ay nabubuhay sa isang maliit na bagay 1-service na salansan (walang sira) sa halip ng mailu 13-Service / 4-network na salansan. Pinatitigil din ng mailu ang embending redis (gumagamit ng gitna) -> Mas kaunting services -> mas mababa ang VIP pressure."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`svc-runner` provisions one or more GitHub Actions self-hosted runner instances on a dedicated machine. Each instance is an isolated unit with its own Docker volume, network subnet, and systemd service. The role interacts with the GitHub API (`gh api`) at deploy time to fetch registration tokens — it does **not** store long-lived credentials."
msgstr "`svc-runner` ay nagbibigay ng isa o higit pang GitHub Actions self-hosed runner mga pagkakataon sa isang dedikadong makina. Ang bawat halimbawa ay isang nakabukod na yunit na may sariling Docker volume, network subnet, at systemd service. Ang papel ay may kaugnayan sa GitHub API (`gh api`) sa paggamit ng panahon upang kumuha ng mga tanda sa pagpaparehistro — gayon nga **hindi** nag-imbak ng long-treed na mga kredensiyal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`svc-virt-kata/tasks/00_core.yml` reads `container info --format DefaultRuntime` and refuses `runc` **before** labelling the node, so the label never promises what the node cannot deliver"
msgstr "`svc-virt-kata/tasks/00_core.yml` basahin `container info --format DefaultRuntime` at tumanggi `runc` **bago** Tinatawag na node ang node, kaya ang etiketa ay hindi kailanman nangangako ng hindi kayang gawin ng node"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`svc-virt-kata/tasks/utils/assert_isolated.yml` reads `HostConfig.Runtime` off the running container and refuses `runc`"
msgstr "`svc-virt-kata/tasks/utils/assert_isolated.yml` basahin `HostConfig.Runtime` ang tumatakbong sisidlan at tumanggi `runc`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`swarm-zombie app=<app>` builds a full DinD cluster and leaves it up (`INFINITO_KEEP_SWARM_NODES=true`) for inspection."
msgstr "`swarm-zombie app=<app>` gumagawa ng isang kumpletong kumpol ng DinD at iniiwan ito (`INFINITO_KEEP_SWARM_NODES=true`) para sa pagsisiyasat."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`sys-*` for host setup, OS tuning, cleanup, certificates, and maintenance"
msgstr "`sys-*` para sa host setup, OS confision, paglilinis, sertipiko, at pagmamantini"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`sys-front-inj-css` renders it when `services.css.enabled` is enabled."
msgstr "`sys-front-inj-css` isalin ito kapag `services.css.enabled` ay nagagawa."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`sys-front-inj-javascript` loads `templates/javascript.js.j2` when it exists and otherwise falls back to `files/javascript/javascript.js`."
msgstr "`sys-front-inj-javascript` karga `templates/javascript.js.j2` kapag umiiral ito at kung hindi ay bumabalik sa dati `files/javascript/javascript.js`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`sys-svc-compose` discovers the Dockerfile automatically by checking `templates/Dockerfile.j2` first and then `files/Dockerfile`. Both are rendered through the Ansible `template` module."
msgstr "`sys-svc-compose` Natuklasan ang Dockerfile nang kusa sa pamamagitan ng pagsusuri `templates/Dockerfile.j2` una at pagkatapos `files/Dockerfile`. Parehong isinalin sa pamamagitan ng Ansible `template` module."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`sys-svc-mail-msmtp`: msmtp client and sendmail replacement"
msgstr "`sys-svc-mail-msmtp`: kliyenteng msmtp at palitan ngmail"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`sys-svc-mail`: central mail orchestration"
msgstr "`sys-svc-mail`: orkestra ng koreo"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`sys-token-store` is a lightweight Ansible helper role for **resolving and persisting per-user application tokens** in a unified and idempotent way."
msgstr "`sys-token-store` ay isang magaang na papel na ginagampanan ng katulong **Paglutas at patuloy na paglalapat ng per-user na mga patlang** sa isang nagkakaisang paraan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`sys_token_store_token` (must be non-empty)"
msgstr "`sys_token_store_token` (dapat hindi-walang-sala)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`system_one` puts the choice to [`svc-ai-s1`](../../roles/svc-ai-s1/). The surviving candidates become the options of a single `choice` question and the prompt becomes the state it classifies, so the decision reads what the request is about rather than only how large it is. An option the router did not offer is refused rather than routed to, because the filter excluded the others for a reason."
msgstr "`system_one` sa pagpili [`svc-ai-s1`](../../roles/svc-ai-s1/). Ang mga nakaligtas na kandidato ay nagiging mga pagpipilian ng isahang kandidato `choice` at ang maagap ay nagiging ang estado na inuuri nito, kaya binabasa ng pasiya kung ano ang kahilingan sa halip na kung gaano lamang ito kalaki. Ang isang opsiyon na hindi inaalok ng karter ay tinatanggihan sa halip na binagtas, dahil hindi kasali sa pansala ang iba sa kadahilanan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`system_one` routes to the alias jeff chose, and `weighted` does not read the prompt at all"
msgstr "`system_one` Pinili ang mga ruta sa alyas jeff, at ang mga ruta ay pinili `weighted` ay hindi man lamang nagbabasa agad"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`system_service_run_list` (list): list of systemd unit names to run"
msgstr "`system_service_run_list` (listahan): listahan ng mga systemd unit na pangalan na tatakbo"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tag` (required, e.g. `v1.2.3`)"
msgstr "`tag` (kailangan, e.g. `v1.2.3`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tasks/00_core.yml`: deploy the central stack + wait healthy."
msgstr "`tasks/00_core.yml`: Ilagay ang gitnang salansan + maghintay ng malusog."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tasks/01_init.yml`: **per-consumer provisioning** (create the ACL user / vhost / namespace and its credentials), idempotent, mirroring postgres `01_init`."
msgstr "`tasks/01_init.yml`: **per-consumer na paglalaan** (likhain ang gumagamit ng ACL / vhost / pangalangspace at ang mga kredensiyal nito), idempotente, pagsalamin ng mga postgre `01_init`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` therefore rewrites `curlsecurityblockedhosts` to `MOODLE_EGRESS_BLOCKED_HOSTS` and extends `curlsecurityallowedport` with the port of `MOODLE_LITELLM_CHAT_ENDPOINT` when the `litellm` service is enabled. Loopback, `0.0.0.0` and the cloud metadata address stay blocked; the RFC1918 ranges are opened. The Docker address pool and the bridge gateway that serves the pinned Keycloak authority both live inside them."
msgstr "`tasks/01_manager_ops.yml` samakatuwid ay muling pagsulat `curlsecurityblockedhosts` hanggang sa `MOODLE_EGRESS_BLOCKED_HOSTS` at umaabot `curlsecurityallowedport` kasabay ng daungan `MOODLE_LITELLM_CHAT_ENDPOINT` kapag ang `litellm` Nagagawa ang paglilingkod. Loopback, `0.0.0.0` At ang direksiyon ng metadata ay nananatiling barado; ang RFC1918 ay binubuksan. Ang Docker address pool at ang pintuang - daan ng tulay na nagsisilbi sa pindutan Keycloak Pareho silang nakatira sa loob nila."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tasks/01_restore_key.yml` writes the vaulted files into the volume-backed `HiddenServiceDir` (owner = in-container tor UID, `0700` dir, `0600` secret) before the Tor container starts. Existing on-disk keys are never overwritten."
msgstr "`tasks/01_restore_key.yml` isinulat ang naka-vate na mga files sa volume-backed `HiddenServiceDir` (may-ari = in-container tor UID, `0700` dir, `0600` Sekreto) bago magsimula ang lalagyan ng Tor. Ang pag-iral ng mga on-disk key ay hindi kailanman labis na naisusulat."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tasks/utils/` is the repository's home for unnumbered, includable task files, so the entrypoint carries no step number."
msgstr "`tasks/utils/` ang tahanan ng restoran para sa di - mabilang, di - mapaghihiwalay na mga salansan ng gawain, kaya ang entrancepoint ay walang dalang numero."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tasks/utils/mcp/probe.yml`, which hard-fails the deploy when the hub rejects it"
msgstr "`tasks/utils/mcp/probe.yml`, na hard-fail sa pagluklok kapag tinatanggihan ito ng sentro"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`templates/compose.yml.j2`: its own standalone stack."
msgstr "`templates/compose.yml.j2`: ang sarili nitong salansan ng standalone."

