msgid "`tenant` MUST be passed for tenant-aware per-tenant roles, MUST NOT be passed for global-scope roles or non-tenant apps."
msgstr "`tenant` Ang MUST ay niraranggo para sa tenta-aware per-tenant na mga papel, MUST HINDI ay ipinapasa para sa mga papel na global-scope o non-tenant apps."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`test-bridge-roster.js` probes the Synapse `/_matrix/client/v3/profile/{bot}` endpoint for every enabled bridge and fails on 5xx (skipped when no bridge is enabled)."
msgstr "`test-bridge-roster.js` ang Synapse `/_matrix/client/v3/profile/{bot}` dulo ng bawat yaring tulay at hindi gumagana 5xx (Nalampasan kapag walang tulay na nagawa)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test-element-call.js` opens the Element home view and verifies a call-widget control surfaces when `services.matrix.conferencing.element_call=true` (skipped otherwise)."
msgstr "`test-element-call.js` Binubuksan ang Elementong home view at verify ng isang call-widget control na ibabaw kapag `services.matrix.conferencing.element_call=true` (Lumaban sa ibang paraan)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test-login-ldap-admin.js` — OpenLDAP bind, administrator."
msgstr "`test-login-ldap-admin.js` — OpenLDAP Itali, administrador."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test-login-ldap-biber.js` — OpenLDAP bind, `biber` (non-admin RBAC)."
msgstr "`test-login-ldap-biber.js` — OpenLDAP Itali, `biber` (di-admin RBAC)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test-login-native.js` — administrator native (local password) login; skipped when `sso` is enabled (native login is disabled under OIDC)."
msgstr "`test-login-native.js` — Ang administrador na katutubo (lokal na kontrasenyas) login; Tumalon kapag `sso` ay nagagawa (Nabalda ang katutubong login sa ilalim ng OIDC)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test-login-oidc-admin.js` — OIDC via Keycloak, administrator."
msgstr "`test-login-oidc-admin.js` — OIDC via Keycloak, administrador."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test-login-oidc-biber.js` — OIDC via Keycloak, `biber` (non-admin RBAC)."
msgstr "`test-login-oidc-biber.js` — OIDC via Keycloak, `biber` (di-admin RBAC)."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test-oidc-login.js` and `test-guest.js` in each agent's `files/playwright/`"
msgstr "`test-oidc-login.js` at `test-guest.js` sa bawat agent `files/playwright/`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test.sh` runs two different passes, selected by `ASYNC_ENABLED`. The snapshot probe runs first in both, because it depends on nothing the backup produces."
msgstr "`test.sh` tumatakbo ng dalawang magkaibang daanan, pinipili ng `ASYNC_ENABLED`. Ang snap probe ang una sa dalawang ito, sapagkat ito'y depende sa kung ano ang nagagawa ng backup."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_dotted_path_keys_exist.py` validates that every Jinja dotted path (`FOO.BAR.BAZ`) whose head is in `group_vars/all/` or the consuming role's own `vars`/`defaults` resolves to an existing key in that dict tree, catching typos / renamed / removed sub-keys. Per-line suppression: `# nocheck: dotted-path`."
msgstr "`test_dotted_path_keys_exist.py` Pinatutunayan nito na ang bawat daanan ng Jinja ay nakakalat (`FOO.BAR.BAZ`) na ang ulo ay nasa `group_vars/all/` o ang sariling papel `vars`/`defaults` ay nagpapasiya sa isang umiiral na susi sa puno ng dict na iyon, nanghuhuli ng typos / muling pinanganlang / tinanggal na mga sub-key. Pagpigil sa Per-line: `# nocheck: dotted-path`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_e2e_playwright_only_roles` (default: `lookup('deployment').running`, every role the round deploys, dependencies included)"
msgstr "`test_e2e_playwright_only_roles` (default: `lookup('deployment').running`, ang bawat bahagi ay nasa bilog na mga gamit, kalakip ang dependencies)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_e2e_playwright_skip_roles` (default: `[]`)"
msgstr "`test_e2e_playwright_skip_roles` (default: `[]`)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_network_create_via_util.py` requires that role tasks creating Docker networks route through the shared utility, never inline `community.docker.docker_network` calls."
msgstr "`test_network_create_via_util.py` na ang papel na ginagampanan ay lumikha ng mga Docker network na dumaraan sa pinagsaluhang kagamitan, hindi kailanman naka - inline `community.docker.docker_network` mga tawag."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_inline_multiline_sql.py` caps inline multi-line SQL in Ansible tasks at three lines. Larger statements MUST live in a dedicated `.sql` file under the role's `files/` directory and be loaded explicitly so linters, formatters, and database tooling can operate on them."
msgstr "`test_no_inline_multiline_sql.py` caps inline multi-line SQL sa Ansible works sa tatlong linya. Mas malalaking pangungusap ang UST ay nabubuhay sa isang inialay `.sql` talaksan sa ilalim ng papel `files/` Ang direktoryo at tuwirang ikarga upang gumana ang mga linter, formatter, at kagamitang database."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_jinja_default_on_spot_path.py` forbids `| default(...)` on Jinja expressions whose path resolves via `group_vars/all/*.yml`. Those keys are loaded unconditionally, so the default is dead code at best and silent SPOT decoupling at worst. Per-line suppression: `# nocheck: spot-default`."
msgstr "`test_no_jinja_default_on_spot_path.py` Ipinagbabawal `| default(...)` sa mga pananalita ni Jinja na ang landas ay maayos `group_vars/all/*.yml`. Ang mga susing iyon ay walang kondisyong nakakarga, kaya ang default ay walang bisa at tahimik na SPOT na naka-coupling sa pinakamasama. Pagpigil sa Per-line: `# nocheck: spot-default`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_legacy_get_url_module_usage.py` forbids the unqualified `get_url:` module name; tasks MUST use `ansible.builtin.get_url`."
msgstr "`test_no_legacy_get_url_module_usage.py` Ipinagbabawal ang Di - kuwalipikado `get_url:` Pangalan ng module; atas na gamit ng MUST `ansible.builtin.get_url`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_legacy_uri_module_usage.py` forbids the unqualified `uri:` module name; tasks MUST use `ansible.builtin.uri`."
msgstr "`test_no_legacy_uri_module_usage.py` Ipinagbabawal ang Di - kuwalipikado `uri:` Pangalan ng module; atas na gamit ng MUST `ansible.builtin.uri`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_literal_no_log.py` forbids literal `no_log: true` / `no_log: false`; every gate MUST flow through the `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS` variable."
msgstr "`test_no_literal_no_log.py` Ipinagbabawal nang literal `no_log: true` / `no_log: false`; bawat pintuang - daan ng MUST ay dumadaloy sa `MASK_CREDENTIALS_IN_LOGS` Iba - iba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_lookup_config_jinja_default.py` forbids `lookup('config', application_id, 'path') | default(X)`. The two-term `config` lookup raises on a missing key, so the Jinja `default(...)` filter never fires; the fallback MUST be passed as the lookup's third argument instead."
msgstr "`test_no_lookup_config_jinja_default.py` Ipinagbabawal `lookup('config', application_id, 'path') | default(X)`. Ang dalawang-term `config` Ang pagtanaw sa nawawalang susi, kaya ang Jinja `default(...)` Ang filter ay hindi kailanman nag-apoy; ang fallback na MUST ay ireresulta bilang ang ikatlong argumento ng hitsura sa halip."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_redundant_default_on_module_io.py` forbids `| default(...)` on a task's own `register:` output or input arguments inside its own conditionals, where the value is provably set."
msgstr "`test_no_redundant_default_on_module_io.py` Ipinagbabawal `| default(...)` sa isang atas `register:` output o input argumento sa loob ng sarili nitong mga kondisyonal, kung saan ang halaga ay tiyak na nakatakda."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_sh_lc_pipefail.py` requires that every `sh -lc '...'` invocation containing a `|` pipeline starts with `set -o pipefail`, so failures mid-pipeline propagate."
msgstr "`test_no_sh_lc_pipefail.py` na bawat isa `sh -lc '...'` Pagmamakaawa na naglalaman ng isang `|` Nagsisimula ang tubo sa `set -o pipefail`, kaya ang mga kabiguan mid-pipeline na pagkalat."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_no_sh_pipefail_in_ansible_tasks.py` requires that Ansible `shell:` tasks stay on Bash and use Bash's `set -o pipefail` form, not the POSIX-`sh` workaround."
msgstr "`test_no_sh_pipefail_in_ansible_tasks.py` ay humihiling na Maging Makatuwiran `shell:` Ang mga atas ay nananatili sa Bash at gumagamit ng Bash's `set -o pipefail` anyo, hindi ang EXX-`sh` Pagkukumpuni."

# translated-by: libretranslate
#, python-brace-format
msgid "`test_role_and_group_vars_used.py` scans top-level keys of `roles/<role>/{vars,defaults}/main.yml` and `group_vars/**/*.yml` against every project `.yml` / `.yaml` / `.j2` file. The suppression rule key is `unused-var` (see [suppression.md](../../../../docs/contributing/actions/testing/suppression.md))."
msgstr "`test_role_and_group_vars_used.py` Sinusuri ang itaas-level keys ng `roles/<role>/{vars,defaults}/main.yml` at `group_vars/**/*.yml` laban sa bawat proyekto `.yml` / `.yaml` / `.j2` talaksan. Ang susi sa pagsugpo ay ang pamamahala `unused-var` (tingnan [suppression.md](../../../../docs/contributing/actions/testing/suppression.md))."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_run_once_tags.py` requires that every `set_fact` marked `run_once: true` carries the canonical run-once tags so re-runs and `--tags` filters keep the fact populated."
msgstr "`test_run_once_tags.py` na bawat isa `set_fact` Markahan `run_once: true` nagdadala ng kanonikal na run-on tags kaya re-runs at `--tags` Ang mga panala ay nagpapanatili sa katotohanan na maraming tao."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_sed_escape.py` requires that any Jinja-templated replacement passed to `sed` flows through the `sed_escape` filter so substitutions with regex metacharacters land literally."
msgstr "`test_sed_escape.py` kailangan ang anumang Jinja-templated replacement na ipinasa sa `sed` dumadaloy sa pamamagitan ng `sed_escape` Ang filter ay kahalili ng regex metacharacters."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_service_shared_consistency.py` enforces that every service whose `meta/services.yml` entry marks it `shared: true` exposes the required role-side bindings, and the inverse: a role consuming the shared form MUST declare the corresponding flag in its `meta/services.yml`."
msgstr "`test_service_shared_consistency.py` ay nagpapatupad ng bawat paglilingkod na kanino `meta/services.yml` ang marka nito `shared: true` ay naglalantad sa kinakailangang mga papel-side conveants, at ang inverse: isang papel na kumukunsumo sa kabahaging anyo na MUST ay nagpapahayag ng katumbas na bandila sa loob nito `meta/services.yml`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`test_vars_usage_in_yaml.py` scans task-level `vars:` blocks against the same consumer set. The two scanners never overlap because their declaration shapes differ."
msgstr "`test_vars_usage_in_yaml.py` Sinusuri ang task-level `vars:` mga bloke laban sa iisang set ng mamimili. Ang dalawang scanner ay hindi kailanman nagsasanib sapagkat ang kanilang mga hugis ng deklarasyon ay magkaiba."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tests/lint/...`                           collision/band checks"
msgstr "`tests/lint/...` Pagbangga/based na mga tseke"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tests/lint/ansible/roles/meta/test_unpinned_no_engine_volume.py` stays as the guard: an unpinned role must not declare an engine on-disk data volume."
msgstr "`tests/lint/ansible/roles/meta/test_unpinned_no_engine_volume.py` manatili bilang bantay: ang isang papel na hindi naiinip ay hindi dapat magdeklara ng makinang on-disk data volume."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tls.py`/`tls_common`: onion branch + app-level flavor override + unit tests."
msgstr "`tls.py`/`tls_common`: Ang sibuyas na sanga + app-level na lasa ay dumadaig sa + unit tests."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tls` reads `external` and `TLS_ENABLED`."
msgstr "`tls` basahin `external` at `TLS_ENABLED`."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tool_objectfs` object-file-storage plugin"
msgstr "`tool_objectfs` bagay-file-storage plagin"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`tools/list` returns 10 tools: entity control (`HassTurnOn`, `HassTurnOff`), timers, broadcast, to-do list read and write, date and time, and `GetLiveContext` for the current state."
msgstr "`tools/list` bumalik 10 mga kasangkapan: kontrol sa entity (`HassTurnOn`, `HassTurnOff`), timers, broadcast, to-do list basahin at isulat, petsa at oras, at `GetLiveContext` para sa kasalukuyang kalagayan."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`transport` MUST default to `streamable_http` for server deployments. Stdio MAY exist only for local development and MUST NOT be enabled in a deployed web role by default."
msgstr "`transport` Hindi pagtupad sa MUST `streamable_http` para sa mga kagamitang server. Si Stdio ay maaaring umiiral lamang para sa lokal na pag-unlad at ang MUST HINDI ay maaaring magkaroon ng isang naka-set na papel na web sa pamamagitan ng default."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`transport` accepts `streamable_http` and `sse` only. A stdio MCP server is a local process the client spawns, so it inherits the client container's filesystem and network with no endpoint to authenticate, no proxy to route through, and nothing for a probe to reach. Every property the other rules rely on (`auth`, `exposure`, `endpoint`) is undefined for it. Clients that support stdio are pinned away from it in their own role: Flowise sets `CUSTOM_MCP_PROTOCOL=sse` so no flow can spawn a command."
msgstr "`transport` tanggapin `streamable_http` at `sse` Tanging. Ang isang stdio MCP server ay isang lokal na proseso na ginagawa ng kliyente, kaya't nagmamana ito ng filesystem at network ng kliyente na walang endpoint upang maging kapani-paniwala, walang proxy na tatawirin, at walang maaaring maabot na probe. Bawat ari - arian na inaasahan ng ibang mga alituntunin (`auth`, `exposure`, `endpoint`) ay hindi binibigyang - kahulugan. Ang mga kalahok na sumusuporta sa stdio ay inilalayo mula rito sa kanilang sariling papel: Ang mga set ng Flight `CUSTOM_MCP_PROTOCOL=sse` Kaya walang daloy ang makapagdudulot ng utos."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` (case-insensitive)"
msgstr "`true` (-insensitive)"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` = baseline install contract: always installed, MAY omit `enabled`, MUST NOT set `enabled: false`. Also gates install-failure: a failed `required: true` addon hard-fails the play; a failed `required: false` addon warns, is skipped, and the play continues."
msgstr "`true` = baseline install kontrata: laging naka-install, maaaring wala `enabled`, HINDI NA kailangan `enabled: false`. Mayroon ding mga tarangkahang naka-install-failure: bigo `required: true` Addon hard-fails ang dula; bigo ang isang `required: false` Ang addon ay nagbababala, hindi kumikilos, at ang dula ay nagpapatuloy."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` if the host is in the `web-app-mailu` group, else `false`"
msgstr "`true` kung ang punong - abala ay nasa `web-app-mailu` grupo, iba pa `false`"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` or `false`; appends `--debug` when true"
msgstr "`true` o `false`; pampagana `--debug` kapag totoo"

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`true` stops an agent after `idle_minutes` without a request; `false` keeps it running"
