# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "`~/.ssh` is intentionally **not** in this list. Denying it would make `git push` over SSH unreachable and defeat the `Bash(git push*)` ask-gate. The trade-off and its mitigations are documented in [security.md](security.md#assumption-10-ssh-is-intentionally-readable-to-allow-git-push-on-ask-) (Assumption 10)."
msgstr "`~/.ssh` sadyang **hindi** sa talaang ito. Magiging mabisa ang pag - aalis nito `git push` labis na SSH Hindi maabot at matalo ang `Bash(git push*)` tanong-gate. Ang trade-off at ang mga midya nito ay dokumentado sa [security.md](security.md#assumption-10-ssh-is-intentionally-readable-to-allow-git-push-on-ask-) (Pag - aasawa 10)."

