# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's `mod_admin` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "ejabberd's `mod_admin` Ang HTTP UI ang tanging Playwright-testable na ibabaw; XMPP client login mismo ang tumatakbo sa ibabaw ng ibabaw 5222/5269 at UST gamitin ng isang XMPP-ware client sa labas ng Playwright test loop."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Ang tanging HTTP na ibabaw ng ejabberd ay `ejabberd_web_admin` patuloy `/admin` (tingnan [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). Ito ay nagpapatunay sa isang walang laman na JID laban sa LDAP sa HTTP Basic, kaya't walang Keycloak I-redirect upang sundan at walang in-app logout control upang mag- click; ang client realation mismo ay tumatakbo sa mga daungan 5222/5269 at manatili sa labas ng loop ng Playwright, gaya ng binabanggit sa ilalim ng Watch Points. `acl.admin` Karagdagang itinala lamang ang administrador na JID, kaya ang web admin ay tahasang tumatanggi sa bawat iba pang account. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) samakatuwid ay ipahayag `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` at `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; ang `guest` ang sabi ng tao at ng baseline cantableally."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "Mga ejabberdim ``mod_admin`` Ang HTTP UI ang tanging Playwright-testable na ibabaw; XMPP client login mismo ang tumatakbo sa ibabaw ng ibabaw 5222/5269 at UST gamitin ng isang XMPP-ware client sa labas ng Playwright test loop."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s only HTTP surface is ``ejabberd_web_admin`` on ``/admin`` (see ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Ang ejabberdiks na HTTP lamang ang ibabaw ay ``ejabberd_web_admin`` patuloy ``/admin`` (tingnan ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` ang sabi ng tao at ng baseline cantableally."

